('Copywriting', 'copywriting', '✒️', 'digital', 'Write sales pages, email sequences, ads, and landing pages for businesses. Copywriters who can sell in words are among the highest-paid freelancers on earth — one sales page can earn $500–$5,000.', 3000, 120000, 'week', 'intermediate', 0, '["USD Income", "High Ticket", "Remote", "Google Docs", "Hemingway App", "Upwork", "LinkedIn", "ConvertKit"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Study copywriting fundamentals: read Ogilvy on Advertising and Ca$hvertising", "Build a swipe file of 50 great ads and sales pages \\u2014 study what makes them work", "Write 5 spec samples in different niches (health, SaaS, e-commerce, finance, coaching)", "Cold pitch digital agencies, course creators, and e-commerce brands on Upwork and LinkedIn", "Niche down: email copywriters earn more than generalists \\u2014 pick a specialisation"]', 0),
('SEO Consulting', 'seo-consulting', '🔍', 'digital', 'Help businesses rank on Google and get free organic traffic. One SEO client on retainer pays $500–$3,000/month. Master keyword research, on-page SEO, and link building — and businesses will pay you monthly forever.', 5000, 200000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Recurring Income", "USD", "Remote", "Ahrefs", "SEMrush", "Google Search Console", "Screaming Frog", "SurferSEO"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Learn SEO fundamentals free: Ahrefs YouTube, Moz Beginner Guide, Search Engine Journal", "Get certified: Google Search Console, SEMrush Academy (free certs)", "Run an SEO audit on a local business website for free \\u2014 use it as your case study", "Pitch to 20 local businesses per week: \\"I found 5 SEO problems hurting your Google ranking\\"", "Land first retainer at $300/month, deliver results, raise to $1,000+ in 90 days"]', 0),
('Web Development', 'web-development', '💻', 'digital', 'Build websites and web apps for clients globally. Nigerian web developers earn $2k–$10k/month on Upwork. HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and React are the four skills that unlock a six-figure remote career.', 6000, 180000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["USD Income", "High Demand", "Remote", "VS Code", "GitHub", "freeCodeCamp", "Upwork", "Netlify"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Learn HTML + CSS in 2 weeks free on freeCodeCamp.org", "Add JavaScript fundamentals (4 weeks) then React (4 weeks)", "Build 3 portfolio projects: a portfolio site, a to-do app, and a landing page for a fake business", "Create Upwork and Fiverr profiles \\u2014 attach GitHub with your projects", "Apply to 10 jobs daily on Upwork \\u2014 tailor every proposal to the client\'s specific problem"]', 0),
('UI/UX Design', 'ui-ux-design', '🎯', 'digital', 'Design beautiful, user-friendly apps and websites. Companies pay $2k–$10k per project for great UI/UX. Figma is free, demand is massive, and Nigerian designers are winning global contracts.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["USD Income", "Creative", "Remote", "Figma", "Maze", "Behance", "Dribbble", "Notion"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Learn Figma (free) \\u2014 complete \\"Figma for Beginners\\" YouTube course in one week", "Study UX principles: user flows, wireframing, prototyping, usability testing", "Redesign 3 popular Nigerian apps (show before/after) as your portfolio", "Post your redesigns on Dribbble, Behance, and LinkedIn \\u2014 this attracts clients", "Pitch to startups and agencies on LinkedIn with a single portfolio link"]', 0),
('Voiceover Artist', 'voiceover-artist', '🎙️', 'digital', 'Record professional voiceovers for YouTube videos, ads, audiobooks, e-learning courses, and corporate presentations. A great voice + a quiet room + a decent mic = $500–$5,000/month income.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 15000, '["USD Income", "Passive", "Unique Skill", "Audacity (free)", "Adobe Audition", "Voices.com", "Fiverr", "ACX (Amazon audiobooks)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Record your voice on phone \\u2014 assess your natural tone, clarity, and pace", "Buy a basic USB condenser mic (\\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a625k) and record in a closet for sound treatment", "Create a 90-second demo reel with 4 different styles: corporate, conversational, dramatic, educational", "Open profiles on Voices.com, Voice123, Fiverr, and Backstage", "Pitch e-learning companies, YouTube channel owners, and advertising agencies directly"]', 0),
('Podcast Editing & Production', 'podcast-editing', '🎧', 'digital', 'Edit podcast episodes for busy podcasters — cut out ums, add intros/outros, level audio, and publish on Spotify. With 4 million+ podcasts globally, demand for good editors is enormous and growing.', 2000, 50000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Recurring Income", "USD", "Remote", "Descript", "Audacity", "Riverside.fm", "Fiverr", "Headliner"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Learn Audacity or Descript (free tier) \\u2014 edit your own fake podcast episode as practice", "Offer to edit 3 podcast episodes for free for small podcasters (under 1,000 listeners)", "Create before/after audio samples showing your cleanup quality", "Pitch on Fiverr, Upwork, and in Facebook podcast communities", "Upsell: show notes writing, transcript creation, social media audiograms \\u2014 triple your income"]', 0),
('Email Marketing Management', 'email-marketing', '📧', 'digital', 'Manage email lists and campaigns for businesses. Email generates $42 for every $1 spent — making email marketers some of the most valuable contractors. Businesses pay $500–$3,000/month just to send emails correctly.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Recurring Income", "USD", "High ROI", "ConvertKit", "Klaviyo", "Mailchimp", "Beehiiv", "ActiveCampaign"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Learn ConvertKit, Mailchimp, and Klaviyo (all have free plans)", "Study email marketing: sequences, segmentation, open rates, A/B testing subject lines", "Audit a business\'s existing email list for free and show them what\'s broken", "Offer a full email welcome sequence (5 emails) as a paid project \\u2014 charge \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6150k", "Grow to managing newsletters, promotional campaigns, and automated flows on retainer"]', 0),
('AI Automation & Workflow Building', 'ai-automation', '🤖', 'ai', 'Build automated workflows using AI and no-code tools for businesses. Zapier, Make, and n8n can automate any repetitive business task — and companies pay $1k–$10k for one automation build.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["USD Income", "Future-Proof", "High Demand", "Zapier", "Make.com", "n8n", "Airtable", "OpenAI API"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Learn Zapier free tier and build 10 sample automations in different industries", "Learn Make.com (more powerful, free tier) for complex multi-step workflows", "Build case studies: \\"I saved this business 20 hours/week with this automation\\"", "Pitch on Upwork under \\"Zapier Expert\\" or \\"Automation Consultant\\" \\u2014 high demand, low competition", "Retainer model: charge $500\\u2013$2,000/month to maintain and expand automations"]', 0),
('Notion / Productivity Consulting', 'notion-consulting', '📋', 'digital', 'Build custom Notion workspaces, dashboards, and databases for entrepreneurs and teams. Notion consultants charge $200–$2,000 per build. Sell templates on Gumroad for passive income on the side.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["No Capital", "USD Income", "Remote", "Notion", "Gumroad", "Fiverr", "Twitter/X", "Loom"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Master Notion in 2 weeks \\u2014 build your own life OS as a portfolio piece", "Create 3 Notion templates: a business CRM, a content calendar, and a project tracker", "List templates on Gumroad for $9\\u2013$29 each \\u2014 promote on TikTok and Twitter", "Offer custom Notion builds on Fiverr starting at $99", "Pitch to startup founders and coaches on Twitter/LinkedIn who complain about productivity"]', 0),
('Virtual Assistant (Executive VA)', 'virtual-assistant', '📁', 'digital', 'Manage calendars, emails, social media, research, and admin tasks for busy executives and entrepreneurs. Top VAs earn $1,500–$5,000/month working remotely for US and UK clients who value their time.', 4000, 80000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["USD Income", "Recurring", "No Capital", "Google Workspace", "Slack", "Trello", "Notion", "Calendly"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["List your skills: email management, calendar scheduling, data entry, research, social media posting", "Create profiles on Belay, Time Etc, Fancy Hands, Upwork, and LinkedIn", "Apply to 15\\u201320 VA job posts daily \\u2014 tailor each application with specific examples", "Offer a 2-hour trial task for $10 to show your quality before signing a monthly contract", "Specialise: executive VA, e-commerce VA, real estate VA, or podcast VA earns 2x general VA rates"]', 0),
('Online Tutoring (Academic)', 'online-tutoring', '📚', 'digital', 'Teach students globally via Zoom or dedicated tutoring platforms. Math, science, English, coding, and SAT/GMAT prep tutors earn $20–$80/hour. Nigerian tutors with strong subject knowledge are in high demand.', 2000, 50000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["No Capital", "Steady Income", "Flexible", "Zoom", "Google Classroom", "Khan Academy", "Preply", "Tutor.com"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Identify your strongest subject: math, chemistry, English, economics, coding, SAT/GMAT", "Create profiles on Tutor.com, Wyzant, Preply, Italki (for languages), or Superprof", "Set your rate 20% below market average to build reviews fast \\u2014 raise after 10 sessions", "Offer a free 30-minute trial session \\u2014 convert to recurring weekly bookings", "Create group classes (4\\u20138 students) to earn more per hour with the same effort"]', 0),
('Translation & Interpretation Services', 'translation-services', '🌐', 'digital', 'Translate documents, websites, legal papers, and subtitles between languages. Nigerian translators fluent in French, Yoruba, Igbo, Hausa, Arabic, or Pidgin earn $0.05–$0.20 per word — a 5,000-word document earns $250–$1,000.', 3000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["USD Income", "Language Skill", "Remote", "SDL Trados", "DeepL Pro", "ProZ.com", "Gengo", "Upwork"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Assess your language pairs \\u2014 French-English, Arabic-English, and Yoruba-English are high-demand", "Create profiles on ProZ.com, TranslatorsCafe, Gengo, and Upwork", "Start with document translation \\u2014 build 5 sample translations in your niche (legal, medical, technical)", "Specialise: legal and medical translators earn 3x general translators", "Add subtitling and interpretation services to increase your income per client"]', 0),
('Data Entry & Data Processing', 'data-entry', '⌨️', 'digital', 'Enter, clean, organise, and process data for businesses. No degree required — just speed, accuracy, and internet. Thousands of companies outsource data entry to Nigeria every day at $5–$25/hour.', 1500, 25000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["No Skill Needed", "Daily Income", "Beginner", "Google Sheets", "Microsoft Excel", "Upwork", "Clickworker", "Fiverr"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Practice typing speed to 50+ WPM using Typing.com or Keybr.com (free)", "Learn Excel and Google Sheets basics \\u2014 most data jobs require spreadsheet skills", "Create profiles on Upwork, Fiverr, Clickworker, and Amazon Mechanical Turk", "Apply to 20+ data entry gigs daily \\u2014 early reviews are critical for ranking", "Upgrade to data analysis after 3 months \\u2014 doubles your earning potential immediately"]', 0),
('Proofreading & Editing', 'proofreading', '🔎', 'digital', 'Proofread and edit academic papers, books, blog posts, and business documents. Publishers and authors pay $0.01–$0.05 per word — a 50,000-word book earns $500–$2,500 for one project.', 2000, 40000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["No Capital", "Flexible", "Remote", "Grammarly Pro", "PerfectIt", "Microsoft Word", "Reedsy", "Upwork"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Get certified free: Proofread Anywhere free workshop, Coursera grammar courses", "Build a portfolio: proofread 3 sample documents (blog post, academic paper, business email)", "Create profiles on Upwork, Fiverr, Reedsy, and ProofreadingPal", "Specialise in one niche: academic proofreading, legal documents, or fiction manuscripts", "Use PerfectIt and Grammarly Pro as tools \\u2014 but never rely on AI alone, clients want human eyes"]', 0),
('Resume & LinkedIn Profile Writing', 'resume-writing', '📄', 'digital', 'Write professional CVs, cover letters, and LinkedIn profiles for job seekers. People pay ₦10k–₦150k for a resume that gets them interviews — and thousands of Nigerians need this every single month.', 1500, 40000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["No Capital", "Quick Turnaround", "High Demand", "Canva", "Microsoft Word", "LinkedIn", "Google Docs", "Typeform"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Study the anatomy of ATS-optimised resumes \\u2014 75% of resumes are rejected by bots before human eyes", "Build 5 sample resumes across industries: tech, finance, healthcare, marketing, engineering", "Open a WhatsApp Business account and advertise in Nigerian job-seeker groups", "Charge \\u20a610k for entry-level, \\u20a630k for mid-level, \\u20a680k+ for executive resumes", "Upsell: LinkedIn optimisation, cover letter, and interview coaching as a \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6150k package"]', 0),
('Bookkeeping & Accounting Services', 'bookkeeping', '📊', 'digital', 'Manage financial records, invoicing, payroll, and tax prep for small businesses. Every business needs a bookkeeper but most can\'t afford a full-time accountant — they outsource at $300–$1,500/month.', 4000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Recurring Income", "USD", "Professional", "QuickBooks", "Xero", "Wave", "FreshBooks", "Expensify"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Get certified: QuickBooks ProAdvisor certification is free and very valuable", "Learn Xero and Wave Accounting \\u2014 both are used widely by international SMEs", "Offer free 3-month bookkeeping to one local business to build a real case study", "Create an Upwork profile with \\"Certified QuickBooks ProAdvisor\\" in your title", "Start at $150/month per client \\u2014 scale to 10 clients for $1,500/month passive income"]', 0),
('Drop Servicing (Service Arbitrage)', 'dropservicing', '🔄', 'digital', 'Sell a service at a high price, outsource it to a cheaper freelancer, and keep the margin. Example: sell a logo design for $150 on your website, pay a Fiverr freelancer $30, keep $120 profit. Pure arbitrage.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 10000, '["No Skills Needed", "Scalable", "USD Income", "Carrd", "Fiverr", "Upwork", "Stripe", "Trello"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Choose a service niche: logo design, video editing, SEO, web development, copywriting", "Find reliable Fiverr/Upwork freelancers who deliver quality at low cost \\u2014 test 3 before committing", "Build a simple service website on Carrd or Wix listing your service at 3\\u20135x what you pay", "Run Facebook/Instagram ads or cold email to drive buyers to your site", "Once a client pays, outsource to your freelancer \\u2014 manage delivery, collect the margin"]', 0),
('Stock Photography & Video', 'stock-photography', '📷', 'digital', 'Upload photos and videos to Shutterstock, Getty, and Adobe Stock and earn every time someone downloads your work. Nigerian street scenes, food, culture, and faces are massively underrepresented — huge demand.', 500, 30000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Passive Income", "Creative", "Phone Works", "Shutterstock", "Adobe Stock", "Lightroom Mobile", "Canva", "Getty Images"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Create accounts on Shutterstock, Adobe Stock, Getty Images (iStock), and Alamy", "Shoot 100 high-quality images in your first week \\u2014 focus on Nigerian street life, food, and people", "Add detailed keywords and descriptions to every image \\u2014 searchability = sales", "Upload consistently: 50+ images/month is the threshold for meaningful income growth", "Shoot vertical 4K video clips \\u2014 video footage earns 5x per download vs photos"]', 0),
('App & Website Testing (QA)', 'app-testing', '📱', 'digital', 'Get paid to test websites and apps for usability issues. Companies need real users to click through their products and report bugs — they pay $10–$60 per test, and each test takes 15–30 minutes.', 500, 15000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["No Capital", "Easy Start", "Flexible", "UserTesting", "Respondent.io", "uTest", "TryMyUI", "Testbirds"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Sign up for UserTesting, TryMyUI, Testbirds, Respondent.io, and uTest \\u2014 all free", "Complete your tester profile fully \\u2014 the more complete, the more tests you qualify for", "Record screen + voice while testing \\u2014 give specific, actionable feedback", "Apply to uTest for paid bug bounty testing \\u2014 earns significantly more per hour", "Scale: qualified testers on Respondent earn $50\\u2013$200 for 1-hour research sessions"]', 0),
('Online Arbitrage (Retail Flipping)', 'online-arbitrage', '🛒', 'digital', 'Buy discounted products from Jumia, AliExpress, and clearance sales then resell at profit on other platforms. Arbitrage traders make ₦5k–₦50k profit per item by exploiting price differences between markets.', 3000, 100000, 'week', 'intermediate', 20000, '["Daily Cash", "Scalable", "Trending", "Jumia", "AliExpress", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack", "Excel tracker"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Research: find products with 2x+ price difference between Jumia and WhatsApp/Instagram markets", "Start small: flip 5 items to test your market and delivery systems", "Use Jumia flash sales and AliExpress deals as sourcing opportunities", "Build a WhatsApp broadcast list of buyers \\u2014 announce new stock daily", "Add value: bundle products, improve packaging, and offer better customer service than competitors"]', 0),
('Domain Name Flipping', 'domain-flipping', '🌐', 'digital', 'Buy cheap domain names and sell them for 10x–100x profit. A domain bought for $10 can sell for $1,000–$100,000 if it contains a valuable keyword. Domain investors earn passive income holding and selling digital real estate.', 2000, 200000, 'month', 'intermediate', 10, '["Passive", "Scalable", "Global", "Namecheap", "GoDaddy Auctions", "Sedo", "Flippa", "Estibot (valuation)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Study domain valuation: short .com domains, keyword-rich domains, and brandable names sell best", "Use Namecheap or GoDaddy to buy domains for $1\\u2013$12/year during sales", "Search expired domains on GoDaddy Auctions and Sedo \\u2014 some have existing traffic and backlinks", "List your domains on Sedo, Flippa, Afternic, and Dan.com for passive sale inquiries", "Research trending industries: AI, crypto, fintech, wellness \\u2014 buy domains before the hype"]', 0),
('Content Writing Agency', 'content-writing-agency', '📝', 'digital', 'Build a small content agency: get clients at $500–$5,000/month, hire Nigerian writers at ₦5k–₦15k/article, keep the margin. One agency with 5 clients billing $2,000 each = $10,000/month revenue.', 5000, 200000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Scalable", "Recurring", "USD Income", "Trello", "Notion", "Google Docs", "Slack", "Payoneer"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Start as a solo writer \\u2014 land 3 recurring clients paying $500/month each", "Hire your first writer on Upwork or from Nigerian Facebook writer groups at \\u20a65k/article", "Build an editorial SOP: brief template, style guide, revision process, delivery system", "Use Trello or Notion to manage multiple writers and client projects simultaneously", "Raise your client prices as you deliver consistent quality \\u2014 agencies bill 3x what freelancers charge"]', 0),
('Car Wash & Auto Detailing', 'car-wash-detailing', '🚗', 'trade', 'Offer mobile or fixed-location car washing and detailing. Detailing (interior deep clean + exterior polish) earns ₦5k–₦30k per car. In Lagos and Abuja, car owners pay without hesitation for quality.', 2000, 50000, 'day', 'beginner', 15000, '["Daily Cash", "Low Capital", "High Demand", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack", "Instagram", "Google Maps listing", "Canva (for flyers)"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy basic supplies: pressure washer (\\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a630k), soap, microfibre cloths, interior cleaners", "Start at home or in your street \\u2014 offer to wash neighbours\' cars first to build word of mouth", "Create WhatsApp flyer and share in your estate and neighbourhood groups", "Offer mobile detailing: go to clients\' homes/offices at \\u20a62k\\u2013\\u20a65k premium", "Upsell ceramic coating (\\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a6100k) once you have experience \\u2014 this is where real money is"]', 0),
('Professional Cleaning Service', 'cleaning-service', '🧹', 'trade', 'Clean homes, offices, event venues, and estates. Nigerian cleaning service companies earn ₦500k–₦3m/month with just 3–5 staff. A single office cleaning contract at ₦150k/month is life-changing income.', 2000, 60000, 'week', 'beginner', 20000, '["Recurring Income", "Low Capital", "High Demand", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack", "CAC registration", "Canva", "Google Maps"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register your business name at CAC (\\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a625k) \\u2014 corporate clients require this", "Buy cleaning supplies: mop, vacuum, floor polisher, detergents (\\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a640k starting kit)", "Target: post-event cleaning, estate management offices, corporate offices, new homes", "Price: \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k for a home deep clean, \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a6100k for office monthly contracts", "Hire 2 cleaners as you grow \\u2014 manage and sell while they clean"]', 0),
('Phone Accessories & Gadgets Reselling', 'phone-accessories', '📱', 'trade', 'Buy phone cases, chargers, earphones, and power banks from Alaba, Computer Village, or AliExpress and resell at 2–4x markup. Every Nigerian owns a phone — accessories are consumed and broken constantly.', 1500, 40000, 'day', 'beginner', 10000, '["Low Capital", "Daily Cash", "High Demand", "WhatsApp Business", "Instagram", "OPay/Paystack", "AliExpress", "Canva"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Source from Computer Village (Lagos), Alaba Market, or AliExpress in bulk at wholesale prices", "Start with fast movers: phone cases, Type-C cables, earphones, and screen protectors", "Sell at school gates, offices, markets, or on Instagram and WhatsApp", "Offer phone screen protection fitting as a service \\u2014 earn \\u20a6500\\u2013\\u20a61,500 per phone on the spot", "Scale to a kiosk in a mall or busy junction \\u2014 rent is \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a680k/month, profit is 3\\u20135x"]', 0),
('Hair Braiding & Styling', 'hair-braiding', '💇', 'trade', 'Braid, weave, and style hair from home or mobile. A skilled braider does 2–3 heads per day at ₦5k–₦30k each. Nigerian women spend more on hair than any other personal care — the market is permanent.', 2000, 50000, 'day', 'beginner', 5000, '["Daily Cash", "No Capital", "High Demand", "Instagram", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack", "Ring light (\\u20a65k)", "Canva"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Practice advanced braiding styles: knotless, faux locs, goddess braids, and cornrows", "Set up a home studio with a proper chair, lighting, and a clean background for photos", "Create an Instagram page documenting every client\'s result \\u2014 hair portfolios go viral easily", "Charge per style: knotless from \\u20a610k, faux locs from \\u20a615k, goddess braids from \\u20a620k", "Upsell: hair accessories, hair treatments, and eyebrow threading/shaping"]', 0),
('Tailoring & Fashion Design', 'tailoring-fashion', '🪡', 'trade', 'Sew custom outfits, aso-ebi, uniforms, and streetwear. A skilled tailor making 3 outfits per week at ₦15k–₦80k each earns ₦180k–₦960k/month. Aso-ebi season alone can generate ₦500k+ in 2 weeks.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 30000, '["Creative", "Scalable", "Recurring Income", "Instagram", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack", "Canva (for flyers)", "Pinterest (for inspiration)"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Build your portfolio: sew 10 impressive outfits and photograph them professionally", "Create an Instagram page \\u2014 Nigerian fashion Instagram accounts grow very fast with good work", "Join aso-ebi WhatsApp groups in your city \\u2014 announce your services every week", "Approach churches, schools, and corporate organisations for uniform contracts (bulk orders = stable income)", "Offer delivery within your city \\u2014 charge \\u20a6500\\u2013\\u20a62,000 extra and outsource if needed"]', 0),
('Solar Panel Installation & Sales', 'solar-installation', '☀️', 'trade', 'Install solar panels and inverters for homes and businesses. With NEPA\'s unreliable power, every Nigerian home is a potential solar customer. A single installation earns ₦100k–₦1m+ depending on system size.', 8000, 400000, 'month', 'intermediate', 50000, '["High Income", "Green Energy", "Growing Market", "SolarEdge app", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack", "CAC registration", "Instagram"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Get trained: Lagos State Technical Vocational Education Board or online solar installation courses", "Understand the components: panels, batteries, inverters, charge controllers, and wiring", "Partner with solar distributors to supply at wholesale \\u2014 you handle installation and after-sales", "Offer free energy audit to homes: \\"You spend \\u20a625k/month on fuel \\u2014 my solar pays off in 8 months\\"", "Build referral network: every happy customer in an estate refers 5\\u201310 neighbours"]', 0),
('Electrical & Plumbing Services', 'electrical-plumbing', '🔌', 'trade', 'Fix electrical faults and plumbing issues in homes and offices. Skilled electricians and plumbers in Lagos charge ₦5k–₦50k per call-out. Certified professionals earn ₦200k–₦800k/month with minimal overhead.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 10000, '["Daily Cash", "Always Needed", "Low Capital", "Fixit App", "WhatsApp Business", "OPay", "Google Maps", "Instagram"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Get certified: LASDRI or State Artisan Board certification adds credibility and legal standing", "Buy basic tools: multimeter, wire strippers, pliers, pipe wrench, PVC fittings (\\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a630k)", "List on Fixit App Nigeria, Helping.ng, and Workman.ng to receive job requests", "Create a WhatsApp Business profile with photos of your work and client testimonials", "Upsell maintenance contracts: \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a630k/month to service estates or office buildings monthly"]', 0),
('Event Planning & Management', 'event-planning', '🎉', 'trade', 'Plan weddings, birthdays, corporate events, and conferences. Nigerian event planners charge ₦200k–₦5m+ per event. One wedding per month at ₦500k = ₦6m/year. Socialization is Nigeria\'s fastest-growing industry.', 5000, 300000, 'month', 'intermediate', 20000, '["High Income", "Creative", "Scalable", "Instagram", "WhatsApp Business", "Canva", "Paystack", "Trello (event planning)"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Assist 2\\u20133 established event planners for free \\u2014 learn vendor management, budgeting, logistics", "Build a vendor network: decorators, caterers, photographers, MCs, security, generators", "Create a professional Instagram with event photos (borrow photos from planners you assisted)", "Price your first events lower to build testimonials \\u2014 \\u20a6100k for a birthday is a great start", "Specialise: weddings, corporate events, kids\' parties, or concerts \\u2014 niches earn more"]', 0),
('Printing & Branding Business', 'printing-branding', '🖨️', 'trade', 'Print T-shirts, banners, business cards, flyers, and branded merch for schools, churches, and companies. A printing business with a DTF or Vinyl machine earns ₦50k–₦500k/month — and schools alone are a permanent client.', 3000, 100000, 'week', 'beginner', 50000, '["Low Capital", "Daily Cash", "High Demand", "Canva", "CorelDraw", "WhatsApp Business", "Instagram", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy a heat press + vinyl cutter (\\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6150k) or rent time at an existing printing shop first", "Learn Canva and CorelDraw for design \\u2014 you can offer design + print as a package", "Target bulk orders: school uniforms, church T-shirts, corporate SWAG, event merchandise", "Price: \\u20a61,500\\u2013\\u20a65,000 per T-shirt, \\u20a6500\\u2013\\u20a62,000 per banner sqm, \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a650k per bulk order", "Build repeat clients: churches, schools, and corporate offices reorder seasonally"]', 0),
('Real Estate Agency', 'real-estate-agent', '🏘️', 'trade', 'Help people buy, sell, and rent properties and earn 5–10% commission on every transaction. In Lagos, a ₦50m property sale earns you ₦2.5m–₦5m in one deal. The highest-income offline business in Nigeria with zero capital needed.', 5000, 500000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["High Income", "Commission Based", "No Capital", "PropertyPro.ng", "WhatsApp", "Canva", "CAC registration", "Instagram"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Get trained: find an established agent or agency to work under for 3\\u20136 months unpaid \\u2014 learn the market", "Study property valuation, rental agreements, land use laws, and due diligence in your city", "Build your property database: visit 50 properties, take photos, know the prices in your area", "List properties on PropertyPro.ng, Private Property, and NigeriaPropertyCentre.com", "Network relentlessly: every party, church, and LinkedIn connection is a potential buyer or seller"]', 0),
('Poultry Farming Business', 'agribusiness-poultry', '🐔', 'trade', 'Raise broilers or layers for egg and meat production. 500 broilers raised for 6 weeks and sold = ₦200k–₦500k profit per cycle. Poultry farming is Nigeria\'s most accessible and scalable agribusiness entry point.', 2500, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 50000, '["Steady Income", "Scalable", "Food Security", "WhatsApp Business", "OPay", "ThriveAgric (offtake)", "Farmcrowdy", "Google Sheets tracker"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Start small: 100 day-old chicks cost \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a630k \\u2014 broilers are ready in 6 weeks", "Build or rent a pen: bamboo and wire mesh pen for 100 birds costs \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k to construct", "Source quality feed: Vital Feed, Topfeeds, or Hybrid are reliable brands \\u2014 feed is 60% of cost", "Sell to abattoirs, hotels, restaurants, and directly to homes via WhatsApp at market price", "Scale: reinvest 70% of each harvest profit into the next cycle \\u2014 100 birds becomes 500 in 6 months"]', 0),
('Catfish Farming', 'catfish-farming', '🐟', 'trade', 'Raise catfish in tanks or ponds and sell to markets, restaurants, and direct consumers. 1,000 fingerlings raised for 5–6 months generates ₦300k–₦1m profit per cycle — one of the highest-ROI agribusinesses in Nigeria.', 4000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 50000, '["High ROI", "Food Business", "Scalable", "ThriveAgric", "WhatsApp Business", "OPay", "Google Sheets", "Local hatchery contacts"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Build earthen pond (\\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k) or buy plastic tanks (\\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k each) \\u2014 tanks are easier for beginners", "Buy fingerlings: 1,000 catfish fingerlings cost \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a630k from hatcheries", "Feed with floating feed (Coppens, Skretting, or Vital): budget \\u20a660k\\u2013\\u20a6120k per 1,000 fish per cycle", "Sell to restaurants, hotels, fish markets, and direct customers at \\u20a6700\\u2013\\u20a61,500 per kg live weight", "Apply for ThriveAgric or Babban Gona loans to scale without personal capital risk"]', 0),
('Snail Farming (Heliculture)', 'snail-farming', '🐌', 'trade', 'Raise giant African snails (Achatina achatina) and sell to markets, restaurants, and exporters. Snail farming requires the least capital and labour in agribusiness — and profit margins are 300–500% per cycle.', 1500, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 10000, '["Low Capital", "Passive Income", "High ROI", "WhatsApp Business", "OPay", "NAFDAC export registration", "Instagram", "Local market contacts"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Build a hutch pen (planks + wire mesh) \\u2014 10 square metres houses 500 snails (\\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k)", "Source parent snails: buy 200 jumbo snails from a market or hatchery (\\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a620k)", "Feed with pawpaw leaves, banana peels, watermelon rind, and calcium supplement \\u2014 near zero cost", "Harvest after 6\\u20138 months: sell at \\u20a6500\\u2013\\u20a61,500 per kg to markets, restaurants, and exporters", "Connect with export companies \\u2014 dried snail fetches premium prices in Europe and North America"]', 0),
('Vegetable Farming (Dry Season)', 'vegetable-farming', '🥬', 'trade', 'Grow vegetables like tomatoes, peppers, cucumber, lettuce, and scent leaf using irrigation. Dry-season farming earns 3–5x more than rainy season because supply drops and prices skyrocket — smart farmers time this.', 2000, 80000, 'month', 'beginner', 20000, '["Quick Harvest", "High Demand", "Low Capital", "WhatsApp Business", "OPay", "Agromart (sell platform)", "Drip irrigation kit", "SEEDCO seeds"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Select a fast-growing, high-demand crop: cucumber (45 days), lettuce (30 days), or tomatoes (60\\u201370 days)", "Prepare land or use grow bags for urban farming \\u2014 100 grow bags fit on a small balcony or rooftop", "Source quality seeds: SEEDCO, Premier Seeds, or open-pollinated varieties from agro-dealers", "Install a drip irrigation or watering schedule \\u2014 consistency is the difference between profit and loss", "Sell to: vegetable markets (Ketu, Mile 12), supermarkets, restaurants, and estate WhatsApp groups"]', 0),
('Interior Decoration & Space Design', 'interior-decoration', '🛋️', 'trade', 'Transform homes, offices, and event spaces with furniture arrangement, lighting, curtains, and decor. Nigerian interior decorators earn ₦100k–₦2m per project as the middle class grows and people invest in their spaces.', 3000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 10000, '["High Income", "Creative", "Growing Market", "Instagram", "Pinterest", "WhatsApp Business", "Canva", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Study interior design: Pinterest, YouTube, and free Coursera interior design fundamentals", "Offer to decorate one friend\'s living room for free \\u2014 document the before/after transformation", "Create an Instagram portfolio \\u2014 interior design content gets massive organic engagement in Nigeria", "Target: new homeowners, newly-wed couples moving in, and Airbnb hosts needing staging", "Build relationships with furniture suppliers \\u2014 you earn referral commissions or buy-and-supply margins"]', 0),
('Makeup Artist (MUA)', 'makeup-artist', '💄', 'trade', 'Do bridal, birthday, graduation, and event makeup. Nigerian MUAs charge ₦10k–₦200k per face depending on the occasion. During wedding season (October–December), a booked MUA earns ₦500k–₦2m/month.', 2000, 80000, 'month', 'beginner', 20000, '["Daily Cash", "Creative", "High Demand", "Instagram", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack", "Ring light (\\u20a65k)", "Canva"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Build your kit: foundation range, contour, eyeshadow palettes, lashes (\\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a660k starter kit)", "Practice on friends and family \\u2014 collect diverse skin tones in your portfolio", "Create Instagram: post every single client (with consent) \\u2014 Nigerian MUA Instagram pages grow fast", "Charge per face based on event: everyday glam \\u20a65k, events \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a630k, bridal \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6150k", "Add bridal packages: bride + bridesmaids at discounted bundle pricing"]', 0),
('Fumigation & Pest Control Service', 'fumigation-pest', '🪲', 'trade', 'Fumigate homes, offices, warehouses, and restaurants. Pest control companies earn ₦15k–₦100k per treatment. Monthly contracts with offices and food businesses provide stable recurring income with very low ongoing cost.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'beginner', 30000, '["Low Capital", "Recurring", "High Margin", "WhatsApp Business", "CAC registration", "Paystack", "Google Maps", "Canva"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Get trained: attend a one-day pest control workshop (many State ADP offices offer these free)", "Buy equipment: sprayer, protective gear, and approved chemicals (\\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k starter kit)", "Register business name at CAC and get NAFDAC-approved chemicals \\u2014 corporate clients require compliance", "Pitch monthly contracts to: restaurants, schools, hospitals, hotels, and warehouses", "Offer quarterly fumigation packages: 4 treatments at a discount \\u2014 clients pay upfront, you schedule visits"]', 0),
('AI Content Creation Service', 'ai-content-creation', '🤖', 'ai', 'Use ChatGPT, Claude, Midjourney, and other AI tools to produce content 10x faster than humans. Sell blog posts, social media content, product descriptions, and scripts to businesses who don\'t know how to use AI.', 2000, 90000, 'month', 'beginner', 5000, '["Fast Income", "USD", "Scalable", "ChatGPT", "Claude", "Canva AI", "Midjourney", "Selar (to sell packages)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Master ChatGPT, Claude, and Gemini \\u2014 learn prompt engineering through free YouTube courses", "Build a package: \\"10 Instagram captions + 4 blog posts + 1 email newsletter\\" for \\u20a630k/month", "Pitch to Nigerian SMEs, coaches, and content creators who post inconsistently", "Add Midjourney or Canva AI for graphics \\u2014 offer full content service (copy + visuals)", "Scale by templating your workflow \\u2014 serve 10 clients with the same 4 hours you spend for 1"]', 0),
('Prompt Engineering & AI Consulting', 'prompt-engineering', '💡', 'ai', 'Help businesses use AI tools effectively by crafting expert prompts and AI workflows. Companies pay $500–$5,000 for a well-built AI system prompt set that makes their team 3x more productive.', 3000, 120000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Future-Proof", "USD", "Niche Skill", "ChatGPT", "Claude", "Notion (documentation)", "Gumroad", "LinkedIn"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Master prompt engineering: study OpenAI and Anthropic prompt guides, build 50 sample prompts", "Create a portfolio: write custom system prompts for 5 different business types (law firm, e-commerce, HR, etc.)", "Sell prompt packs on Gumroad for $9\\u2013$49 each \\u2014 passive income while you build consulting clients", "Pitch on LinkedIn: \\"I help teams cut 10 hours of work per week using AI \\u2014 without writing code\\"", "Offer a free AI audit: spend 30 minutes showing a business what AI could automate for them"]', 0),
('Faceless TikTok Channel', 'faceless-tiktok', '🎭', 'ai', 'Run a TikTok channel without showing your face using text animations, stock footage, voiceovers, and AI tools. Faceless channels in niches like finance tips, scary stories, Nigeria facts, and life hacks go viral easily.', 1500, 70000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Passive Income", "No Face Needed", "AI-Powered", "CapCut", "ElevenLabs", "Pexels", "TikTok", "Canva"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Pick a niche: Nigerian facts, money tips, scary stories, motivation, or relationship advice", "Use CapCut templates + ElevenLabs AI voice + Pexels stock videos \\u2014 full production without showing up", "Post 3 videos/day for 30 consecutive days \\u2014 consistency is the only algorithm that matters", "Monetise: TikTok Creator Fund, affiliate links in bio (Selar/Jumia), and brand sponsorships", "Repurpose every TikTok to YouTube Shorts, Instagram Reels \\u2014 triple your reach, same effort"]', 0),
('AI Art & Image Generation Service', 'ai-image-generation', '🎨', 'ai', 'Generate stunning AI images using Midjourney, DALL-E, and Stable Diffusion for businesses needing book covers, marketing visuals, concept art, and social media graphics — faster and cheaper than photographers.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 10, '["Creative", "USD Income", "Trending", "Midjourney", "DALL-E 3", "Adobe Firefly", "Fiverr", "Etsy"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Master Midjourney: join Discord, run 500 prompts in your first week to understand the tool", "Build a portfolio of 30 stunning images in different styles: photorealistic, concept art, book covers, ads", "Create a Behance and Instagram portfolio \\u2014 AI art gets massive organic reach from curious viewers", "Sell on Etsy, Fiverr, and Creative Market \\u2014 also pitch directly to self-publishing authors for book covers", "Offer commercial licensing: charge 2\\u20133x for commercial rights to your generated images"]', 0),
('Micro-SaaS Building', 'saas-micro', '⚙️', 'ai', 'Build a tiny software product that solves one specific problem and charges a monthly subscription. Micro-SaaS products with 100 customers at $29/month = $2,900 MRR — built once, earns forever.', 5000, 500000, 'month', 'advanced', 50, '["Passive Income", "USD", "Scalable", "Bubble (no-code)", "Webflow", "Stripe", "ProductHunt", "Notion (roadmap)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Find a problem: look for painful manual tasks in a niche you understand (real estate, restaurants, schools)", "Validate before building: get 10 people to say \\"I\'d pay $X/month for this\\" before writing code", "Build MVP with no-code (Bubble, Webflow) or low-code to reduce time to market", "Launch on Product Hunt, Twitter, and relevant Reddit/Facebook communities", "Double down on support and features for your first 50 users \\u2014 they define your product roadmap"]', 0),
('Academic Research Assistant', 'academic-research-assistant', '🔬', 'education', 'Assist professors, PhD students, and researchers with literature reviews, data collection, transcription, and citation formatting. International researchers pay $10–$30/hour for reliable research assistance from Nigeria.', 1500, 40000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Remote", "USD Possible", "Students", "Zotero (citation manager)", "Google Scholar", "Grammarly", "Upwork", "Microsoft Word"]', '["Lagos", "Nationwide", "Online"]', '["Master citation styles: APA, MLA, Chicago, and Harvard \\u2014 you\'ll use all of them", "Learn academic databases: Google Scholar, ResearchGate, JSTOR, PubMed \\u2014 find papers efficiently", "Post your services on Research Gate, Academia.edu, and Upwork with samples of your work", "Approach professors at your own university first \\u2014 domestic clients are the easiest to start with", "Expand to dissertation assistance: formatting, proofreading, reference list compilation for final-year students"]', 0),
('Crypto Spot Trading', 'crypto-trading-spot', '📈', 'crypto', 'Buy and sell cryptocurrencies on exchanges at the right times to profit from price movements. Disciplined spot traders with a strategy earn 5–20% monthly on their portfolio — far exceeding any bank savings rate.', 3000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 50000, '["High Potential", "Daily Income", "Medium Risk", "Binance", "Bybit", "TradingView", "CoinMarketCap", "Trading journal (Google Sheets)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Learn: candlestick patterns, support/resistance, moving averages, and volume analysis (YouTube is free)", "Open verified accounts on Binance and Bybit \\u2014 both require ID verification (KYC)", "Practice on paper trading for 30 days before risking real money \\u2014 most beginners skip this and lose", "Never risk more than 2% of your portfolio on a single trade \\u2014 position sizing is everything", "Keep a trading journal: every trade logged, with entry/exit reason and outcome \\u2014 learn from data"]', 0),
('NFT Creation & Selling', 'nft-creation', '🖼️', 'crypto', 'Create digital art, collectibles, or utility NFTs and sell on marketplaces. Top Nigerian NFT artists have earned $10,000–$500,000+ from single collections. The market is cyclical but opportunity always exists for quality creators.', 2000, 300000, 'month', 'intermediate', 50, '["Creative", "USD", "Passive Income", "Midjourney", "OpenSea", "Magic Eden", "Discord", "Twitter/X"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Learn Midjourney or Procreate to create 10,000-piece generative art collections", "Study successful NFT projects: Bored Apes, Pudgy Penguins, and African-themed collections", "Build community FIRST on Twitter and Discord \\u2014 NFT sales are driven by community, not art alone", "Launch on OpenSea (Ethereum) or Magic Eden (Solana) \\u2014 Solana has lower gas fees for beginners", "Market relentlessly: 80% community building, 20% art creation in the months before mint"]', 0),
('DeFi Yield Farming & Staking', 'defi-yield', '💰', 'crypto', 'Earn passive income by staking crypto or providing liquidity to DeFi protocols. Staking Ethereum earns 3–5% APY. Liquidity providing on Uniswap or PancakeSwap can earn 10–50% APY — beating every bank rate on earth.', 2000, 100000, 'month', 'advanced', 100, '["Passive Income", "Crypto", "High Risk", "MetaMask (wallet)", "Uniswap", "PancakeSwap", "DeFiLlama", "Binance Earn"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Understand the risks first: smart contract bugs, rug pulls, and impermanent loss \\u2014 DYOR always", "Start with low-risk staking: stake ETH on Lido (4% APY) or BNB on Binance Earn (5\\u20138% APY)", "Graduate to liquidity provision on PancakeSwap or Uniswap V3 with stable coin pairs first", "Use DeFiLlama.com to compare yields across protocols \\u2014 always choose audited, established protocols", "Never invest more than you can afford to lose completely \\u2014 DeFi is high risk, high reward"]', 0),
('Crypto Signals Telegram Channel', 'crypto-signals', '📡', 'crypto', 'Run a paid Telegram channel providing trading signals, market analysis, and crypto research. At ₦5k–₦20k/member/month, a channel with 200 active subscribers earns ₦1m–₦4m/month in recurring subscription income.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Recurring Income", "Scalable", "Community", "Telegram", "TradingView", "Binance", "WhatsApp", "Paystack"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Build your trading track record for 3\\u20136 months BEFORE charging \\u2014 screenshot every winning call", "Create a free Telegram channel and post 10\\u201320 free signals to prove your accuracy", "Charge: \\u20a65k/month for basic, \\u20a615k/month for premium (includes 1-on-1 Q&A and VIP calls)", "Market on Twitter, TikTok, and crypto Facebook groups \\u2014 show your PnL (profit/loss) screenshots openly", "Diversify revenue: add a Whop.com page, a newsletter, and a paid bootcamp for members"]', 0),
('Custom GPT Bot Developer', 'custom-gpt-developer', '⚙️', 'digital', 'Build internal AI knowledge bases and GPT bots for Nigerian law firms, accounting offices, and hospitals. Companies pay ₦200k–₦2m for a bot that answers staff questions instantly.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["AI", "Tech", "B2B", "OpenAI API", "Botpress", "Make.com", "Notion", "Typeform"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Learn to build custom GPTs on OpenAI and Botpress (free online courses available)", "Specialize in ONE vertical first: e.g. HR bots for companies, or medical FAQ bots for clinics", "Cold email 50 law firms and accounting firms pitching an \\"AI Junior Staff\\" bot starting at \\u20a6150k", "Offer a 7-day free trial with limited features to prove ROI before full payment", "Charge monthly maintenance at 20% of build cost for ongoing updates and training"]', 0),
('VR/AR Real Estate Tour Creator', 'vr-real-estate-tours', '🏠', 'digital', 'Create immersive 360° virtual walkthroughs for luxury Lagos and Abuja properties. Developers save on physical viewing costs while attracting diaspora buyers who cannot travel to Nigeria.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 200000, '["Tech", "Real Estate", "Premium", "Matterport", "Insta360", "DJI Drone", "Adobe Premiere", "Canva"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Invest in a 360\\u00b0 camera (Insta360 X4 or Ricoh Theta) and Matterport software subscription", "Approach high-end real estate developers in Lekki, VI, Ikoyi, and Banana Island", "Price per property: \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6200k for a full walkthrough including hosting for 12 months", "Market to diaspora-focused developers \\u2014 buyers in UK/USA/Canada want virtual tours", "Add drone footage integration to upsell premium packages at \\u20a6300k+"]', 0),
('Digital Legacy Management', 'digital-legacy-management', '🔐', 'digital', 'Handle the digital accounts, crypto wallets, and social profiles of deceased individuals for their families. A growing and underserved niche as Nigerians accumulate more digital assets.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Niche", "Service", "Premium", "LastPass", "Google Takeout", "Meta Memorialization", "Coinbase Recovery", "Notion"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Learn the legal framework: write to a lawyer about powers of attorney for digital accounts", "Create a service package: Social Media Memorialization, Email Archive, Crypto Recovery, Data Backup", "Partner with estate lawyers and funeral homes for referrals (pay 10\\u201315% referral fee)", "Charge \\u20a6100k for standard package, \\u20a6300k+ for crypto wallet recovery", "Build a template \\"Digital Will\\" document to sell to clients planning ahead (\\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k)"]', 0),
('Starlink Installation Specialist', 'starlink-installation', '📡', 'trade', 'Set up high-speed Starlink satellite internet for homes, farms, and businesses in underserved Nigerian areas. With NEPA unreliable and fibre absent in rural areas, Starlink demand is exploding.', 2000, 70000, 'month', 'intermediate', 50000, '["Tech", "Telecoms", "Recurring", "Starlink App", "Starlink Dish", "Network Analyzer", "Cable Management Tools", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Get certified as a Starlink reseller or approved installer via their partner program", "Learn signal optimization: dish placement, angle calculation, obstructions avoidance", "Charge \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6100k installation fee on top of Starlink hardware cost", "Target farm estates, private schools, and rural businesses in Lagos-Ibadan corridor", "Add network management service at \\u20a610k/month for remote monitoring and troubleshooting"]', 0),
('Data Privacy Compliance (NDPR)', 'ndpr-compliance-consultant', '🛡️', 'digital', 'Help Nigerian companies comply with the Nigeria Data Protection Regulation (NDPR). NITDA can fine firms millions for non-compliance — and most businesses have no idea the law even exists.', 5000, 120000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Legal", "B2B", "Consulting", "NITDA NDPR Guidelines", "OneTrust", "Google Workspace", "DocuSign", "Notion"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Study NDPR 2019 and the NDPA 2023 thoroughly \\u2014 NITDA website has free resources", "Get CDPSE or CIPP/A certification to boost credibility (online, 3\\u20136 months)", "Price: \\u20a6150k for initial audit, \\u20a650k/month for ongoing compliance retainer", "Target fintech startups, hospitals, schools, and e-commerce firms that handle user data", "Partner with a law firm to handle legal agreements while you handle the technical audits"]', 0),
('WhatsApp Business Chatbot Architect', 'whatsapp-chatbot-builder', '💬', 'digital', 'Build automated sales and customer service flows for WhatsApp Business. Lagos fashion stores and restaurants that use chatbots report 300% more orders without extra staff.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Tech", "E-commerce", "Scalable", "Wati.io", "Interakt", "Make.com", "Typeform", "Paystack API"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Learn Wati, Interakt, or Respond.io for WhatsApp Business API integration (free trials available)", "Build a portfolio bot (e.g. a demo food ordering bot) to show prospects", "Charge \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6200k setup + \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k/month maintenance per client", "Target restaurants, fashion stores, pharmacies, and logistics companies first", "Offer a \\"WhatsApp CRM\\" package \\u2014 chatbot + broadcast lists + order tracking in one"]', 0),
('App Localization to Nigerian Languages', 'app-localization-nigeria', '🌍', 'digital', 'Translate and culturally adapt foreign apps and software into Yoruba, Hausa, Igbo, or Pidgin. Nigeria\'s 220M users are a huge target for app companies that don\'t know how to reach them.', 2000, 80000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Language", "Tech", "Niche", "Phrase TMS", "POEditor", "Google Translate API", "Slack", "Notion"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Build a team: one fluent Yoruba speaker, one Hausa, one Igbo \\u2014 offer revenue sharing", "Cold email 50 global app companies with Nigerian user bases (fintech, health, agri)", "Charge per word (\\u20a620\\u2013\\u20a650/word) or per screen (\\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a620k/UI screen)", "Register on Upwork and Translated.com to find international localization clients", "Also offer Pidgin localization \\u2014 it\'s unique, in-demand, and you have no competition globally"]', 0),
('Social Media Crisis Manager', 'social-media-crisis-manager', '🚨', 'digital', 'Manage "cancel culture" attacks, product backlash, and online PR disasters for Nigerian brands and celebrities. One bad viral tweet can destroy a business — you\'re the firefighter.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["PR", "Consulting", "High Stakes", "Brandwatch", "Hootsuite", "Google Alerts", "Twitter/X API", "Meltwater"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Study 10 famous Nigerian brand crisis case studies: Indomie, MTN, Flutterwave controversies", "Create a \\"Crisis Response Playbook\\" \\u2014 a 24-hour action plan document to show clients", "Sell retainer packages: \\u20a6100k/month for monitoring + \\u20a6300k emergency fee per incident", "Build relationships with journalists at TechCabal, Zikoko, and Pulse Nigeria for damage control", "Target FMCG brands, fintech companies, and A-list musicians for retainer agreements"]', 0),
('Fractional CMO for Startups', 'fractional-cmo', '📊', 'digital', 'Act as a part-time Marketing Director for 3–5 Nigerian startups simultaneously. Startups need CMO-level strategy but can\'t afford full-time salaries — you fill the gap at ₦200k–₦500k/startup/month.', 8000, 200000, 'month', 'advanced', 0, '["Executive", "Consulting", "High Value", "HubSpot", "Notion", "Slack", "Google Analytics", "Meta Ads Manager"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Document your marketing wins: campaigns, revenue growth, metrics \\u2014 build a case study portfolio", "Position yourself on LinkedIn as \\"Fractional CMO for African Startups\\" with 3 posts/week", "Price at \\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6500k/startup/month for 10\\u201315 hours/week of strategic time", "Apply to be listed on AfriBlocks, Toptal, and GrowthMentor as a fractional exec", "Manage max 4 clients simultaneously \\u2014 beyond this, quality drops; hire junior marketers"]', 0),
('Pitch Deck Designer for Startups', 'pitch-deck-designer', '📋', 'digital', 'Create compelling investor pitch decks for African startups seeking VC funding. A winning pitch deck has raised millions — founders pay ₦150k–₦500k for one that does the job.', 3000, 80000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Design", "USD Income", "Startups", "Figma", "Canva", "Beautiful.ai", "Notion", "Loom"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Study 20 successful funded startup pitch decks (Sequoia template, Nigerian VC-funded decks)", "Build 3 portfolio decks for fictional companies in fintech, agtech, and logistics", "Price: \\u20a6100k basic (10 slides), \\u20a6250k premium (includes copy + design + financial charts)", "Find clients on Techpoint.Africa startup communities, Twitter/X tech spaces, and YC forums", "Upsell: pitch rehearsal coaching at \\u20a650k/session, investor intro introductions via network"]', 0),
('YouTube Thumbnail Designer', 'youtube-thumbnail-designer', '🖼️', 'digital', 'Create high-CTR thumbnail images that make viewers click. Nigerian and international YouTubers pay $20–$100 per thumbnail because a better thumbnail = more views = more AdSense revenue.', 1500, 40000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Design", "Remote", "USD Income", "Canva Pro", "Adobe Photoshop", "Figma", "PikWizard", "Remove.bg"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Study the top 100 YouTube channels in each niche \\u2014 analyze what makes thumbnails work", "Create 20 sample thumbnails in different styles: tech, vlogs, finance, cooking, gaming", "List on Fiverr: \\"I will design eye-catching YouTube thumbnails that get clicks\\"", "Offer 3 concepts per thumbnail so clients can A/B test \\u2014 this justifies premium pricing", "Target channels with 10k\\u2013500k subscribers \\u2014 big enough to pay, small enough to need help"]', 0),
('LinkedIn Content Ghostwriter for CEOs', 'linkedin-ghostwriter', '✍️', 'digital', 'Write thought leadership posts for Nigerian and African CEOs and executives on LinkedIn. C-suite leaders know LinkedIn is valuable but hate writing — they pay ₦100k–₦300k/month to outsource it.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Writing", "B2B", "USD Income", "LinkedIn Creator Mode", "Taplio", "Notion", "Grammarly", "Shield Analytics"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Build your own LinkedIn audience first \\u2014 your profile IS your portfolio (aim for 2k+ followers)", "Create a sample \\"CEO content package\\": 12 posts/month covering thought leadership, company news, personal story", "Cold message CEOs: \\"I help African executives build influence on LinkedIn \\u2014 free 1-month trial for 5 posts\\"", "Charge \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6300k/month per client for 8\\u201312 posts + profile optimization", "Manage 5 clients max at this rate = \\u20a61.5m/month comfortably for 20 hours/week work"]', 0),
('Email Autoresponder & Funnel Builder', 'email-autoresponder-architect', '📧', 'digital', 'Build automated email welcome sequences, sales funnels, and broadcast systems for Nigerian businesses. Good email automation generates passive revenue for clients — they pay well for it.', 3000, 80000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Marketing", "Automation", "B2B", "ActiveCampaign", "MailerLite", "Klaviyo", "ConvertKit", "Zapier"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Master one email platform: Mailchimp (free), MailerLite, or ActiveCampaign (most powerful)", "Learn copywriting basics \\u2014 subject lines, CTAs, benefit-driven writing (free resources online)", "Build a sample 7-email welcome sequence for a fictional e-commerce brand in your portfolio", "Sell to coaches, online course creators, and e-commerce stores as first targets", "Package: \\u20a6150k for full sequence build + \\u20a630k/month for ongoing management and optimization"]', 0),
('Remote High-Ticket Sales Closer', 'remote-sales-closer', '📞', 'digital', 'Close high-ticket deals via phone and Zoom for international coaches, course creators, and service businesses. Closers earn 5–20% commission on deals worth $1,000–$10,000+.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Sales", "Commission", "Remote", "Zoom", "Calendly", "Notion CRM", "Close.com", "Loom"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Study: \\"The One Call Close\\" method, tonality mastery, and objection handling frameworks on YouTube", "Practice on free mock sales call communities (Closer Circle, Sales Legacy Discord)", "Apply to be a remote closer on Closify.com, Streamline Clover, or via LinkedIn", "Specialize in ONE niche first: online courses, real estate coaching, or fitness programs", "Track your show rate, close rate, and average deal size \\u2014 these numbers get you premium placements"]', 0),
('Digital Trend Forecaster for Nigeria', 'digital-trend-forecaster', '🔭', 'digital', 'Sell monthly intelligence reports on "What\'s Next" for Nigerian businesses — which platforms are rising, which niches are saturating, and where opportunity lies. Agencies and brands pay ₦100k+ per report.', 3000, 80000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Research", "Premium", "B2B", "Google Trends", "Glimpse", "SparkToro", "Meltwater", "Substack"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Study trend forecasting methodology: Google Trends, Glimpse, SparkToro, Nairaland patterns", "Create your first free \\"State of Nigerian Digital Business 2025\\" report and share it widely", "Build a subscriber list \\u2014 offer a paid monthly newsletter at \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a630k/month for ongoing insights", "Sell deep-dive reports to ad agencies, banks, and FMCG companies for \\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6500k each", "Position on LinkedIn and Twitter as \\"Nigeria\'s Digital Economy Analyst\\" \\u2014 consistency = authority"]', 0),
('Esports & Gaming Tournament Organizer', 'esports-event-organizer', '🎮', 'trade', 'Organize CODM, FIFA, PUBG, and Tekken tournaments at universities, malls, and gaming centers. Nigerian gaming market is growing fast — events sell out and sponsors pay ₦500k+ for branding.', 2000, 80000, 'month', 'intermediate', 20000, '["Gaming", "Events", "Youth", "Challonge (bracket software)", "Discord", "StreamLabs OBS", "Flutterwave (tickets)", "Canva"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Partner with a mall, university, or cyber cafe for venue (revenue share instead of rent)", "Charge \\u20a62k\\u2013\\u20a65k entry per player; prize pool = 60% of entry fees, profit = 40%", "Approach Tecno, Infinix, Pepsi, and Red Bull for sponsorship \\u2014 show youth demographic data", "Livestream on YouTube and TikTok to attract online sponsorship and grow future attendance", "Build a Discord community of Nigerian competitive gamers \\u2014 this becomes your repeat audience"]', 0),
('Electric Motorcycle Assembly (EV Okada)', 'ev-motorcycle-assembly', '⚡', 'trade', 'Locally assemble electric motorcycles for the Lagos, Abuja, and Port Harcourt Okada market. With fuel above ₦1,000/litre, EV Okada reduces rider costs by 70% — demand is inevitable.', 10000, 300000, 'month', 'advanced', 2, '["Manufacturing", "Green Energy", "Scalable", "Alibaba Sourcing", "NADDC Registration", "Battery Management Systems", "CAD Software", "Flutterwave"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Import Chinese EV motorcycle kits (Alibaba: $500\\u2013$1,500/kit) and assemble locally", "Register as an auto manufacturer with NADDC and obtain product approval", "Build a repair and battery-swap network before selling \\u2014 after-sales is the key to trust", "Partner with motorcycle unions (NURTW) to sell directly to fleets of 50\\u2013500 Okadas", "Offer lease-to-own financing at \\u20a630k/month \\u2014 this unlocks the mass market immediately"]', 0),
('Biogas Digester Construction', 'biogas-digester-construction', '♻️', 'trade', 'Build biogas systems that convert kitchen waste, animal dung, and food scraps into free cooking gas for farms, hotels, and schools. One installation serves a household for 10+ years.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 100000, '["Green Energy", "Agriculture", "Rural", "PVC Pipes & Fittings", "Concrete Mixing Equipment", "Gas Flow Meter", "CBET Training Materials", "Manual"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Train with NBTE or watch free biogas construction videos from IRENA and FAO", "Build one demo unit on your own property or a willing farmer\'s land first", "Target: schools (large cafeterias), farms with 50+ animals, hotels with restaurant kitchens", "Charge \\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6500k per residential installation; \\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a62m for commercial units", "Sell carbon credits for verified biogas projects to international buyers for extra income"]', 0),
('Solar Panel Cleaning & Maintenance Service', 'solar-panel-cleaning', '☀️', 'trade', 'Dirty solar panels lose 20–30% efficiency. Lagos dust reduces output fast. Offer subscription-based monthly cleaning for the tens of thousands of solar installations across Nigeria.', 1500, 30000, 'month', 'beginner', 20000, '["Solar", "Recurring", "Service", "Soft Brush Kit", "Squeegee", "Water Pump Backpack", "WhatsApp Business", "Google Maps"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy soft brushes, squeegees, and a water tank backpack \\u2014 total kit under \\u20a620k", "Photograph dirty vs clean panels and post results on Instagram and WhatsApp groups", "Charge \\u20a63k\\u2013\\u20a68k per clean depending on system size; \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k/month subscription", "Target estates with high solar adoption: Lekki Phase 1, Gwarimpa, GRA neighborhoods", "Partner with solar installers to offer cleaning as an add-on service they recommend"]', 0),
('Container Home Construction Business', 'container-home-construction', '🏗️', 'trade', 'Convert 20ft and 40ft shipping containers into modern, affordable homes and offices. Container homes cost 40–60% less than block construction and take 2–8 weeks instead of 6–18 months.', 15000, 400000, 'month', 'advanced', 2, '["Construction", "Premium", "Scalable", "Welding Machine", "Angle Grinder", "Insulation Materials", "Autocad", "SketchUp"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Source used containers: Apapa Port, Tin Can Island, or Onne Port (\\u20a6600k\\u2013\\u20a61.5m each)", "Master container modification: cutting, insulation, plumbing, electrical, and cladding", "Build a 1-bedroom showroom container home \\u2014 use it for marketing photos and site visits", "Target: real estate developers building affordable housing, corporate firms needing site offices", "Price: 1-bed \\u20a64m\\u2013\\u20a68m, 2-bed \\u20a68m\\u2013\\u20a615m \\u2014 huge margins vs traditional construction costs"]', 0),
('LED Neon Sign Fabrication', 'neon-sign-fabrication', '💡', 'trade', 'Fabricate custom LED neon signs for restaurants, weddings, boutiques, and offices. A ₦15k-cost sign sells for ₦60k–₦150k. Social media aesthetics culture has made neon signs a must-have.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 50000, '["Manufacturing", "Decor", "B2B", "LED Neon Flex", "Acrylic Backing", "Laser Cutter (optional)", "Heat Gun", "Aliexpress"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Source LED neon flex, acrylic backing, and power transformers from Aliexpress or local market", "Practice bending and mounting technique for 2 weeks \\u2014 YouTube has full tutorials", "Photograph finished signs in dark rooms \\u2014 the photos sell the product on Instagram", "Price by word count and size: \\u20a630k for small quote, \\u20a6100k+ for large custom business logo", "Target: wedding planners (huge seasonal demand), new restaurants, photo studios, and boutiques"]', 0),
('Recycled Rubber Floor Tile Production', 'rubber-floor-tiles', '🔵', 'trade', 'Process old car tires into rubber floor tiles for gyms, playgrounds, and industrial floors. Solves a waste problem and a construction need simultaneously — government and private sector buy.', 8000, 200000, 'month', 'intermediate', 500000, '["Manufacturing", "Green", "B2B", "Tire Granulator", "Tile Press Machine", "Molds", "Weighing Scale", "SON Registration"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Source used tires free or at \\u20a6200\\u2013\\u20a6500 each from mechanics and tire shops", "Buy granulation and tile-pressing machine (\\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a61.5m from Chinese suppliers)", "Target: fitness centers (gym flooring), schools (playground safety), factories (anti-slip)", "Price: \\u20a68k\\u2013\\u20a615k per square meter \\u2014 compete on quality against imported tiles from China", "Register with SON and apply for NAFDAC certification to sell to government institutions"]', 0),
