('Auto Ceramic Coating & Detailing', 'ceramic-coating-auto', '🚗', 'trade', 'Apply professional ceramic paint protection coating to luxury vehicles. A single application on a high-end car costs ₦150k–₦500k and lasts 2–5 years. Lagos and Abuja car culture = unlimited demand.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 200000, '["Premium", "Automotive", "Service", "Polishing Machine", "Ceramic Coating Kit", "Microfiber Towels", "Clay Bar", "Paint Thickness Gauge"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Train in professional detailing and ceramic coating application (online course + practice)", "Buy professional grade ceramics: Gtechniq, CQuartz, or IGL Coatings (\\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6150k for starter kit)", "Start on mid-range cars (Toyota Prado, Honda CRV) before targeting Range Rovers and Porsches", "Market via Instagram and TikTok \\u2014 before/after transformation videos go viral in car communities", "Partner with luxury car dealers as their recommended detailer \\u2014 steady referral pipeline"]', 0),
('Eco-Friendly Recycled Plastic Bricks', 'eco-friendly-brick-production', '🧱', 'trade', 'Produce bricks made from compressed recycled plastic and sand — stronger than concrete blocks and addressing Nigeria\'s plastic waste crisis. Government, NGOs, and developers are buying.', 8000, 200000, 'month', 'intermediate', 500000, '["Manufacturing", "Green", "Construction", "Plastic Shredder", "Compression Mold", "Testing Lab", "SON Registration", "Weigh Scale"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Source plastic waste from recycling aggregators or community collection programs (nearly free)", "Buy a plastic-brick compression machine (\\u20a6300k\\u2013\\u20a61m from local fabricators)", "Get SON/NAFDAC and structural testing certification \\u2014 this is mandatory for buyers to trust you", "Target housing NGOs, affordable housing developers, and FCDA (federal capital development)", "Apply for NESREA green business grants and CBN sustainability loans at low interest rates"]', 0),
