('Frozen Authentic Nigerian Soup Production', 'frozen-soup-production', '🍲', 'trade', 'Package and freeze authentic Egusi, Ogbono, Banga, and Ofe Onugbu soups in take-home tubs. Busy Lagos professionals pay ₦2,500–₦5,000 per tub to eat home-quality food without the 4-hour cook time.', 2000, 60000, 'week', 'beginner', 20000, '["Food", "Recurring", "Daily Cash", "Chest Freezer", "Food-Grade Tubs", "Airtight Seal Labels", "Chowdeck Partner App", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Test 5 soup recipes with family and neighbors \\u2014 collect honest reviews and refine", "Buy food-grade tubs with airtight lids, labels, and a chest freezer (\\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6150k)", "Photograph each soup beautifully \\u2014 hunger sells, and food photography closes deals", "Sell via WhatsApp status, Instagram, and food delivery apps (Chowdeck, Glovo, Foodiebay)", "Build subscription plan: \\u20a650k/month for 4 soups per week delivered on Mondays \\u2014 recurring income"]', 0),
('Fitness Meal Prep & Delivery Service', 'meal-prep-fitness', '🥗', 'trade', 'Deliver pre-portioned, calorie-counted meals for gym-goers, weight-loss clients, and diabetics. Nigeria\'s fitness culture is booming — people finally care about what they eat and pay for it.', 2000, 80000, 'month', 'beginner', 30000, '["Food", "Health", "Subscription", "Kitchen Scale", "Portion Containers", "Calorie Tracking App", "WhatsApp Business", "Instagram"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Get a basic nutrition certification (NACO or online) \\u2014 this builds trust with health clients", "Design weekly meal plans: 1,500 cal for weight loss, 2,500 cal for muscle gain, diabetic-friendly", "Price: \\u20a62,500\\u2013\\u20a64,000 per day\'s meals; \\u20a660k\\u2013\\u20a6100k per month subscription", "Partner with gyms, CrossFit boxes, and fitness influencers for bulk client referrals", "Document your clients\' transformation stories (with permission) \\u2014 this is your best marketing"]', 0),
('Kilishi Production & Export Business', 'kilishi-production-export', '🥩', 'trade', 'Produce premium, hygienic Kilishi (Nigerian beef jerky) packaged to international standards and export to the UK, USA, and Canadian diaspora. Diaspora Nigerians pay 5–10x local price for authentic taste.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 200000, '["Export", "Food", "High Value", "Dehydrating Oven", "Vacuum Sealer", "NAFDAC Registration", "Shopify", "DHL Express"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Perfect the recipe: lean beef slices, spice blend (groundnut paste, ginger, pepper, locust beans), and drying process", "Get NAFDAC registration (mandatory for export) \\u2014 takes 3\\u20136 months, start immediately", "Package in vacuum-sealed, branded pouches with full ingredient list and shelf life (food export requirement)", "Partner with diaspora courier services: Gokada Box, DHL, or dedicated Nigerian food parcel services", "Build a Shopify store + Instagram targeted at diaspora Nigerians in UK/US/Canada"]', 0),
('Moringa Powder Production & Export', 'moringa-powder-production', '🌱', 'trade', 'Process and package Nigeria\'s abundant moringa leaves into high-nutrient powder for local health stores and international superfood markets. Western markets pay $30–$60 per 500g — a 10x markup.', 5000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 200000, '["Export", "Health", "Agriculture", "Industrial Dryer", "Grinding Mill", "Vacuum Sealer", "NAFDAC Registration", "Shopify"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Source moringa leaves from farmers in Kwara, Niger, or Kaduna states \\u2014 cheap and abundant", "Dry leaves in shade (not direct sun) to preserve nutrients, then grind in industrial mill", "Get NAFDAC certification before any sales \\u2014 non-negotiable for health products", "Test nutritional content at NAFDAC-approved lab \\u2014 use results as marketing material", "Sell locally to health food stores, pharmacies, and gym supplement sellers at \\u20a63,000\\u2013\\u20a65,000/100g"]', 0),
('Mushroom Growing Kits & Supply', 'mushroom-growing-kits', '🍄', 'trade', 'Sell "box-to-table" mushroom growing kits so Lagos and Abuja residents can grow fresh oyster or button mushrooms at home. Each kit grows ₦3k–₦5k of mushrooms weekly at home.', 1500, 40000, 'month', 'beginner', 50000, '["Agriculture", "Urban Farming", "Unique", "Sterilization Equipment", "Spawn Bags", "Grow Tent (optional)", "Moisture Sprayer", "Instagram"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Learn oyster mushroom cultivation \\u2014 a 2-week process using rice straw, sawdust, or wheat bran", "Produce spawn (seed) yourself or buy from specialized suppliers in Ibadan or Kano", "Package kits attractively: substrate bag + spawn + instructions + spray bottle = \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a610k/kit", "Sell via Instagram, TikTok (mushroom growing is viral content), and WhatsApp groups", "Upsell: sell fresh mushrooms grown from your own production \\u2014 \\u20a63k\\u2013\\u20a68k per kg, restaurants buy weekly"]', 0),
('Artisan Honey-Infused Product Line', 'honey-infused-products', '🍯', 'trade', 'Create premium honey infused with ginger, garlic, turmeric, or black seed and sell as health products. Raw honey sells for ₦2k–₦5k per 500ml — your infused premium versions command ₦5k–₦15k.', 1500, 40000, 'month', 'beginner', 30000, '["Food", "Health", "Export", "Amber Glass Jars", "Honey Warming Equipment", "Label Printer", "NAFDAC", "Instagram"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Source raw, unfiltered honey from beekeepers in Borno, Plateau, or Cross River (\\u20a61,500\\u2013\\u20a63k/litre)", "Infuse with dried ginger, black seed (Habatus Sauda), garlic, or turmeric at set ratios", "Package in amber glass jars with professional labels \\u2014 aesthetics drive premium pricing", "Sell to health food stores, pharmacies, supermarkets (Shoprite, Market Square), and online", "Apply for NAFDAC registration \\u2014 this unlocks supermarket chains and export markets"]', 0),
('Pet Boarding & Grooming Hotel', 'pet-boarding-hotel', '🐾', 'trade', 'House and groom pets while owners travel. Lagos and Abuja have a booming pet owner population with no adequate pet care infrastructure. A 10-pet facility can generate ₦500k+ monthly.', 5000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 300000, '["Pets", "Service", "Recurring", "Pet Crates", "Grooming Table", "Dog Shampoos/Tools", "Webcam (for live pet cam)", "Instagram"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Designate pet-safe rooms or outdoor runs with proper fencing, ventilation, and drainage", "Charge: \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k/day per dog for boarding; \\u20a62k\\u2013\\u20a68k for cat \\u2014 scale to 10 pets minimum", "Add grooming services: bath, trim, nail clipping at \\u20a63k\\u2013\\u20a610k per session", "Market aggressively in estate WhatsApp groups and pet owner Facebook groups in your city", "Partner with a vet clinic for referrals and emergencies \\u2014 mutual business relationship"]', 0),
('Holistic Wellness Coaching Business', 'holistic-wellness-coaching', '🧘', 'digital', 'Combine nutrition guidance, mindset coaching, stress management, and lifestyle design for busy professionals and executives. Corporate burnout is real and growing — coaches charge ₦100k–₦500k/month.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Health", "Coaching", "Remote", "Zoom", "Notion (client portal)", "Calendly", "Paystack", "Instagram"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Get certified: Institute for Integrative Nutrition (online, 1 year) or a UK health coach cert", "Niche down: \\"Wellness for Busy Nigerian Female Executives\\" is more powerful than \\"wellness coach\\"", "Offer free 30-minute \\"wellness assessment\\" call \\u2014 close into 3 or 6 month package at \\u20a6150k+", "Build authority via Instagram voice notes, LinkedIn articles, and a podcast for executives", "Host quarterly \\"Wellness Retreat Weekends\\" for groups at \\u20a6150k\\u2013\\u20a6300k/person \\u2014 scale income"]', 0),
('Elderly Care Companion Service', 'elderly-care-companion', '👴', 'trade', 'Provide non-medical companionship, light assistance, and supervision for elderly Nigerians whose children live abroad. Diaspora families pay ₦50k–₦150k/month for verified, trustworthy companions.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Service", "Healthcare", "Growing Demand", "Background Check Service", "WhatsApp Business", "Notion (client tracker)", "Bank Transfer", "Zoom"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Get first aid and basic elderly care training \\u2014 NAFDAC or St John\'s Ambulance offer this", "Build an agency model: vet and train 10\\u201320 companions, place them, take 30\\u201340% management fee", "Partner with diaspora Nigerian Facebook groups and forums \\u2014 they desperately need this service", "Create monthly report cards for families: health summary, activities, mood, and medication adherence", "Expand to include basic home nursing services (partnership with a registered nurse) for premium pricing"]', 0),
('Home-Based Physiotherapy Service', 'home-physiotherapy', '🦽', 'trade', 'Offer stroke rehabilitation, post-surgery recovery, and musculoskeletal physiotherapy at patients\' homes. Registered physios earn ₦100k–₦300k/session for home visits to high-net-worth patients.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 100000, '["Healthcare", "Service", "Premium", "Portable TENS Machine", "Resistance Bands", "MRTBN Registration", "WhatsApp", "Scheduling App"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register with MRTBN (Medical Rehabilitation Therapists Board of Nigeria) \\u2014 mandatory", "Buy portable tools: resistance bands, parallel bars, TENS machine, and portable weights", "Price: \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k per home session (2\\u20133 hours) \\u2014 significantly above clinic rates", "Market to hospitals, discharge coordinators, and orthopedic surgeons for post-surgery referrals", "Build a team of 5 physiotherapists as you scale \\u2014 take 30\\u201340% per session placed"]', 0),
('Vegan & Vegetarian Catering', 'vegan-catering', '🥦', 'trade', 'Cater exclusively to the rapidly growing vegan, vegetarian, and health-conscious community in Nigerian cities. Plant-based Nigerian food — moi moi, akara, jollof, and egusi without meat — is in high demand.', 1500, 50000, 'month', 'beginner', 20000, '["Food", "Niche", "Growing", "Instagram", "Chowdeck Partner App", "Food Containers", "WhatsApp Business", "Canva"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Master 20 Nigerian vegan dishes: plant-based ogbono, lentil moi moi, jackfruit asun, etc.", "Partner with vegan communities on Facebook, Instagram hashtags, and WhatsApp groups", "Sell via Chowdeck, Glovo, and direct WhatsApp \\u2014 build subscriber meal plan for \\u20a625k\\u2013\\u20a650k/month", "Cater corporate events where vegetarian options are requested (hospitals, law firms, tech companies)", "Create cooking classes for other aspiring vegan chefs at \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k per session"]', 0),
('Natural Hair & Locs Consultant', 'natural-hair-consultant', '💇', 'trade', 'Specialize in the care, growth, and styling of natural afro-textured hair and locs. As the natural hair movement grows across Nigeria, skilled consultants who treat hair without damage command premium prices.', 2000, 50000, 'month', 'beginner', 30000, '["Beauty", "Service", "Recurring", "Natural Hair Products", "Dreadlock Crochet Needles", "Steamer", "Instagram", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Get certified in natural hair care \\u2014 Aveda, TIGI, or a Nigerian-specific natural hair school", "Specialize further: loc maintenance is highest demand with least competition", "Price: \\u20a68k\\u2013\\u20a625k for loc maintenance depending on length; \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k for natural styling", "Build Instagram content showing your clients\' hair journeys \\u2014 transformation is magnetic content", "Sell your own branded natural hair product line (whipped shea butter, loc butter) as upsell"]', 0),
('Sleep Coaching & Insomnia Treatment', 'sleep-coaching', '😴', 'digital', 'Help urban professionals fix chronic insomnia, poor sleep quality, and sleep anxiety using CBT-I (Cognitive Behavioral Therapy for Insomnia) and sleep hygiene protocols. Demand is exploding.', 3000, 80000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Health", "Coaching", "Niche", "Oura Ring (recommend to clients)", "Calm App", "Zoom", "Notion", "Selar (course platform)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Get certified in CBT-I or sleep coaching \\u2014 AASM (American Academy of Sleep Medicine) offers online courses", "Niche down: \\"Sleep coaching for Nigerian shift workers\\" or \\"Corporate sleep optimization\\"", "Offer 6-week program at \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6200k per client including weekly Zoom sessions and daily tracking", "Partner with corporate HR departments \\u2014 poor sleep costs companies millions in lost productivity", "Build passive income: sell a self-paced \\"Sleep Reset\\" online course at \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a630k per student"]', 0),
('Professional Home & Office Organizer', 'professional-organizer', '🗂️', 'trade', 'Declutter, organize, and design functional spaces for homes and offices. The "KonMari" wave hit Nigeria — high-net-worth homeowners hire professional organizers for ₦100k–₦500k per project.', 2000, 50000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Service", "Lifestyle", "Premium", "Labeling Machine", "Storage Bins", "Instagram", "Notion (client briefs)", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Read \\"The Life-Changing Magic of Tidying Up\\" and get familiar with organizing frameworks", "Document your own home organization with before/after photos \\u2014 this is your portfolio", "Price: \\u20a650k for single room (half day), \\u20a6200k for full home (2 days), \\u20a6500k for luxury estates", "Target expats, new homeowners, and overwhelmed professionals via estate WhatsApp groups", "Add a virtual organizing service for clients abroad setting up a Nigerian home \\u2014 charge \\u20a650k/video session"]', 0),
('Personal Concierge Service for Expats', 'personal-concierge-expats', '🌐', 'trade', 'Help newly arrived expats navigate Lagos and Abuja: find accommodation, set up utilities, navigate bureaucracy, hire domestic staff, and source schooling. Expats pay ₦200k–₦500k for a smooth arrival package.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Service", "Premium", "Niche", "Notion (checklists)", "Google Maps", "WhatsApp Business", "LinkedIn", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Map every expat need in Lagos: accommodation areas, international schools, expat-friendly hospitals", "Build your service packages: \\"Arrival Package\\" (\\u20a6200k, covers first 2 weeks), \\"Settlement Package\\" (\\u20a6500k, first 3 months)", "Partner with multinationals: Chevron, Shell, MTN, and international NGOs whose staff constantly relocate", "Join Internations.org, Lagos Expat groups, and LinkedIn to reach incoming professionals", "Create a vetted domestic staff agency as a sister business \\u2014 house helps, drivers, cooks, and gatemen"]', 0),
('Grant Management for NGOs', 'grant-management-ngo', '📄', 'digital', 'Help Nigerian NGOs and CBOs write grant reports, manage donor relationships, and ensure compliance with international funding requirements. Grants total hundreds of millions — organizations pay well for help.', 5000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Finance", "NGO", "Consulting", "Salesforce NPSP", "DevResults", "Excel", "Notion", "Zoom"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Learn grant management frameworks: USAID, EU, UN Women, and Ford Foundation have free guidelines", "Get certified: INGO accountability standards, logical framework analysis, and M&E training online", "Build a portfolio: volunteer to manage a small NGO grant to prove competence", "Charge \\u20a6150k\\u2013\\u20a6500k per grant cycle depending on funder size and reporting complexity", "Create a monthly retainer: \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6200k/month for quarterly reporting + ongoing compliance support"]', 0),
('Drone Cinematography Business', 'drone-cinematography', '🎬', 'trade', 'Provide professional aerial drone footage for Nollywood films, real estate marketing, events, and corporate promos. Lagos skyline shots command ₦200k–₦1m for a day\'s work.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 500000, '["Film", "Tech", "Premium", "DJI Mavic 3 Pro", "ND Filter Set", "Extra Batteries", "DJI Fly App", "Adobe Premiere Pro"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy a professional drone: DJI Mavic 3 Pro or Air 3 (\\u20a6700k\\u2013\\u20a62m) \\u2014 don\'t cut corners on quality", "Register with NCAA (Nigerian Civil Aviation Authority) \\u2014 drone operators must be registered", "Build a reel: 2 minutes of your best aerial footage compiled across various environments", "Target: Nollywood productions (contact LFDP), luxury real estate developers, and wedding cinematographers", "Package for events: \\u20a6150k/half day, \\u20a6250k/full day including edited highlight reel"]', 0),
('Professional Food Photography Studio', 'food-photography', '📸', 'trade', 'Shoot mouth-watering food content for restaurant menus, recipe books, food delivery apps, and FMCG brands. Every restaurant opening in Nigeria needs professional food photos — and they pay ₦100k–₦500k.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 200000, '["Photography", "Creative", "B2B", "Sony A7IV or Canon R6", "Studio Lighting", "85mm Lens", "Adobe Lightroom", "Capture One"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Invest in a Sony A7 series or Canon R-series mirrorless + 85mm lens + 2 studio lights (\\u20a6400k total minimum)", "Learn food styling: the techniques that make food look irresistible on camera", "Create a portfolio of 10 foods from different categories: drinks, soups, desserts, grills", "Price: \\u20a650k for 10 hero shots, \\u20a6200k for full menu shoot, \\u20a6500k for brand campaign retainer", "Partner with restaurant opening companies, interior designers who refer you to new restaurant clients"]', 0),
('Podcast & Voiceover Studio Rental', 'podcast-studio-rental', '🎧', 'trade', 'Rent out soundproof recording studios by the hour to podcasters, voiceover artists, radio presenters, and musicians needing clean audio. Lagos\'s creator economy needs professional recording spaces.', 5000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 500000, '["Content", "Rental", "Recurring", "Acoustic Panels", "Shure SM7B Mic", "Focusrite Interface", "Logic Pro", "Calendly Booking"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Soundproof a room: acoustic panels, mass loaded vinyl, and proper door seals (\\u20a6150k\\u2013\\u20a6500k DIY)", "Equip with: professional condenser mic, audio interface, headphones, and a Mac with Logic Pro", "Price: \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a625k/hour or \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6100k/half day \\u2014 offer 4-hour packages for podcasters", "Market to radio stations, podcast hosts, corporate trainers recording e-learning content", "Add a livestreaming setup (\\u20a6100k extra) and charge premium rates for live Spaces, YouTube streams"]', 0),
('Eco-Tourism & Nature Tour Guide', 'eco-tourism-guide', '🌊', 'trade', 'Lead guided tours to Nigeria\'s hidden natural wonders: Erin Ijesha Falls, Idanre Hills, Ngel Nyaki Forest, and Yankari Game Reserve. Tourism is untapped gold in Nigeria and Nigerians are finally exploring.', 2000, 80000, 'month', 'beginner', 20000, '["Tourism", "Outdoor", "Creative", "4x4 Vehicle (hire initially)", "First Aid Kit", "WhatsApp Business", "Instagram", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Research 10 underexplored Nigerian natural sites \\u2014 document history, access routes, best seasons", "Register as a tour guide with NIHOTOUR (Nigerian Institute for Hospitality and Tourism)", "Price group tours: \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k per person for a 2-day trip, group of 8 = \\u20a6500k per trip", "Market on Instagram and TikTok \\u2014 \\"Hidden Nigeria\\" content gets millions of views consistently", "Partner with Lagos and Abuja hotels to recommend you to guest looking for weekend experiences"]', 0),
('Culinary Street Food Walking Tours', 'culinary-walking-tour', '🍡', 'trade', 'Lead curated street food tours through Lagos, Kano, or Enugu markets tasting suya, abacha, puff puff, zobo, and roasted corn. Expats and visiting diaspora pay ₦20k–₦50k per person for this experience.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 10000, '["Tourism", "Food", "Unique", "Airbnb Experiences", "Paystack", "Instagram", "WhatsApp Business", "Google Maps"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Map your city\'s best 15\\u201320 street food spots and build relationships with vendors", "Curate a 2\\u20133 hour walking or bus tour covering minimum 6 food stops with tastings included", "Price at \\u20a625k\\u2013\\u20a650k per person; minimum 4 guests per tour = \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6200k per session", "Market on Airbnb Experiences, Tripaneer, and expat Facebook groups in your city", "Create content from every tour \\u2014 reels of food, reactions, and markets go viral consistently"]', 0),
('Agro-Logistics Platform (Uber for Farms)', 'agro-logistics-platform', '🚛', 'digital', 'Build a digital platform connecting farm produce to buyers with reliable transportation. Nigeria loses 40% of produce to post-harvest waste — whoever solves logistics for farmers unlocks billions.', 8000, 250000, 'month', 'advanced', 500000, '["Agri-Tech", "Logistics", "Scalable", "WhatsApp Business API", "Bubble.io", "Google Workspace", "Paystack", "Flutterwave"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Start simple: WhatsApp + Google Sheets coordination before building an app", "Onboard 20 farmers and 10 truck owners in one state \\u2014 prove the model before scaling", "Build MVP using no-code tools (Bubble, Glide) to match farm produce to buyers and trucks", "Charge 5\\u201310% commission on each transaction facilitated through your platform", "Apply for NIRSAL, Tony Elumelu Foundation, or Lagos State agri-tech grants for expansion capital"]', 0),
('Mobile Soil Testing Laboratory', 'mobile-soil-lab', '🔬', 'trade', 'Drive to farms with portable soil testing equipment and provide instant pH, nitrogen, phosphorus, and micronutrient reports. Farmers spend millions on wrong fertilizers — your ₦30k report saves them ₦500k.', 2000, 80000, 'month', 'intermediate', 300000, '["Agriculture", "Tech", "B2B", "Hanna Instruments pH Meter", "NPK Test Kit", "Sample Collection Bags", "Laptop", "GPS Device"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy portable soil testing kit: Hanna Instruments or LaMotte field testing kits (\\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6500k)", "Learn to interpret results and make fertilizer recommendations \\u2014 IITA free training available", "Approach large farms first: cassava, maize, and rice farms in major agricultural states", "Price: \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k per farm (10\\u201320 samples) + recommendation report", "Partner with agro-dealers to sell the specific fertilizer your report recommends \\u2014 earn referral commission"]', 0),
('Home Energy Audit & Optimization', 'energy-audit-homes', '⚡', 'trade', 'Audit a homeowner\'s electricity usage, identify inefficiencies, and recommend solar, inverter, or appliance upgrades that reduce monthly electricity and diesel bills by 30–60%. Charge for the knowledge.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'intermediate', 50000, '["Solar", "Consulting", "Savings", "Clamp Meter", "Power Analyzer", "Fluke Multimeter", "Excel", "AutoCAD (optional)"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Learn energy audit methodology from ASHRAE free resources and Nigerian Electricity Regulatory Commission", "Buy: clamp meter, power analyzer, thermal camera (optional), and laptop for reporting", "Price: \\u20a630k for basic audit (report only), \\u20a680k for full audit + implementation plan", "Target Lekki, Victoria Island, and Abuja estates where diesel costs are \\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6500k/month", "Partner with solar companies and electricians to implement your recommendations and earn referral fees"]', 0),
('Smart Home Integration Specialist', 'smart-home-installation', '🏡', 'trade', 'Install smart home systems: automated lighting, security cameras, smart locks, Alexa/Google Home, and integrated appliances in high-end Lagos and Abuja homes. New build developers pay ₦500k–₦5m per installation.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 200000, '["Tech", "Premium", "Installation", "Control4 System", "Sonos", "Ring Security", "Alexa Hub", "Cable Management Tools"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Get certified in smart home technology: Crestron, Control4, or Lutron offer dealer training", "Start with simpler systems: Alexa smart bulbs, Ring doorbells, and smart plugs (\\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6200k package)", "Build a showroom: install smart home demo in your own space for client walkthroughs", "Target new real estate developments in Eko Atlantic, Lekki Gardens, and Pearl Gardens Abuja", "Offer lifetime support contract at \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a650k/month for the smart system you install"]', 0),
('Customized Home Library Design & Setup', 'customized-library-setup', '📚', 'trade', 'Design and install beautiful home libraries for book-loving professionals and executives. Custom shelving, organized collections, and aesthetic lighting — charge ₦200k–₦1m for a transformative space.', 3000, 80000, 'month', 'beginner', 50000, '["Interior", "Premium", "Niche", "SketchUp (design)", "Carpenter Network", "LED Strip Lights", "Book Organization System", "Instagram"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Partner with a carpenter to build custom shelving \\u2014 you design, they build, you project manage", "Develop 5 library styles: minimalist, Victorian, African, modern executive, and children\'s fantasy", "Price: \\u20a6150k small room (8 shelves), \\u20a6500k full library, \\u20a61m+ mansion library with ladder rails", "Source and offer curated books as an upsell \\u2014 partner with Book Plug NG, Rovingheights, or Terra Kulture", "Document every installation on Instagram and YouTube Shorts \\u2014 these go viral in Nigeria\'s design community"]', 0),
('Historical & Cultural Walking Tours', 'historical-walking-tour', '🏛️', 'trade', 'Lead storytelling-driven tours of Lagos Island, Old Calabar, Benin City, Kano Old City, or Ibadan\'s historical landmarks. School trips, diaspora visitors, and culture-curious Nigerians pay ₦10k–₦30k per person.', 1500, 40000, 'month', 'beginner', 10000, '["Tourism", "Education", "Creative", "Airbnb Experiences", "WhatsApp Business", "PayStack", "Instagram", "Portable Speaker"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Deep-dive research: interview elders, read Lagos/Benin/Kano history books, visit archives", "Create a 90-minute walking tour with 8\\u201310 stops \\u2014 each with a compelling story", "Register with NIHOTOUR and local tourism authorities \\u2014 some areas require official guide certification", "Price: \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a630k per person, minimum group of 5 = \\u20a6100k+ per tour", "Partner with Airbnb Experiences to list your tours internationally \\u2014 diaspora visitors book frequently"]', 0),
('Sensory-Friendly Event Planning', 'sensory-friendly-events', '🌈', 'trade', 'Plan and execute events specifically designed for children and adults with autism, sensory processing disorders, and developmental disabilities. A deeply underserved niche in Nigeria with high parental willingness to pay.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'intermediate', 50000, '["Events", "Inclusive", "Niche", "Noise-Canceling Headphones (rental)", "Sensory Toys", "Calm Lighting Equipment", "WhatsApp", "Canva"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Train in sensory processing understanding \\u2014 STAR Center or local special needs associations", "Learn to modify venues: reduce noise, create calm zones, avoid bright lights and crowds", "Partner with occupational therapists and special needs schools for client referrals", "Price: \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6300k for a sensory birthday party; \\u20a6300k\\u2013\\u20a6800k for school-wide inclusive events", "Create an advocacy platform alongside your business \\u2014 Nigerian parents of children with autism are a tight community"]', 0),
('Rainwater Harvesting System Installation', 'rainwater-harvesting-setup', '💧', 'trade', 'Design and install rooftop rainwater collection systems for homes, farms, and schools. With annual rainfall exceeding 1,000mm in southern Nigeria, a properly designed system provides free water year-round.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 50000, '["Green Energy", "Construction", "Water", "PVC Gutters", "First-Flush Diverter", "Water Storage Tank", "Filtration Media", "Pipe Fitting Tools"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Learn system design: collection area, first-flush diverters, filtration, and storage tank sizing", "Install a demo system on your own property or a willing homeowner (free) for portfolio photos", "Price: \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6200k residential, \\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a62m commercial/farm scale", "Target: rural schools (NGO contracts), commercial farms, and water-stressed communities", "Apply for RUWESA (Rural Water Supply and Sanitation Agency) contracts for government-funded installations"]', 0),
('Native Seed Exchange & Library', 'seed-exchange-library', '🌾', 'trade', 'Collect, preserve, and distribute heirloom and indigenous Nigerian seed varieties to farmers and gardeners. Climate change is wiping out native crops — you become the guardian of agricultural biodiversity.', 1000, 30000, 'month', 'beginner', 30000, '["Agriculture", "Community", "Niche", "Glass Storage Jars", "Silica Gel", "Label Maker", "WhatsApp Business", "Website (Hostinger)"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Research and collect 50+ heirloom Nigerian varieties: Ofada rice, Uda pepper, indigenous tomatoes", "Store seeds properly: cool, dry conditions with silica gel packets in labeled glass jars", "Launch a paid seed subscription: \\u20a65k/season for 10 seed packets with growing guides", "Partner with organic farms, permaculture groups, and NGOs working on food sovereignty", "Apply for IITA or FAO small grants for seed bank establishment \\u2014 strong funding opportunities exist"]', 0),
('Agro-Influencer & Farm Tech Reviewer', 'agro-influencer', '📱', 'digital', 'Build an audience reviewing farm equipment, seeds, fertilizers, and agri-tech tools for Nigerian farmers. Agri-brands pay ₦100k–₦500k for sponsored posts to reach your engaged farming audience.', 1500, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Social Media", "Agriculture", "Content", "Smartphone (minimum iPhone 13 quality)", "Ring Light", "CapCut", "TikTok", "YouTube Studio"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Choose platform: YouTube and TikTok for video, Instagram for photos \\u2014 start with TikTok for fastest growth", "Post 3 videos/week: farm tours, product reviews, \\"mistake I made\\" farming stories \\u2014 be honest and educational", "Build to 10k followers before approaching sponsors \\u2014 engagement rate matters more than follower count", "Charge: \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6300k sponsored post, \\u20a6500k/month brand ambassador deals", "Create a digital course or ebook on your farming specialty \\u2014 passive income alongside sponsorships"]', 0),
('Climate-Resilient & Hybrid Seed Sales', 'climate-resilient-seeds', '🌻', 'trade', 'Source and distribute IITA, AVRDC, and international hybrid seeds that are drought-resistant, high-yield, and disease-tolerant. Nigerian farmers lose crops to climate stress — better seeds change their lives.', 5000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 200000, '["Agriculture", "B2B", "High Value", "Seed Storage Facility", "Temperature Monitor", "Vehicle for Distribution", "Flutterwave", "Agronomist Partner"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Become an authorized dealer for SEEDAN, IITA TechnoServe, or Syngenta Nigeria", "Stock: drought-tolerant maize (TELA maize), improved cowpea, tomato TYLCV-resistant varieties", "Target: State Agricultural Development Programs (ADPs), large commercial farms, extension officers", "Price at 15\\u201330% above commodity seed prices \\u2014 quality commands premium if you educate buyers", "Add agronomy consulting: sell seeds + advise how to plant them = more trust and more sales"]', 0),
('AI Voice Cloning & Audio Production', 'ai-voice-cloning-service', '🎙️', 'digital', 'Clone voices and produce AI audiobooks, podcast intros, and brand voice assets for clients. With ElevenLabs and similar tools, one project can earn $300–$2,000 in hours of actual work.', 4000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 5000, '["AI", "Creative", "USD Income", "ElevenLabs", "Murf.ai", "Descript", "Adobe Audition", "Fiverr"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Master ElevenLabs, Murf.ai, and Descript for professional voice cloning and editing", "Build portfolio: create 3 sample audiobook chapters and 5 brand voice demos", "Target: self-published authors, podcast hosts, e-learning companies, and corporate brands", "Charge: \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6200k per audiobook chapter narration; $500\\u2013$2,000 per full book", "Add voice localization: translate and re-voice content in Yoruba, Igbo, or Hausa for local brands"]', 0),
('Notion Template Creator & Seller', 'notion-template-creator', '📋', 'digital', 'Build and sell Notion templates for productivity, business planning, freelancer invoicing, and student study systems. One viral template on Gumroad earns passive income months after creation.', 1000, 50000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Passive Income", "Digital", "No Capital", "Notion", "Gumroad", "Etsy", "Canva (mockups)", "TikTok"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Create a free Notion account and study the most popular templates on Notion.so marketplace", "Build 5 polished templates: freelancer CRM, budget tracker, content calendar, student planner, business OS", "List on Gumroad, Etsy, and Notion marketplace \\u2014 price \\u20a62k\\u2013\\u20a610k per template", "Create a free \\"lite\\" version to drive traffic to your paid premium template", "TikTok is the best marketing channel \\u2014 Notion productivity videos go viral constantly"]', 0),
('AI Art Prompt Engineer & Seller', 'ai-image-prompt-engineering', '🖼️', 'digital', 'Craft expert prompts for Midjourney, DALL·E, and Stable Diffusion and sell them on PromptBase. Prompt packs for logo design, portrait photography, and Nigerian art styles earn passive income.', 1000, 30000, 'month', 'beginner', 10000, '["AI", "Creative", "Passive Income", "Midjourney", "PromptBase", "Gumroad", "Stable Diffusion", "Canva"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Learn Midjourney and Stable Diffusion basics \\u2014 free on Discord and YouTube", "Test 100+ prompt variations to find formulas that consistently produce stunning results", "List prompt packs on PromptBase.com at $2\\u2013$5 each \\u2014 build a catalog of 50+ prompts", "Create niche prompt packs: Nigerian fashion photography, African architecture, Afrocentric art", "Sell on Gumroad as bundled \\"Ultimate Prompt Packs\\" for $20\\u2013$100 each"]', 0),
('AI Automation Consultant (ChatGPT/Claude)', 'chatgpt-automation-consultant', '🤖', 'digital', 'Help Nigerian SMEs integrate AI tools into their workflows to save time and money. Automate social media, customer service, report writing, and sales outreach using ChatGPT, Claude, and Zapier.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["AI", "B2B", "Consulting", "ChatGPT", "Claude", "Zapier", "Make.com", "Notion"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Build expertise: use ChatGPT for 30 days across 10 different business use cases \\u2014 document everything", "Create a \\"10 Ways AI Can Save Your Business 20 Hours/Week\\" LinkedIn article to attract leads", "Charge: \\u20a6150k for an AI audit + recommendations, \\u20a6300k for full implementation and staff training", "Target: law firms, real estate agencies, marketing agencies, and e-commerce brands", "Build a monthly retainer: \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6200k/month for ongoing AI support and new tool integration"]', 0),
('Paid Substack Newsletter', 'substack-newsletter-business', '📰', 'digital', 'Build a paid newsletter on Nigerian investing, tech, real estate, or culture. Substack writers with 500–2,000 paid subscribers at $5–$10/month earn $2,500–$20,000/month from writing alone.', 2000, 100000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Writing", "Passive Income", "Long Term", "Substack", "Twitter/X", "Beehiiv", "Canva", "LinkedIn"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Pick a high-value niche: Nigerian fintech analysis, Lagos real estate data, African startup funding news", "Publish 1\\u20132 free issues per week for 8 weeks before launching paid tier", "Price: $5/month or $50/year \\u2014 offer free-to-paid ratio of 10:1 (1 paid for every 10 free subscribers)", "Grow via Twitter/X threads that tease newsletter content \\u2014 link in bio strategy works best", "Monetize further: sponsored editions at $200\\u2013$500 per placement, digital products, events"]', 0),
('Faceless Niche Instagram Page Monetization', 'faceless-instagram-page', '📸', 'social', 'Build anonymous niche Instagram pages around Nigerian money, lifestyle, quotes, or facts. Pages with 100k+ followers earn ₦200k–₦1m/month from shoutout sales, affiliate links, and page flipping.', 500, 40000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Social Media", "Passive Income", "No Capital", "Buffer", "Later", "Canva", "CapCut", "Fameswap"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Choose a sticky niche: Nigerian millionaires lifestyle, Naija motivation, African tech news, daily business tips", "Repost top-performing content from global creators with credit \\u2014 curate the best 5%", "Post 3\\u20135 times/day consistently using scheduling tools \\u2014 consistency beats everything", "Monetize at 20k+ followers: \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a630k for story shoutouts, \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k for feed posts", "Sell the page once it hits 200k+ followers on Fameswap or directly \\u2014 pages sell for \\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a63m+"]', 0),
('UGC Creator (User Generated Content)', 'ugc-creator-nigeria', '🎬', 'social', 'Create authentic-looking product review and demonstration videos for brands — without needing a big following. UGC creators earn $50–$500 per video from brands that need content for ads.', 2000, 80000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["No Capital", "Brand Deals", "Creative", "iPhone/Android (good camera)", "CapCut", "Ring Light", "Billo", "Trend.io"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Build a 10-video UGC portfolio using products you already own at home \\u2014 film on your phone", "Create profiles on Billo, Trend.io, Insense, and Fiverr listing your UGC services", "Pitch directly to Nigerian and international DTC brands on Instagram and LinkedIn", "Charge $50\\u2013$100/video as a beginner, raise to $200\\u2013$500/video once you have 10 reviews", "Add \\"raw\\" footage packages \\u2014 brands buy unedited clips for $30\\u2013$80 each as add-ons"]', 0),
('TikTok Live Shopping Host', 'tiktok-live-seller', '🛍️', 'social', 'Sell products live on TikTok Shop using entertaining demonstrations and real-time Q&A. Top TikTok live sellers in Nigeria move ₦500k–₦5m of product per live session with engaging presentation.', 1500, 60000, 'week', 'beginner', 30000, '["Social Media", "Sales", "Trending", "TikTok Shop", "Ring Light", "Phone Stand", "CapCut", "Paystack"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Open a TikTok Shop seller account and list 5\\u201310 products to start", "Set up: ring light + phone stand + clean, well-lit background \\u2014 presentation is everything", "Go live at peak times: 7\\u201310pm and 12\\u20132pm \\u2014 stay live minimum 90 minutes per session", "Run live-only flash deals: \\"only during this live\\" urgency drives instant purchases", "Partner with suppliers who dropship \\u2014 you never need to hold stock if you structure it right"]', 0),
('WhatsApp Broadcast List Business', 'whatsapp-broadcast-business', '📲', 'digital', 'Build a large, segmented WhatsApp broadcast list around a niche (deals, jobs, forex, properties) and monetize via sponsored broadcasts, affiliate links, and paid subscriptions.', 500, 30000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["No Capital", "Daily Income", "Nigeria", "WhatsApp Business", "Canva", "Bit.ly (link tracking)", "Google Forms", "Paystack"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Choose a niche: daily Lagos property listings, remote job alerts, daily FX rates, or discount deal alerts", "Grow list to 500+ contacts organically: use Instagram/TikTok to drive people to your WhatsApp", "Post value 5\\u20136 days/week before introducing any monetization \\u2014 trust first, money second", "Charge brands \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a650k per sponsored broadcast to your engaged audience", "Add paid tier: \\u20a61,000\\u2013\\u20a63,000/month for premium subscribers who get exclusive deals or information first"]', 0),
('Twitter/X Ghostwriter for Founders', 'twitter-x-ghostwriter', '🐦', 'digital', 'Write viral Twitter/X threads and daily posts for African founders, VCs, and executives. Personal brand on X now converts to speaking gigs, clients, and fundraising — founders pay ₦100k–₦400k/month.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Writing", "B2B", "USD Income", "Twitter/X", "Hypefury", "Taplio", "Notion", "Grammarly"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Build your own Twitter/X presence to 2k+ followers \\u2014 this is your live portfolio", "Study viral thread formats: how-to threads, contrarian opinions, data-backed insights, personal stories", "Create 5 sample threads for fictional founders in fintech, agtech, and venture capital", "Cold DM 30 African founders daily: \\"I noticed your Twitter/X isn\'t getting the engagement your work deserves...\\"", "Charge: \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6200k/month for 1 thread/week + daily posts; manage 5 clients for \\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a61m/month"]', 0),
('Portable Toilet Rental Business', 'portable-restroom-rental', '🚻', 'trade', 'Rent portable toilets to event organizers, construction sites, and open-air markets. Nigeria has a massive sanitation infrastructure gap — every outdoor event needs this service and organizers pay without complaint.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 500000, '["Events", "B2B", "Recurring", "Chemical Toilets", "Vacuum Pump Truck", "Water Tanker", "WhatsApp Business", "Invoice App"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy 5\\u201310 portable chemical toilets (\\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6150k each) and a small water tanker for servicing", "Register with LASEPA or your state environmental agency \\u2014 required for commercial sanitation", "Target: outdoor concerts, church conventions, political rallies, and construction companies", "Price: \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a630k per toilet per event; weekly site rental \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a640k/toilet", "Expand: add handwashing stations (\\u20a630k each) as premium add-on \\u2014 hygiene is trending"]', 0),
('Mobile Vulcanizing & Tyre Service', 'vulcanizer-express', '🔧', 'trade', 'Offer mobile tyre repair, inflating, and replacement to stranded motorists and estates. A mobile vulcanizer with a compressor van earns ₦10k–₦50k daily serving a radius of 5km.', 2000, 30000, 'day', 'beginner', 50000, '["Daily Cash", "Transport", "Mobile", "Air Compressor", "Tyre Repair Kit", "Bead Breaker", "WhatsApp Business", "Second-Hand Vehicle"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy: portable air compressor, tyre repair kit, bead breaker (\\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k total)", "Get basic tyre fitting training (1\\u20133 days from any experienced vulcanizer)", "Join estate WhatsApp groups and offer \\"call anytime\\" emergency tyre service", "Charge: \\u20a6500\\u2013\\u20a61,000 for puncture repair, \\u20a62k\\u2013\\u20a65k for tyre change, \\u20a61k for full inflation", "Add tyre sales: stock 20\\u201330 used imported tyres (tokunbo) at \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a620k each, sell at 30\\u201350% markup"]', 0),
('Iron Gate & Burglar Proof Fabrication', 'iron-fabrication-gates', '⚒️', 'trade', 'Fabricate and install iron gates, window burglary proofs, staircases, and railings. Every new building in Nigeria needs these — there is literally unlimited demand and margins are 40–80%.', 3000, 80000, 'month', 'intermediate', 100000, '["Construction", "Skilled Trade", "High Demand", "Arc Welder", "Angle Grinder", "Measuring Tools", "Spray Compressor", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Learn welding and fabrication from a workshop apprenticeship (3\\u20136 months) or vocational school", "Buy core equipment: arc welding machine, angle grinder, measuring tools, cutting disc (\\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6200k)", "Build portfolio samples: fabricate a gate and burglar proof for family/friend for free", "Approach property developers, estate managers, and construction site supervisors for contracts", "Scale: hire 3\\u20135 skilled welders and manage projects \\u2014 pure management income"]', 0),
('Pure Water Refill Station (Sachet/Bottle)', 'water-refill-station', '💧', 'trade', 'Operate a NAFDAC-registered water refilling station providing 20-litre bottles at ₦300–₦500 each. Estates, offices, and homes are permanent customers who order 5–20 bottles weekly.', 2000, 50000, 'day', 'beginner', 500000, '["Daily Cash", "NAFDAC", "Recurring", "RO Water System", "20L Bottles", "Sealing Machine", "Dispatch Motorcycles", "NAFDAC License"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Get NAFDAC water refilling station license \\u2014 apply through NAFDAC nearest office (2\\u20134 weeks)", "Install RO (Reverse Osmosis) water treatment system \\u2014 \\u20a6300k\\u2013\\u20a61m depending on capacity", "Source food-grade 20-litre bottles (\\u20a62,000 each) and caps \\u2014 200 bottles is minimum stock", "Hire dispatch riders to deliver \\u2014 customers order via WhatsApp and pay on delivery", "Scale: add sachet water production line for roadside and market sales \\u2014 doubles volume quickly"]', 0),
('Auto Body Repair & Paint Shop', 'panel-beater-paint-shop', '🚗', 'trade', 'Repair dented vehicles and respray car bodies. Lagos alone has millions of cars — and every day, dozens are dented in traffic. A skilled panel beater earns ₦50k–₦200k per car job.', 4000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 200000, '["Skilled Trade", "Daily Cash", "High Demand", "Dent Puller", "Air Compressor", "Spray Gun", "Body Filler", "PPF (Paint Protection Film)"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Undergo apprenticeship (6\\u201312 months) or enroll in NABTEB panel beating/auto painting program", "Buy equipment: dent pulling tools, body fillers, air compressor, spray guns, booth setup", "Start with minor dent repairs to build reputation before tackling full resprays", "Charge: dent removal \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a620k, panel replacement \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k, full respray \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6300k", "Partner with insurance companies for accident repair referrals \\u2014 this is where steady B2B volume comes from"]', 0),
('Solar Panel Installation Business', 'rooftop-solar-installation', '☀️', 'trade', 'Install solar power systems for homes and businesses tired of NEPA blackouts. A 5kVA solar system earns the installer ₦200k–₦400k profit per installation as Nigeria accelerates energy transition.', 5000, 200000, 'month', 'intermediate', 200000, '["Energy", "High Demand", "Recurring", "Solar Panels", "Inverters", "Battery Banks", "Crimping Tools", "REES Certification"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Get solar installation training from RESA Nigeria, NARICT, or solar equipment vendors", "Get certified: NASENI or REES solar installer certification boosts client trust significantly", "Install a solar system in your own home as a live portfolio \\u2014 photograph and document everything", "Partner with solar equipment importers in Lagos (Alaba, Ikeja) for wholesale pricing", "Build a maintenance contract business: \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k/month per system for monitoring and servicing"]', 0),
('Fumigation & Pest Control Service', 'fumigation-pest-control', '🦟', 'trade', 'Provide termite, cockroach, rodent, and mosquito fumigation for homes, offices, and food stores. Monthly service contracts with estates and restaurants create automatic recurring income.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 30000, '["Recurring", "B2B", "Daily Cash", "Fogging Machine", "Chemical Concentrates", "PPE", "Sprayer Pump", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Get PCO license from your state (Lagos LASEPA, Abuja FCDA) \\u2014 mandatory for commercial fumigation", "Buy: motorized fogging machine (\\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a660k), chemical concentrates, PPE (gloves, mask, suit)", "Start with residential jobs: estates, apartments \\u2014 charge \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a630k per 3-bedroom apartment", "Pitch monthly service contracts to: restaurants, hospitals, warehouses, offices, and schools", "Upsell: termite treatment (\\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6300k per property) \\u2014 very high margin, long-lasting chemical"]', 0),
('Laundry Pickup & Delivery Service', 'laundry-pickup-delivery', '🧺', 'trade', 'Collect clothes, wash and iron professionally, then deliver back to busy professionals and bachelors. Subscription laundry services in Lagos estates earn ₦50k–₦300k monthly per 50 subscribers.', 1500, 40000, 'week', 'beginner', 30000, '["Recurring", "Daily Cash", "Low Capital", "Washing Machine", "Steam Iron", "Laundry Bags", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy: automatic washing machine (\\u20a660k\\u2013\\u20a6120k), steam iron, clothes horse, and hampers", "Offer monthly subscriptions: \\u20a615k/month for weekly pickup + delivery of 10kg max \\u2014 simple pricing", "Market in estate WhatsApp groups, bachelor residence groups, and corporate office buildings", "Hire ironing assistants at \\u20a6500\\u2013\\u20a61,000 per hour as volume grows \\u2014 focus on quality control", "Add premium services: dry cleaning (outsource to dry cleaner, add 50% markup), stain removal, shoe cleaning"]', 0),
('Plastic Chair & Table Rental Business', 'chair-table-rental', '🪑', 'trade', 'Rent plastic chairs, tables, and tents to events every weekend. 500 chairs rented at ₦200/chair per event generates ₦100k+ per weekend — without any work beyond delivery and collection.', 3000, 80000, 'week', 'beginner', 300000, '["Events", "Daily Cash", "Asset", "Plastic Chairs (500+)", "Folding Tables (50+)", "Storage Shed", "Delivery Van", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy 300\\u2013500 plastic chairs (\\u20a62,500\\u2013\\u20a64,000 each) and 50\\u2013100 folding tables (\\u20a65,000 each)", "Get a storage space: shed, compound corner, or rented yard \\u2014 chairs need weather protection", "Market in estate WhatsApp groups, church groups, and event planner communities", "Charge: \\u20a6150\\u2013\\u20a6300 per chair per day; \\u20a6500\\u2013\\u20a61,000 per table per day \\u2014 delivery fee extra", "Hire van drivers for delivery \\u2014 or partner with an existing delivery service for logistics"]', 0),
('Community Cold Storage & Mini Abattoir', 'mini-cold-storage-rental', '❄️', 'trade', 'Provide refrigerated storage space to market traders, meat sellers, and smallholder farmers who cannot afford private cold rooms. A 5-ton cold room rented to 10 vendors generates ₦200k–₦500k monthly.', 5000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 2, '["B2B", "Agriculture", "Recurring", "Cold Room Unit", "Industrial Generator", "Temperature Monitor", "Weighing Scale", "Invoice App"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Install a 5\\u201310 ton cold room unit (\\u20a62m\\u2013\\u20a65m including installation and generator backup)", "Charge vendors: \\u20a6500\\u2013\\u20a62,000 per slot per day depending on volume stored", "Target: meat sellers, fishmongers, caterers, frozen food distributors, and agricultural cooperatives", "Add value: provide slaughtering services for \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k per animal (partner with a licensed butcher)", "Expand: add a packaging and branding service for vendors who want to move up-market"]', 0),
('Mutual Fund & Investment Distribution Agent', 'mutual-fund-agent', '📈', 'trade', 'Refer clients to SEC-registered mutual funds (Stanbic IBTC, ARM, Coronation, United Capital) and earn upfront and trailing commissions. Building a client base of 50 investors generates passive monthly income.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Finance", "Recurring Commission", "No Capital", "Excel/Google Sheets", "Paystack (for seminars)", "WhatsApp Business", "LinkedIn", "Canva (for materials)"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Study: SEC investment advisor exam materials and understand key fund products", "Register as a distributor/agent with 2\\u20133 fund managers: Stanbic IBTC, ARM, Coronation", "Build client list: target salary earners who have never invested \\u2014 there are millions of them", "Earn: 1\\u20133% upfront commission on every investment placed + 0.5\\u20131% annual trailing commission", "Host free \\"Money Basics\\" seminars at churches, offices, and estates to generate a pipeline of investors"]', 0),
('Forex Trading Signal Provider', 'forex-signal-provider', '📊', 'digital', 'Provide paid forex and crypto trade signals to subscribers via Telegram. Verified signal providers with a 60%+ win rate charge $10–$50/month per subscriber — 500 subscribers = $5,000–$25,000/month.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Finance", "Crypto", "Recurring", "MetaTrader 4/5", "MyFXBook", "Telegram", "Cornix Bot", "TradingView"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Trade a live account for 3+ months and document every trade \\u2014 create a verifiable track record", "Use MyFXBook to publish your statistics publicly \\u2014 social proof is everything in this space", "Launch a Telegram channel; offer 2-week free trial before converting to paid subscriptions", "Charge: $10\\u2013$20/month for standard signals; $50\\u2013$100/month for VIP with entry, TP, and SL levels", "Add a Telegram bot for automatic signal delivery \\u2014 Cornix or 3Commas handles automation"]', 0),
('Invoice Discounting & Trade Finance', 'invoice-discounting-nigeria', '💸', 'digital', 'Provide short-term cash to SMEs by buying their outstanding invoices at a discount. Buy a ₦1m invoice at ₦850k and collect ₦1m from the debtor in 30–60 days — 17.6% return in 60 days.', 10000, 500000, 'month', 'advanced', 500000, '["Finance", "B2B", "High Return", "Legal Agreement Templates", "Google Sheets (tracking)", "Paystack", "LinkedIn", "Legal Counsel"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Understand invoice discounting: you buy receivables at discount, collect face value from debtor", "Start with trusted network: family businesses, former colleagues, church members with B2B invoices", "Conduct due diligence: verify the debtor company, confirm invoice legitimacy, check payment history", "Charge 10\\u201320% discount rate for 30\\u201360 day payment terms \\u2014 negotiate based on debtor creditworthiness", "Register with SEC if scaling above \\u20a650m \\u2014 seek legal advice on structure to stay compliant"]', 0),
('Thrift Store & UK/US Fashion Bale Business', 'thrift-store-nigeria', '👗', 'trade', 'Buy imported used clothing bales (okirika/bend-down-boutique) from Lagos markets and sell individual items at 200–500% markup. Fashion-conscious young Nigerians are obsessed with thrifted designer finds.', 2000, 50000, 'day', 'beginner', 30000, '["Fashion", "Daily Cash", "Trending", "Instagram", "TikTok", "WhatsApp Business", "Canva", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Visit Yaba market (Lagos), Wuse 2 (Abuja), or Ariaria (Aba) to see bale grades and prices", "Start with one grade A mixed clothing bale (\\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k) containing 50\\u2013100 items", "Sort items: keep premium items for Instagram sells, bundle average items in bags for market", "Price: \\u20a62k\\u2013\\u20a615k per item on Instagram/TikTok; \\u20a6500\\u2013\\u20a62k per item at market or WhatsApp", "Create viral content: unboxing bales on TikTok has millions of views \\u2014 use this for free marketing"]', 0),
('Agent Banking (Super Agent) Business', 'agent-banking-agent', '🏦', 'trade', 'Operate as a Super Agent under OPay, Moniepoint, PalmPay, or FirstMonie, with multiple sub-agents under you. Earn on every transaction your network processes — a network of 20 agents generates ₦200k–₦1m/month.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 50000, '["Finance", "Daily Cash", "Nigeria", "OPay Agent App", "Moniepoint POS", "PalmPay Agent", "Float Calculator", "WhatsApp Group"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Apply for Super Agent status with OPay, Moniepoint, or Palmpay \\u2014 requires BVN, ID, guarantors", "Recruit 10\\u201320 sub-agents in your network: market traders, kiosk owners, estate security men", "Train each agent: transaction processing, float management, and daily settlement procedures", "Earn: \\u20a620\\u2013\\u20a6100 per transaction your network processes; volume is everything in this model", "Provide float financing to reliable agents at 5\\u201310% monthly interest for additional income"]', 0),
('JAMB/WAEC Exam Preparation Center', 'exam-prep-center', '🎓', 'trade', 'Run a dedicated exam coaching center for JAMB, WAEC, NECO, and GCE. Every year, over 1.5 million candidates sit JAMB alone — the demand for quality preparation is inexhaustible.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'beginner', 100000, '["Education", "Recurring", "High Demand", "Projector", "Past Questions PDFs", "Whiteboards", "WhatsApp Groups", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Rent a classroom space (\\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6200k per year) in a residential area with many secondary school students", "Hire subject experts for English, Maths, Physics, Chemistry, Biology, and Commerce", "Charge: \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k per student per 3-month intensive term \\u2014 aim for 50+ students minimum", "Add digital component: WhatsApp study groups, past question PDFs, and recorded lesson videos", "Market to: secondary schools (partnership), church notices, community boards, and parents WhatsApp groups"]', 0),
('Kids Coding & Robotics Academy', 'coding-bootcamp-kids', '💻', 'trade', 'Teach children aged 7–16 coding, robotics, and digital skills through weekend or after-school programs. Nigerian parents invest heavily in tech education — classes of 15 kids at ₦25k/month = ₦375k monthly.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 200000, '["Education", "Tech", "Recurring", "Scratch", "Micro:bit Kits", "Python (IDLE)", "Laptops/Tablets", "Canva (marketing)"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Get certified: Scratch, Python for Kids, or MIT App Inventor instructor credentials (online)", "Rent a classroom or partner with a school to use their computer lab on weekends (revenue share)", "Curriculum: Scratch (beginner), Python basics, HTML/CSS, and micro:bit robotics", "Charge: \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k/month per child for 2x weekly 2-hour sessions", "Partner with international accreditation bodies like Code.org or Scratch Foundation for certification"]', 0),
('French & Arabic Language School', 'language-school-nigeria', '🌍', 'trade', 'Teach French and Arabic — the most commercially valuable languages for Nigerians. French opens ECOWAS business opportunities; Arabic is essential for northern Nigerian trade and Islamic studies.', 3000, 80000, 'month', 'beginner', 30000, '["Education", "Recurring", "B2B", "Alliance Fran\\u00e7aise Curriculum", "Zoom", "Canva", "WhatsApp Groups", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Get teaching credentials: Alliance Fran\\u00e7aise (French) or Arabic Language Institute teaching certification", "Rent a small classroom or use your home initially \\u2014 start with 10\\u201320 students", "Offer corporate packages: company pays for employee French training (ECOWAS trade requirement)", "Add DELF/DALF French exam preparation \\u2014 these international certifications command premium fees", "Online expansion: teach via Zoom for diaspora Nigerians and continental African clients in Francophone countries"]', 0),
('Life Skills & Career Readiness Coach for Teens', 'life-skills-coach-teens', '🧠', 'trade', 'Teach teenagers financial literacy, public speaking, interview skills, and entrepreneurship through weekend workshops. Parents of secondary school students in urban areas pay ₦20k–₦50k per workshop.', 3000, 80000, 'month', 'beginner', 20000, '["Education", "Coaching", "Niche", "Canva (workbooks)", "Zoom", "WhatsApp", "Paystack", "Google Classroom"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Develop a 6-session life skills curriculum: money basics, communication, goal setting, CV writing", "Partner with private secondary schools who want to add value to their students \\u2014 they often pay you", "Charge parents: \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a630k per child for a 6-week Saturday program", "Film all sessions and package as an online course for passive income at \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a620k per student", "Get testimonials from students who got into universities or jobs after your coaching \\u2014 marketing gold"]', 0),
('Scholarship & Fully-Funded Program Coach', 'study-abroad-scholarship-coach', '🎓', 'digital', 'Help Nigerians identify and apply for fully-funded scholarships (Chevening, Fulbright, Mastercard, DAAD). Families pay ₦50k–₦300k for a coach who can get their child into a funded program.', 2000, 80000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Education", "High Ticket", "Coaching", "Zoom", "Notion", "Paystack", "Twitter/X", "Scholarshipportal.com"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Build authority: share free scholarship opportunity posts on Twitter/X and LinkedIn daily", "Create a database of 200+ active scholarships organized by field, country, and eligibility", "Offer tiered service: \\u20a630k for scholarship list + tips, \\u20a6100k for full application review, \\u20a6200k for personal statement coaching", "Host monthly \\"Scholarship Masterclass\\" webinars at \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a610k per seat \\u2014 sell 50\\u2013100 seats", "Use your success stories relentlessly: every student who gets a scholarship is a testimonial to feature prominently"]', 0),
('Nollywood Extras & Casting Agency', 'nollywood-extras-casting', '🎥', 'trade', 'Supply extras, background actors, and minor roles to Nollywood and YouTube film productions in Lagos. A casting agent managing 200 registered extras earns ₦5k–₦20k per extra placed per production.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 20000, '["Creative", "Entertainment", "Niche", "Google Sheets (database)", "WhatsApp Group", "Canva (talent cards)", "Instagram", "Bank Account"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Build a database of 200 diverse extras: different ages, ethnicities, body types, and skills", "Partner with Nollywood producers, Netflix/Prime Video Nigeria scout teams, and indie filmmakers", "Register extras: headshots, measurements, skills (horse riding, dance, fight scenes, crowd scenes)", "Charge productions: \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a630k agency fee per extra placed; extras keep 80\\u201390% of their day rate", "Expand: talent management for minor speaking roles \\u2014 earn 15\\u201320% of talent fees long-term"]', 0),
('Beat Licensing & Music Production', 'music-beat-licensing', '🎵', 'digital', 'Produce Afrobeats, Amapiano, and Alté beats and license them to artists worldwide on BeatStars and Airbit. Top Nigerian producers earn $500–$10,000 per beat on exclusive license deals.', 2000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 50000, '["Creative", "Passive Income", "USD Income", "FL Studio", "BeatStars", "MIDI Keyboard", "Studio Monitors", "YouTube"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Set up: laptop + FL Studio or Ableton (key software) + MIDI keyboard + studio monitors", "Produce 20+ high-quality beats across Afrobeats, Amapiano, and Drill sub-genres", "Upload to BeatStars.com, Airbit, and Soundclick \\u2014 price leases at $29\\u2013$99, exclusives at $300\\u2013$2,000+", "Market beats via YouTube beat videos, Instagram reels showing production process, and TikTok", "Build email list of artists by offering free beats in exchange for email \\u2014 build a subscriber base of 2,000+"]', 0),
('Wedding Officiant & Ceremony Designer', 'wedding-officiant-service', '💍', 'trade', 'Legally officiate civil weddings and design custom ceremony scripts for couples who want personalized vows and non-religious celebrations. Lagos and Abuja wedding season runs year-round.', 2000, 80000, 'month', 'beginner', 20000, '["Events", "Creative", "High Ticket", "Marriage License", "Microphone", "Ceremony Script Templates", "Instagram", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Get licensed: obtain Marriage Registrar certification from your local government (30\\u201360 days process)", "Study ceremony design: different cultural traditions, vow writing, ring exchange formats", "Build portfolio: officiate 3 weddings at reduced rates for testimonials and photos", "Charge: \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6150k for basic ceremony; \\u20a6150k\\u2013\\u20a6400k for full ceremony design + officiation", "Add services: custom vow writing (\\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k) and day-of ceremony coordinator (\\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6100k)"]', 0),
('Nigerian Podcast Network & Hosting Agency', 'podcast-hosting-agency', '🎙️', 'digital', 'Build and monetize a network of 10–20 Nigerian podcasts across different niches under one agency brand. The network sells sponsorship packages at ₦500k–₦2m per campaign to reach all shows simultaneously.', 5000, 200000, 'month', 'advanced', 200000, '["Creative", "Media", "Scalable", "Riverside.fm", "Buzzsprout", "Spotify for Podcasters", "Canva", "HubSpot CRM"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Identify and recruit 10 passionate Nigerians to host shows in distinct niches: tech, finance, parenting, health, culture", "Provide studio support: basic recording equipment loan, editing service, and distribution setup", "Distribute across: Spotify, Apple Podcasts, Google Podcasts, and Audiomack", "Sell network sponsorship packages to FMCG brands, fintech companies, and Nigerian startups", "Build a listener analytics dashboard \\u2014 reach metrics are what brands pay for"]', 0),
