('Drone & Property Aerial Photography', 'property-listing-photographer', '📷', 'trade', 'Capture stunning aerial drone footage and photography of properties, estates, and land for real estate agents and developers. One drone session earns ₦30k–₦150k and the entire industry needs this service.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 200000, '["Real Estate", "Tech", "Premium", "DJI Mini 3 Pro / Air 3", "NCAA Permit", "Adobe Premiere Pro", "Instagram", "Google Drive"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy: DJI Mini 3 Pro (\\u20a6200k) for entry or DJI Air 3 (\\u20a6500k) for professional-grade work", "Get NCAA drone operator permit (mandatory in Nigeria for commercial drone flying)", "Build portfolio: film 5 properties for free \\u2014 real estate agents will immediately see the value", "Charge: \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k for residential, \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6300k for estate developer aerial maps", "Add 3D mapping service using DJI Terra software \\u2014 developers pay \\u20a6500k+ for precise plot mapping"]', 0),
