('Legal Document Drafting Service', 'legal-document-drafting', '⚖️', 'digital', 'Draft tenancy agreements, business contracts, employment letters, NDAs, and partnership deeds for SMEs and individuals. Simple legal documents earn ₦10k–₦80k each; complex agreements earn ₦150k–₦500k.', 3000, 80000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Legal", "B2B", "Remote", "Google Docs", "Docusign", "LinkedIn", "Paystack", "Legal Template Library"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Create a template library: 20 document types with customizable fields \\u2014 this is your product inventory", "Market on LinkedIn, Instagram, and law school alumni groups as a \\"Legal Document Drafter\\"", "Charge: tenancy agreement \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a630k, business contract \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6100k, shareholders\' agreement \\u20a6150k\\u2013\\u20a6400k", "Partner with a registered lawyer to review complex documents \\u2014 split the fee 60/40", "Build a subscription: \\u20a630k/month for businesses needing ongoing contract drafting support"]', 0),
('Forensic Accounting & Fraud Investigation', 'forensic-accounting-consulting', '🔍', 'digital', 'Investigate financial fraud, embezzlement, and accounting irregularities for companies, law firms, and insurance companies. One forensic engagement earns ₦500k–₦5m — demand grows as Nigerias fraud problem grows.', 10000, 400000, 'month', 'advanced', 0, '["Finance", "Consulting", "Premium", "ACL Analytics", "Excel (advanced)", "IDEA Software", "CFPB Case Management", "Secure Cloud Storage"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Get certified: CFE (Certified Fraud Examiner) \\u2014 globally recognized, offered by ACFE.com", "Build expertise: study Nigerian financial crime case law, EFCC prosecution patterns, and corporate fraud schemes", "Join ACFE Nigeria Chapter and build a referral network with law firms handling commercial litigation", "Position on LinkedIn as forensic accounting expert \\u2014 share industry insights weekly for visibility", "Charge: \\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a62m for initial forensic review; \\u20a62m\\u2013\\u20a65m for expert witness engagement in court"]', 0),
('Agricultural Drone Mapping & Field Analysis', 'drone-mapping-agriculture', '🚁', 'trade', 'Use drones to map farmland, detect crop stress, measure field sizes, and generate NDVI vegetation health reports for commercial farmers. A 500-hectare farm mapping earns ₦500k–₦2m per session.', 10000, 300000, 'month', 'intermediate', 800000, '["Agriculture", "Tech", "B2B", "DJI Matrice/Phantom 4 Multispectral", "Pix4D", "DroneDeploy", "NCAA Permit", "GPS Survey Tools"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Invest in a multispectral drone: DJI Matrice or Phantom 4 Multispectral (\\u20a61.5m\\u2013\\u20a64m) for NDVI mapping", "Get trained: Pix4D or DroneDeploy training certification (online) for professional data processing", "Get NCAA commercial drone permit \\u2014 mandatory before any paid commercial flight", "Target: CBN Anchor Borrowers Program farms, NIRSAL-funded commercial farms, and large plantation estates", "Partner with an agronomy firm \\u2014 you fly and map, they interpret and advise \\u2014 shared revenue model"]', 0),
('Container Shop & Pop-Up Space Rental', 'modular-container-business', '📦', 'trade', 'Convert shipping containers into retail shops, offices, or food kiosks and lease them to small business owners who can\'t afford conventional shop rents. Monthly container lease income is entirely passive once placed.', 4000, 120000, 'month', 'intermediate', 2, '["Real Estate", "Retail", "B2B", "Shipping Container", "Conversion Contractor", "Land Lease Agreement", "WhatsApp", "Legal Agreement Template"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy a 20ft or 40ft shipping container: \\u20a6800k\\u2013\\u20a62m for a good used one", "Convert to a retail shop: paint, electrical, ventilation, security \\u2014 \\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6400k conversion cost", "Place on leased land near a market, school, or estate entrance \\u2014 negotiate ground rent at \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6200k/year", "Lease your container shop at \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6200k/month depending on location and size", "Scale: buy 5\\u201310 containers, cluster them as a mini shopping complex \\u2014 multiple passive income streams"]', 0),
('HR Outsourcing for SMEs', 'hr-outsourcing-sme', '👥', 'digital', 'Provide full HR services (recruitment, payroll, performance management, compliance) to small businesses that can\'t afford a full-time HR manager. Charge ₦150k–₦500k/month per client for ongoing HR support.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["B2B", "Consulting", "Recurring", "BambooHR", "Zoho People", "Paystack Payroll", "Google Workspace", "LinkedIn"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Create a service menu: recruitment, payroll processing, employee handbook drafting, disciplinary process management", "Target: startups (10\\u201350 employees), NGOs, and SMEs who are scaling but can\'t afford a full-time HR", "Charge: \\u20a6150k\\u2013\\u20a6300k/month for standard HR outsourcing covering payroll, recruitment, and compliance", "Use Zoho People, BambooHR, or Paystack Payroll as your backend tech stack \\u2014 efficient and professional", "Build to 10 retainer clients at \\u20a6200k each = \\u20a62m/month for ongoing management work"]', 0),
('Residential Estate Management Company', 'estate-management-company', '🏘️', 'trade', 'Manage residential estates: collect service charges, oversee maintenance, manage security, and coordinate utilities for estate residents. Managing 3 estates of 100 units earns ₦5m–₦15m/year in management fees.', 10000, 300000, 'month', 'advanced', 100000, '["Real Estate", "B2B", "Recurring", "Estate Management Software", "WhatsApp Communication Channels", "Paystack Bulk Payment", "Legal Templates", "CCTV Systems"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Study estate management law: service charge collection rights, service level agreements, and resident dispute resolution", "Build a team: facility manager, security coordinator, maintenance supervisor, and accountant", "Pitch to: estate associations looking for professional management, developers launching new estates", "Charge: 8\\u201315% of annual service charge collected as management fee", "Differentiate: offer real-time online reporting, monthly maintenance reports, and 24/7 emergency hotline"]', 0),
('EV Charging Station Business', 'electric-vehicle-charging', '⚡', 'trade', 'Install and operate electric vehicle charging points for homes, estates, and commercial areas. Nigeria\'s EV market is still emerging but early movers who build charging infrastructure will dominate.', 5000, 300000, 'month', 'advanced', 2, '["Green Energy", "Infrastructure", "Future", "Level 2 AC EV Charger", "Solar Panel System", "NERC Registration", "IoT Management Platform", "Payment Gateway"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Research: import Level 2 AC chargers (22kW) from China or Europe \\u2014 \\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a61.5m per unit installed", "Install at: hotel parking lots, shopping malls, premium estate entrance gates, and corporate offices", "Charge per kWh dispensed: \\u20a6150\\u2013\\u20a6300/kWh depending on location and competition", "Partner with solar installers to offer solar-powered EV charging \\u2014 strong green credentials", "Register with NERC (Nigerian Electricity Regulatory Commission) as an energy service provider"]', 0),
('Biomass Briquette Production (Waste to Energy)', 'waste-to-energy-briquette', '🔥', 'trade', 'Convert agricultural waste (rice husks, sawdust, groundnut shells) into compressed fuel briquettes for cooking and industrial use. Briquettes are cheaper than charcoal, cleaner, and in growing demand.', 5000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 500000, '["Green Energy", "Manufacturing", "Export", "Briquette Press Machine", "Dryer", "Storage Shed", "Quality Testing Kit", "NEPC Export Registration"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Source agricultural waste for free or near-free from rice mills, saw mills, and groundnut processors", "Buy a briquette press machine: hydraulic or mechanical (\\u20a6300k\\u2013\\u20a61.5m depending on capacity)", "Produce and test: proper compression ratio creates denser briquettes with longer burn time", "Target: hotels, restaurants, caterers, bakeries, and industries looking to reduce fuel costs", "Export: European and Middle Eastern markets pay premium for certified biomass fuel \\u2014 explore with NEPC"]', 0),
('Baby-Proofing & Home Safety Installation', 'baby-proofing-service', '👶', 'trade', 'Install safety gates, corner guards, drawer locks, socket covers, and non-slip mats for homes with infants and toddlers. New parents in Lagos and Abuja pay ₦50k–₦200k for a fully baby-proofed home.', 1500, 40000, 'month', 'beginner', 20000, '["Service", "Niche", "Growing", "Baby Safety Kit", "Drill Set", "WhatsApp Business", "Instagram", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Source baby-proofing supplies from Jumia, Amazon (shipped), or Children\'s Place Nigeria", "Learn installation techniques: stair gates, cabinet locks, anti-tip furniture straps, window guards", "Create before/after Instagram content \\u2014 new parents respond emotionally and share widely", "Partner with pediatric hospitals, baby shower planners, and maternity brands for referrals", "Offer home safety audit as a standalone service (\\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a620k) \\u2014 upsell into full installation"]', 0),
('Mini Co-Working Space / Study Hub', 'co-working-space', '🏢', 'trade', 'Convert a residential space into a membership-based co-working space for freelancers, remote workers, and students. 30 members at ₦20k/month = ₦600k/month from one apartment-sized space.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 500000, '["Real Estate", "B2B", "Recurring", "Fast WiFi Router", "Ergonomic Furniture", "Access Control System", "Paystack", "Instagram"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Choose location: near a university, tech hub, or corporate area \\u2014 foot traffic is essential", "Set up: fast WiFi (minimum 50Mbps), ergonomic chairs, power outlets at every desk, printing, and a kitchen area", "Pricing tiers: hot desk \\u20a63k/day, dedicated desk \\u20a630k/month, private office \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6200k/month", "Market to: NYSC corps members, graduates job-hunting, freelancers, remote workers, and students cramming for exams", "Add revenue: host paid events, corporate training, and workshops at off-peak hours for extra \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6300k/month"]', 0),
('SEO Content Writing Agency', 'seo-content-agency', '🔍', 'digital', 'Build a niche SEO content agency writing articles that rank on Google for international clients. Agencies billing $3,000–$10,000/month per client are achievable with a team of 5 Nigerian writers.', 5000, 200000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["USD Income", "Scalable", "Remote", "Surfer SEO", "Ahrefs", "Google Docs", "Slack", "Payoneer"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Learn on-page SEO fundamentals: keyword research, meta tags, internal linking, content structure", "Hire 3 Nigerian writers at \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a610k per article \\u2014 vet them with a paid test article first", "Land 1 anchor client at $1,500/month for 10 articles \\u2014 do exceptional work for 90 days", "Use Surfer SEO or NeuronWriter to optimize every article before delivery", "Scale: each new writer you hire adds capacity for another $1,500\\u2013$3,000/month client"]', 0),
('Etsy Digital Downloads Shop', 'etsy-digital-shop', '🛒', 'digital', 'Sell printable planners, wall art, wedding invitations, budget trackers, and checklists on Etsy. One viral listing earns $500–$5,000/month passively from downloads worldwide.', 1000, 50000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Passive Income", "Global", "No Capital", "Canva", "Etsy", "Pinterest", "Erank", "Marmalead"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Open Etsy shop ($0.20 per listing fee \\u2014 very cheap to start)", "Create 20\\u201330 digital products in Canva: planners, checklists, wall art, trackers, invitations", "Research top-selling Etsy digital items using Erank or Marmalead keyword tools", "Price $2\\u2013$10 each \\u2014 volume is the game on Etsy, low prices = more impulse buys", "Promote with Pinterest: create pins linking to your listings \\u2014 Pinterest drives massive Etsy traffic for free"]', 0),
('Amazon KDP (Kindle Self-Publishing)', 'amazon-kdp-publishing', '📗', 'digital', 'Write and publish low-content books (journals, notebooks, planners, activity books) on Amazon KDP. No writing skill needed for low-content — design once and earn royalties forever.', 1000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Passive Income", "USD", "Writing", "Canva", "Amazon KDP", "Publisher Rocket", "Book Bolt", "Helium 10"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Start with low-content: create lined journals, gratitude diaries, password books \\u2014 design in Canva", "Upload to KDP.amazon.com \\u2014 free to publish, Amazon takes 40% and pays 60% royalties", "Research niches using Publisher Rocket or Helium 10 to find low-competition, high-demand book categories", "Publish 10\\u201330 books to build a catalog \\u2014 more titles = more passive royalty streams", "Add high-content books (short guides, how-to books) for $5\\u2013$15 royalties per sale at higher profit"]', 0),
('Canva Template Store (Etsy/Gumroad)', 'canva-template-store', '🎨', 'digital', 'Design and sell Canva templates for social media posts, business proposals, pitch decks, and resumes. One popular template pack on Etsy earns $200–$2,000/month with zero ongoing work.', 1000, 50000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Passive Income", "Creative", "Global", "Canva Pro", "Etsy", "Gumroad", "Creative Market", "Pinterest"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Design 5\\u201310 templates per niche: Instagram bundle, pitch deck pack, or resume kit in Canva", "Package as shareable Canva template links \\u2014 buyers get editable access instantly after purchase", "List on Etsy, Gumroad, and Creative Market \\u2014 sell on all three simultaneously", "Price bundles $15\\u2013$49 \\u2014 higher prices actually convert better for professional template packs", "Market on TikTok and Instagram showing before/after of template transformations \\u2014 hugely viral"]', 0),
