('Online Course Creator (Teachable/Selar)', 'online-course-creation', '🎓', 'digital', 'Package your knowledge into a structured online course and sell it forever. Nigerian experts in accounting, real estate, fashion, tech, and cooking are earning ₦1m–₦10m/month from courses.', 5000, 200000, 'month', 'intermediate', 30000, '["Passive Income", "Expert Knowledge", "Scalable", "Selar", "Teachable", "Loom", "Canva", "Mailchimp"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Choose your topic: what do people always ask you? What have you done that others want to learn?", "Outline 5\\u20138 modules with 3\\u20135 short video lessons each \\u2014 60\\u201390 minute total course is ideal for beginners", "Record using phone camera + ring light + Loom (free) \\u2014 perfection is the enemy of done", "Host on Selar (Nigeria, Naira payments) or Teachable/Gumroad (global, USD payments)", "Marketing funnel: TikTok/Instagram content \\u2192 free lead magnet \\u2192 email list \\u2192 course sale"]', 0),
('Web3 / Crypto Community Manager', 'web3-community-manager', '🌐', 'digital', 'Manage Discord servers, Telegram groups, and Twitter/X communities for crypto projects, NFT collections, and DeFi protocols. Web3 projects pay $2,000–$10,000/month for skilled community managers.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Crypto", "USD Income", "Remote", "Discord", "Telegram", "Twitter/X", "MEE6 Bot", "Notion"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Get active in 5 crypto/Web3 Discord communities as a regular engaged member for 30 days", "Learn the tools: Discord moderation, bot management (MEE6, Collab.Land), Telegram admin features", "Build proof: volunteer to mod a small project\'s Discord for 30 days \\u2014 get a reference", "Apply on Crypto.jobs, Web3.career, and LinkedIn \\u2014 filter for \\"Community Manager\\" in Web3 category", "Expand to multi-project management: handle 2\\u20133 communities simultaneously for $4k\\u2013$15k/month total"]', 0),
('Podcast Guest Booking Agent', 'podcast-guest-booker', '🎤', 'digital', 'Book guests for podcasts and secure podcast appearances for thought leaders. PR agencies and podcast managers pay $500–$2,000/month for someone to research, pitch, and schedule guests.', 3000, 80000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Remote", "USD Income", "Networking", "Podchaser", "ListenNotes", "Gmail (pitch templates)", "Calendly", "Notion"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Study the landscape: know the top 50 podcasts in niches like business, entrepreneurship, fintech, wellness", "Create pitch email templates: short, value-focused, and personalized for each host", "Land your first client: a local Nigerian coach or author who wants podcast visibility", "Charge: $500\\u2013$1,000/month for 5 guaranteed podcast bookings; $2,000/month for 15 bookings", "Productize: create a \\"10 Podcast Appearances in 60 Days\\" package for personal brands \\u2014 charge $3k"]', 0),
