('POP Ceiling & Interior Finishing Service', 'ceiling-installation', '🏗️', 'trade', 'Install POP (Plaster of Paris) ceilings, cornices, and decorative wall finishes for homes and offices. Every new building needs ceiling finishing — a skilled team earns ₦50k–₦300k per job.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 30000, '["Construction", "Skilled Trade", "High Demand", "POP Materials", "Trowel & Hawk", "Mixing Equipment", "Scaffold Stand", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Learn POP installation from an experienced artisan \\u2014 2\\u20134 week apprenticeship is sufficient", "Buy tools: hawk, trowel, mixing bucket, float, cornicing mold (\\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k total)", "Practice first: help a more experienced plasterer on 3 jobs before going solo", "Charge per square meter: \\u20a61,500\\u2013\\u20a63,000/sqm for plain ceiling; \\u20a63,000\\u2013\\u20a68,000/sqm for detailed cornice work", "Scale: hire 3\\u20135 trained artisans and manage multiple jobs simultaneously \\u2014 project management model"]', 0),
('Generator Servicing & Maintenance Contracts', 'generator-maintenance-contract', '⚡', 'trade', 'Service, maintain, and repair generators for estates, hospitals, schools, and businesses on monthly contracts. Nigeria\'s permanent power outages guarantee never-ending demand for reliable generator technicians.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 30000, '["Recurring", "Technical", "B2B", "Generator Service Toolkit", "Multimeter", "OBD Scanner", "Spare Parts Stock", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Learn generator mechanics: carburettor cleaning, oil change, AVR replacement, battery maintenance (YouTube + apprenticeship)", "Offer free first service to 5 estate managers \\u2014 demonstrate quality and reliability", "Charge monthly maintenance contracts: \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a630k/month per generator (includes 2 services/month)", "Target: estate generators (10\\u201350 generators in one estate = \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6500k/month from one client)", "Add: emergency breakdown response at \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a630k extra \\u2014 premium service for premium clients"]', 0),
