('Window Tinting & Solar Film Installation', 'window-tinting-film', '🪟', 'trade', 'Apply reflective tinting film on building windows and vehicle windshields for heat reduction, privacy, and aesthetics. One residential building earns ₦50k–₦200k; one car earns ₦15k–₦50k.', 2000, 50000, 'month', 'beginner', 30000, '["Construction", "Recurring", "Low Capital", "Solar Film Rolls", "Squeegee Set", "Heat Gun", "Cutting Tools", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy solar/tint film rolls wholesale: commercial quality from Alaba market or importers (\\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k/roll)", "Learn installation from YouTube: squeegee technique, heat gun use, edge sealing \\u2014 1 week practice", "Offer to tint 3 friends\' car windows for free to build installation speed and quality", "Charge: \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k per car window, \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6200k for full building solar film installation", "Target: new office buildings, houses in hot areas (Abuja, Kano, Ibadan), and car dealers for fleet tinting"]', 0),
('Epoxy & 3D Floor Coating Service', 'epoxy-flooring', '🏠', 'trade', 'Apply epoxy resin flooring and 3D floor art in homes, offices, restaurants, and showrooms. An epoxy floor job earns ₦100k–₦800k depending on size — demand is soaring as Nigerians upgrade interiors.', 4000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 100000, '["Interior Design", "Construction", "Premium", "2-Part Epoxy", "Metallic Pigments", "Floor Grinder", "Rollers & Squeegees", "UV Topcoat"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Learn from YouTube + practice on a concrete slab: surface prep, primer coat, base coat, 3D design layer, topcoat", "Buy epoxy starter kit: 2-part epoxy, primer, metallic pigments, UV topcoat (\\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6150k for one job)", "Build portfolio: do your own room or a family/friend kitchen for dramatic before/after photos", "Charge per sqm: plain epoxy \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a610k/sqm; metallic epoxy \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a620k/sqm; 3D art \\u20a625k\\u2013\\u20a660k/sqm", "Target: restaurants, car showrooms, gym floors, clinic waiting areas \\u2014 high traffic, high visibility spaces"]', 0),
('Signage & Billboard Fabrication', 'signage-fabrication', '🪧', 'trade', 'Design and fabricate signboards, illuminated signs, LED billboards, and shop branding for businesses. Every new business needs a sign — and existing businesses rebrand constantly. Great B2B revenue.', 4000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 200000, '["B2B", "Manufacturing", "Daily Cash", "Vinyl Cutter", "LED Strip Lights", "CorelDraw", "Aluminium Composite Board", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy core equipment: vinyl cutter (\\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6200k), LED strip lights, aluminium composite board, router", "Learn design basics on CorelDraw or Adobe Illustrator \\u2014 1\\u20132 weeks self-teaching is sufficient", "Build portfolio: fabricate signs for 3\\u20135 local shops at cost price \\u2014 photograph on installation day", "Charge: simple sign \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k, illuminated LED sign \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6200k, large outdoor billboard \\u20a6300k\\u2013\\u20a61m", "Target: new business openings, banks, schools, hospitals, and corporate offices for regular orders"]', 0),
('Tile & Marble Floor Installation', 'tiling-marble-installation', '🪟', 'trade', 'Lay tiles, marble, granite, and terrazzo floors for homes and offices. Every completed building in Nigeria needs tiling — a skilled tiler and a helper earns ₦20k–₦80k/day on residential projects.', 3000, 80000, 'day', 'beginner', 20000, '["Construction", "Skilled Trade", "Daily Jobs", "Tile Cutter", "Notched Trowel", "Rubber Mallet", "Spirit Level", "Mixing Bucket"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Learn tiling from a master tiler apprenticeship (1\\u20133 months) or NABTEB vocational training", "Buy tools: notched trowel set, tile cutter, rubber mallet, spacers, level (\\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k)", "Start: assist an experienced tiler on 5 jobs to build speed and pattern-laying competence", "Charge per sqm: plain ceramic \\u20a61,500\\u2013\\u20a62,500/sqm, marble/granite \\u20a63,000\\u2013\\u20a66,000/sqm", "Scale: build a team of 3\\u20135 tilers to run multiple sites simultaneously \\u2014 take management cut"]', 0),
('Fashion Alterations & Custom Tailoring Atelier', 'fashion-alterations-atelier', '✂️', 'trade', 'Offer premium fashion alteration, tailoring, and custom dressmaking for weddings, events, and everyday wear. Expert tailors in Lekki and Wuse earn ₦500k–₦2m monthly from alteration and custom work alone.', 2000, 80000, 'month', 'beginner', 50000, '["Fashion", "Creative", "Recurring", "Industrial Sewing Machine", "Serger", "Measuring Tape", "Instagram", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Invest in: industrial sewing machine (\\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6120k), serger, professional iron, and fitting mannequins", "Specialize: bridal alterations, men\'s corporate alterations, or agbada customization \\u2014 niche focus builds word-of-mouth", "Set prices: zip replacement \\u20a62k, taking-in \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a610k, bridal gown alteration \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a6100k, full custom \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6300k", "Partner with bridal stores and fashion boutiques for alteration referrals on every sale they make", "Build Instagram presence with video of alterations in progress \\u2014 transformation content goes extremely viral"]', 0),
('Heliciculture (Snail Export Business)', 'heliciculture-snail-export', '🐌', 'trade', 'Farm giant African land snails (Archachatina marginata) for local restaurants and West African export markets. Nigeria exports thousands of tons of snails to Europe and the USA — demand far exceeds supply.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 30000, '["Agriculture", "Export", "Low Capital", "Concrete Pen", "Wire Mesh", "Soil Mix", "Calcium Supplements", "NAFDAC Export Registration"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Set up a concrete pen or wire mesh enclosure under shade with loamy soil for burrowing", "Source breeding stock from NIHORT Ibadan or local markets \\u2014 start with 200 snails minimum", "Feed: cabbage, pawpaw, banana peel, and calcium sources (eggshells) \\u2014 very low feeding cost", "Harvest at 8\\u201312 months: 200 snails become 2,000+ after one breeding cycle (10x multiplication)", "Sell: local restaurants \\u20a6500\\u2013\\u20a61,000 per snail; export to diaspora market via registered exporters"]', 0),
('Smoked Fish Processing & Distribution', 'smoked-fish-processing', '🐟', 'trade', 'Process and smoke fresh catfish, tilapia, and mackerel for local markets, supermarkets, and export. Smoked fish has a 2–4 week shelf life and sells at 2–3x the fresh fish price — huge margin business.', 3000, 100000, 'week', 'beginner', 50000, '["Food Processing", "Daily Sales", "Agriculture", "Drum Smoker/Kiln", "Vacuum Sealer", "Weighing Scale", "NAFDAC Registration", "Cold Storage"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Build or buy a smoking kiln: traditional clay kiln (\\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a630k) or improved drum smoker (\\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k)", "Source fresh fish: directly from fish farmers or Kainji/Volta lake at farm-gate prices (30\\u201350% cheaper)", "Process: gut, wash, dry-brine for 30 minutes, smoke at 60\\u201380\\u00b0C for 4\\u20136 hours \\u2014 seal in vacuum bags", "Sell to: supermarkets (Shoprite, Game, Market Square), market traders, and high-income estate estates", "Export premium: vacuum-sealed smoked catfish to Nigerian diaspora in UK/US via registered export courier"]', 0),
('Palm Kernel Oil Production & Export', 'palm-kernel-oil-production', '🌴', 'trade', 'Extract and refine palm kernel oil from oil palm nuts for cosmetic, food, and industrial markets. Palm kernel oil sells for $1,200–$1,800/ton internationally — Nigeria produces 2.7m tons/year but exports very little.', 10000, 300000, 'month', 'intermediate', 500000, '["Agriculture", "Export", "Manufacturing", "Palm Kernel Cracker", "Expeller Press", "Refinery Unit", "NAFDAC/SON Certification", "Storage Tanks"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Source palm nuts from oil palm farms in Cross River, Edo, Ondo, or Akwa Ibom states", "Buy a palm kernel cracking and extraction machine (\\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6800k depending on capacity)", "Process: crack nuts, dry kernels, extract oil via expeller or solvent \\u2014 refine for cosmetic-grade", "Get NAFDAC and SON certification for food-grade and NAFDAC for cosmetic-grade PKO", "Export channel: NEPC buyer-matching for Asian and European cosmetic manufacturers \\u2014 premium pricing"]', 0),
('Aquaponics Farm (Fish + Vegetables)', 'aquaponics-farm', '🐠', 'trade', 'Combine fish farming and vegetable growing in one integrated system — fish waste feeds plants, plants clean the water. Sell fish and vegetables simultaneously from the same footprint with minimal water use.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 500000, '["Agriculture", "Urban Farming", "Dual Income", "IBC Tanks", "Submersible Pump", "Grow Beds", "Water Quality Tester", "Fish Feed"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Design system: fish tank (IBC tote or concrete pond) + grow beds (gravel or floating raft) + pump and aeration", "Stock with 200\\u2013500 catfish fingerlings (\\u20a650\\u2013\\u20a6100 each) + plant tomatoes, lettuce, basil, spinach in grow beds", "Monitor daily: pH 6.8\\u20137.4, ammonia levels, dissolved oxygen \\u2014 consistent monitoring is the success key", "Sell fish to restaurants at premium (\\u20a61,500\\u2013\\u20a63,000/kg for live catfish), herbs/vegetables to hotels", "Add agro-tourism: charge \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k for farm visits and aquaponics training tours \\u2014 secondary income"]', 0),
('Freshly Squeezed Juice Production & Distribution', 'fruit-juice-production', '🍊', 'trade', 'Produce and bottle cold-pressed or freshly squeezed fruit juices from local Nigerian fruits for restaurants, gyms, offices, and direct consumers. 100% Nigerian fruit juices command premium health-market prices.', 2000, 60000, 'day', 'beginner', 50000, '["Food", "Daily Sales", "Health", "Commercial Juicer", "Cold Press Machine", "NAFDAC Notification", "Glass/PET Bottles", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Source fruits direct from farms or Mile 12 market at wholesale prices: zobo, pawpaw, pineapple, cucumber, watermelon", "Buy commercial juicer/cold-press machine (\\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6200k) and food-grade bottles with caps", "Get NAFDAC notification number (simplified process for packaged juices) \\u2014 takes 2\\u20136 weeks", "Price: 500ml bottle \\u20a6500\\u2013\\u20a61,000; sell to gyms, restaurants, offices, and Instagram customers", "Build WhatsApp subscription: \\u20a610k/week for 10 bottles delivered daily to your front door \\u2014 sticky recurring model"]', 0),
('Artisan Spice Blending & Seasoning Brand', 'spice-blending-brand', '🌶️', 'trade', 'Create signature Nigerian spice blends — suya spice, jerk marinade, pepper soup mix, and egusi blend — and sell them packaged to supermarkets, restaurants, and diaspora markets worldwide.', 1500, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 20000, '["Food", "Export", "Brand Building", "Commercial Grinder", "Vacuum Sealer", "NAFDAC Notification", "Label Printer", "Shopify (for export)"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Perfect 3\\u20135 signature blends: suya spice, pepper soup mix, nkwobi mix, dry pepper blend \\u2014 recipe-test obsessively", "Package in branded pouches or glass jars with ingredients list and origin story \\u2014 aesthetics sell food products", "Get NAFDAC notification before any commercial sales \\u2014 mandatory for packaged food", "Sell: Instagram DMs, Shoprite, game food halls, specialty grocers, and diaspora export via DHL", "Build export: UK, USA, and Canada diaspora pay $5\\u2013$15 per 100g pack \\u2014 10x local margins"]', 0),
('Commercial Beekeeping & Honey Production', 'honey-bee-farming', '🐝', 'trade', 'Farm honeybees for honey, beeswax, propolis, and royal jelly production. Nigerian honey exports are rising sharply — organic, unprocessed honey sells at ₦5,000–₦15,000/kg to premium markets.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 50000, '["Agriculture", "Export", "Passive Income", "Langstroth Hives", "Bee Suit + Veil", "Extractor Machine", "Filter & Bottling Equipment", "NAFDAC Registration"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Get training from NASC beekeeping department or existing apiarists (1\\u20132 weeks is sufficient)", "Start with 5\\u201310 Langstroth hives placed near flowering trees or farmland (cost \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a625k/hive)", "Harvest honey twice yearly: December\\u2013January and June\\u2013July \\u2014 one hive yields 10\\u201330kg per harvest", "Process: filter, bottle in branded glass jars, label with origin and harvest date \\u2014 premium positioning", "Sell: health food stores, pharmacies, gyms, Instagram, and diaspora export at premium price"]', 0),
('Local Tomato Paste & Pepper Sauce Production', 'tomato-paste-production', '🍅', 'trade', 'Process fresh Nigerian tomatoes and Scotch bonnet peppers into branded tomato paste and hot sauce. Nigeria imports $360m of tomato paste annually while local tomatoes rot on farms — huge opportunity.', 10000, 300000, 'month', 'intermediate', 500000, '["Food Processing", "Manufacturing", "NAFDAC", "Industrial Blender", "Cooking Vessels", "Canning Machine", "NAFDAC Registration", "Cold Storage"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Source: buy directly from Kano, Kaduna, or Jos tomato farmers at \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a660k/ton during harvest", "Equipment: industrial blender (\\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6200k), cooker, concentrating equipment, canning line or pouch filler", "Get NAFDAC registration (mandatory for packaged food products) \\u2014 apply immediately", "Test market: sell fresh-frozen paste to restaurants first before canning \\u2014 validates demand with less capital", "Package in 70g, 200g, and 800g cans or pouches \\u2014 price 20\\u201330% below Gino and Tomapep to gain market share"]', 0),
('Nigerian Snack Brand (Chin-Chin, Puff-Puff, Buns)', 'chinchin-puff-puff-brand', '🍩', 'trade', 'Produce and distribute branded Nigerian snacks to schools, offices, retail outlets, and online. Chin-chin costs ₦200 to produce per kg and sells for ₦700–₦1,500/kg — a 250–650% gross margin.', 2000, 60000, 'day', 'beginner', 20000, '["Food", "Daily Sales", "Scalable", "Deep Fryer", "Mixing Machine", "Branded Packaging", "NAFDAC Notification", "WhatsApp Vendor Network"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Perfect recipes: chin-chin, puff-puff, buns, and kokoro \\u2014 consistency is the product", "Package professionally: clear branded bags with sticker labels, weight, and NAFDAC notification number", "Sell to: schools (tuck shops buy weekly), offices (canteen stock), party planners, and retail kiosks", "Build a WhatsApp vendor network: 20 people selling your snacks on 30% commission = massive scale", "NAFDAC notification is simple and cheap for packaged snacks \\u2014 get it before scaling distribution"]', 0),
('Tax Filing & FIRS Compliance Service', 'tax-filing-service', '📋', 'digital', 'File personal income tax, company income tax, VAT, and WHT for individuals and businesses with FIRS. Every registered business must file — most have no idea how. You solve this pain for ₦30k–₦200k per filing.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Finance", "Recurring", "B2B", "FIRS TaxPro-Max", "QuickBooks", "Excel", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Get trained on FIRS TaxPro-Max portal \\u2014 free guides available on FIRS website", "Understand key filings: Company Income Tax (CIT), Value Added Tax (VAT), WHT, PAYE, and Personal Income Tax", "Charge: personal ITR \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a630k, company CIT \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6150k, full-year VAT compliance \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6300k/year", "Market aggressively from January\\u2013March (tax season rush) and September\\u2013October (annual filings due)", "Build recurring: annual compliance package \\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6500k/business covering all quarterly and annual filings"]', 0),
('Pension & Retirement Planning Advisory', 'pension-advisory', '👴', 'digital', 'Help Nigerian employees maximize their RSA pension contributions, choose the right PFA, and plan for retirement. A trusted pension advisor managing 50 clients earns ₦200k–₦500k monthly in consulting fees.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Finance", "Long Term", "B2B", "Excel (retirement projections)", "PenCom Portal", "Zoom", "Paystack", "LinkedIn"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Get certified: SEC Stockbroker/Investment Adviser license or PenCom-recognized qualification", "Understand RSA, AVC (Additional Voluntary Contributions), and retirement benefit calculations for all PFAs", "Offer free retirement readiness assessment \\u2014 a 30-minute conversation to hook the relationship", "Charge: \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k for initial retirement plan; \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a630k/month ongoing advisory retainer", "Target: government workers, academics, oil industry professionals \\u2014 largest pension balances in Nigeria"]', 0),
('Export Documentation & Shipping Agent', 'export-documentation-agent', '🌍', 'digital', 'Handle export documentation — Form M, shipping bills, phytosanitary certificates, COO — for Nigerian exporters. A documentation agent earns ₦50k–₦200k per shipment managed for clients who hate bureaucracy.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Export", "Logistics", "B2B", "NCS NICIS2 Portal", "NEPC e-Exporter Portal", "Excel", "WhatsApp", "Google Drive"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Study NEPC, NCS (Nigeria Customs Service), NAFDAC, and SON export documentation requirements", "Register as a customs agent with the Nigerian Customs Service \\u2014 requires passing the customs agents exam", "Partner with freight forwarders (DHL, Maersk, CMA-CGM) for preferred agent status", "Charge: \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6100k documentation fee + actual government charges passed through to client", "Build a network: one agro-exporter doing 4 shipments/year = \\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6400k annually from one client"]', 0),
('Domiciliary Account & Dollar Income Setup Advisor', 'dollar-domiciliary-setup', '💵', 'digital', 'Help Nigerians open domiciliary accounts, set up Payoneer/Wise, and route dollar income properly. With millions of Nigerians wanting to earn in USD, this consultancy earns ₦10k–₦50k per client setup session.', 1000, 30000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Finance", "No Capital", "Nigeria", "Zoom", "Payoneer", "Wise", "Grey.co", "Canva (for guides)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Master the full process: domiciliary account (GTBank, Zenith, UBA), Payoneer, Wise, and Grey.co setup", "Create step-by-step setup guides with screenshots \\u2014 sell as a \\u20a63k\\u2013\\u20a65k PDF guide first", "Offer 1-hour setup consultation via Zoom or WhatsApp at \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a630k per session", "Upsell: \\"Dollar Freelancer Starter Kit\\" \\u2014 account setup + Upwork profile + first client strategy = \\u20a650k", "Target: fresh graduates wanting to start freelancing, employed Nigerians adding digital income streams"]', 0),
('Telemedicine & Remote Doctor Consultation', 'telemedicine-platform', '💊', 'digital', 'Build or operate a telemedicine platform connecting Nigerian patients with doctors via video call. Patients pay ₦3,000–₦15,000 per consultation — a platform with 500 daily consults earns ₦1.5m–₦7.5m/day.', 10000, 500000, 'month', 'advanced', 500000, '["Healthcare", "Tech", "Scalable", "Doxy.me", "Whereby API", "Paystack", "Firebase", "WhatsApp Notifications"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Partner with 10 licensed MDCN-registered doctors for your initial medical panel", "Build a simple booking + video call platform using Whereby API or Doxy.me white-label solution", "Get MDCN approval for your telemedicine service \\u2014 mandatory for operating legally in Nigeria", "Charge: \\u20a63,000\\u2013\\u20a610,000 per 30-minute consultation; doctor earns 60\\u201370%, platform earns 30\\u201340%", "Add: medication delivery partnership with online pharmacy (Healthplus, Medplus) for full service loop"]', 0),
('Private Ambulance & Medical Transport', 'ambulance-service', '🚑', 'trade', 'Operate private ambulance services for medical emergencies, inter-hospital transfers, and event medical coverage. One ambulance on a hospital contract earns ₦500k–₦2m/month guaranteed.', 10000, 500000, 'month', 'advanced', 5, '["Healthcare", "Transport", "Premium", "Toyota Hiace (Converted)", "Medical Equipment Set", "MDCN Registration", "GPRS Tracking", "WhatsApp Emergency Line"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Acquire a well-equipped ambulance: converted Toyota Hiace with stretcher, oxygen, AED, and basic medications", "Register with MDCN and your state ministry of health \\u2014 mandatory for medical transport", "Partner with 3\\u20135 private hospitals for inter-hospital transfer contracts \\u2014 hospitals always need this", "Hire a registered nurse or paramedic to accompany each ambulance \\u2014 non-negotiable for safety", "Add event coverage: concerts, sporting events, film sets at \\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6500k/day for standby coverage"]', 0),
('Medical Equipment & Supply Distribution', 'medical-supply-distribution', '🩺', 'trade', 'Distribute medical consumables (gloves, syringes, drip sets, masks) and equipment to clinics, hospitals, and pharmacies. Healthcare supply distribution is a recession-proof, perpetually growing market.', 10000, 300000, 'month', 'intermediate', 500000, '["Healthcare", "B2B", "High Value", "NAFDAC Registration", "Delivery Van", "QuickBooks (inventory)", "Excel", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register with NAFDAC as a medical device/consumable distributor \\u2014 mandatory for all medical supplies", "Source from: local distributors (Medplus, Drugfield), or import from India/China direct for better margins", "Build a hospital and clinic client list: target tier-2 hospitals that buy \\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a63m of consumables monthly", "Offer 30-day credit terms to trusted hospital procurement officers \\u2014 credit terms win large accounts", "Add value: just-in-time delivery, stock management support, and emergency supply guarantee"]', 0),
('Mobile Optometry & Vision Care Service', 'eye-care-mobile', '👁️', 'trade', 'Bring eye tests and corrective lens dispensing directly to schools, corporate offices, and communities. An optometrist with mobile equipment earns ₦50k–₦300k per corporate screening day.', 5000, 200000, 'day', 'intermediate', 500000, '["Healthcare", "Premium", "B2B", "Autorefractor", "Trial Lens Set", "Portable Slit Lamp", "WhatsApp Business", "Invoice App"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register with MRTBN (Medical Rehabilitation Therapists Board of Nigeria) as an optometrist", "Buy portable equipment: autorefractor, ophthalmoscope, trial lens set, slit lamp (\\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a62m)", "Pitch to corporate HR: \\"Annual Employee Eye Health Day\\" \\u2014 sell it as a productivity and compliance benefit", "Charge: \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k per employee tested; supply frames and lenses at \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a660k per pair sold", "Partner with private schools for annual student vision screenings at \\u20a63k\\u2013\\u20a68k per student"]', 0),
('Corporate Training & L&D Company', 'corporate-training-company', '🏢', 'digital', 'Deliver soft skills, leadership, and professional development training to Nigerian corporates. One 2-day training program for 30 staff earns ₦500k–₦2m — and companies run these quarterly.', 10000, 300000, 'month', 'advanced', 50000, '["B2B", "Education", "Scalable", "PowerPoint", "Zoom (virtual)", "WhatsApp Business", "LinkedIn", "Paystack"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Develop 3\\u20135 flagship programs: leadership development, communication skills, customer service excellence, project management", "Get CIPM, CIM, or similar certification \\u2014 corporate HR managers require trainer credentials before signing", "Create a training proposal template for cold outreach to company HR and L&D managers", "Charge: \\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a62m per 2-day in-house program for 20\\u201350 participants", "Build a roster of 5 specialist facilitators \\u2014 offer a full L&D menu without needing to deliver everything yourself"]', 0),
('SaaS Reseller & Licensing Agent (Nigeria)', 'saas-reseller', '💻', 'digital', 'Resell software licenses for Microsoft Office 365, Google Workspace, QuickBooks, Slack, and other business SaaS tools to Nigerian companies. Earn 10–30% recurring commission on every subscription you sell.', 3000, 80000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Tech", "Recurring", "B2B", "Microsoft Partner Portal", "Google Workspace Reseller", "QuickBooks", "Slack", "Paystack"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Register as a Microsoft Partner, Google Workspace Reseller, and QuickBooks ProAdvisor \\u2014 all free to apply", "Build a client list: SMEs, law firms, schools, and NGOs that need licensed, affordable business software", "Earn: 10\\u201320% recurring commission on every monthly/annual subscription you place and manage", "Bundle with setup and migration support \\u2014 charge \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a6100k one-time for this extra service", "Scale: 50 clients on $50/month Google Workspace = $2,500/month in pure recurring commissions"]', 0),
('Digital Skills Bootcamp (Weekend Classes)', 'digital-skills-bootcamp', '⚡', 'trade', 'Run weekend digital skills training in graphic design, social media marketing, content creation, and basic coding for unemployed Nigerians. 20 students at ₦30k each = ₦600k per cohort every 4 weeks.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'beginner', 50000, '["Education", "Recurring", "Community", "Projector", "Canva", "Google Classroom", "WhatsApp Group", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Design a 4-week curriculum: Week 1 Canva, Week 2 Social Media Marketing, Week 3 Content Creation, Week 4 Monetization", "Rent a training room with power and WiFi (\\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k/week) \\u2014 partner with a cybercafe to cut costs", "Limit to 20 students per cohort: charge \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a650k per student \\u2014 4-week Saturday-Sunday format", "Market to: fresh graduates, NYSC members, unemployed youth, and working-class skill upgraders", "Issue certificates of completion \\u2014 the certificate is a key part of perceived value for Nigerian students"]', 0),
('Pre-Purchase Home Inspection Service', 'home-inspection-service', '🔎', 'trade', 'Inspect properties before purchase or lease to identify structural issues, electrical faults, plumbing problems, and roofing defects. A 3-hour inspection earns ₦50k–₦200k — and saves clients millions in bad investments.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 30000, '["Real Estate", "B2B", "Professional", "Thermal Camera", "Moisture Meter", "Electrical Tester", "Report Template", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Get certified: COREN (registered engineer) or NIA (architect) registration \\u2014 or partner with one as your technical partner", "Buy inspection toolkit: thermal camera (\\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6200k), moisture meter, electrical tester, structural probe", "Create a detailed inspection report template \\u2014 20+ pages covering all building systems with photos", "Charge: apartment \\u20a650k, house \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6150k, commercial building \\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6500k", "Partner with real estate lawyers and mortgage brokers for referrals \\u2014 they always need trusted inspectors"]', 0),
('Concierge Medical Practice (Direct Pay)', 'concierge-medicine', '🏥', 'trade', 'Offer private, direct-pay primary care with 24/7 WhatsApp access, home visits, and annual wellness packages. High-net-worth Nigerians pay ₦300k–₦2m/year for a personal family doctor who picks up on the first ring.', 10000, 500000, 'month', 'advanced', 200000, '["Healthcare", "Premium", "Recurring", "Electronic Health Records (EHR)", "WhatsApp Business", "Home Visit Bag (medical kit)", "Paystack", "Calendly"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register your concierge practice with MDCN as a private medical facility (simplified for solo practitioners)", "Define your package: annual membership \\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a61.5m covering unlimited consults, home visits, and coordination", "Market to: C-suite executives, expats, politicians, and tech entrepreneurs \\u2014 they all need this", "Limit to 50\\u2013100 patients maximum per doctor \\u2014 exclusivity is part of the value proposition", "Add: corporate concierge plans \\u20a62m\\u2013\\u20a65m/year for company executives (paid by the company as a benefit)"]', 0),
('Precision & Smart Farming Consulting', 'smart-farming-consulting', '🌾', 'digital', 'Help Nigerian commercial farms adopt IoT sensors, drone monitoring, solar irrigation, and data analytics to increase yield and reduce waste. CBN Anchor Borrowers farms are a large, funded client base.', 10000, 300000, 'month', 'advanced', 100000, '["Agriculture", "Tech", "B2B", "IoT Soil Sensors", "Drone (Multispectral)", "Farm Management Software", "Excel", "Zoom"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Build expertise: complete online precision agriculture courses (Wageningen, Coursera) + fieldwork on pilot farms", "Curate a toolkit: IoT soil sensors (Sentek), weather stations (Davis Instruments), drone data service", "Target: NIRSAL-financed farms, state governments with anchor borrowers programs, and agro-industrial firms", "Charge: \\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a62m for farm digitization project; \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6300k/month for data monitoring and advisory", "Partner with IITA and FMARD for credibility and access to large-scale government farming contracts"]', 0),
('Private Label Cleaning Products Brand', 'cleaning-products-brand', '🧴', 'trade', 'Formulate and bottle your own branded floor cleaners, dishwashing liquid, and disinfectants using locally sourced raw materials. A ₦500 bottle costs ₦80 to produce — sell B2B to estates, offices, and supermarkets.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 30000, '["Manufacturing", "Brand Building", "Recurring", "Mixing Tanks", "HDPE Bottles", "Label Printer", "NAFDAC Notification", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Learn basic formulation from YouTube or a chemical engineer: caustic soda, surfactants, fragrance, preservatives", "Source raw materials from chemical suppliers in Lagos (Trade Fair, Mushin) \\u2014 very cheap in bulk", "Get NAFDAC notification for household chemical products \\u2014 mandatory before commercial sales", "Brand the bottles: buy generic HDPE bottles + print custom sticker labels on a small label printer", "Target B2B: estates, schools, hospitals, restaurants \\u2014 sell by the carton (24 bottles) for better margins"]', 0),
('Outsourced Customer Service (Call Centre)', 'outsourced-customer-service', '📞', 'digital', 'Provide outsourced inbound and outbound customer service for Nigerian and international brands. Companies pay $8–$25 per agent per hour — a team of 20 agents billing $15/hour earns $300/hour revenue.', 10000, 500000, 'month', 'advanced', 500000, '["B2B", "Scalable", "USD Income", "Zendesk", "Freshdesk", "Starlink Internet", "VOIP System (RingCentral)", "Payoneer"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Recruit and train 10\\u201320 agents with strong English, computer skills, and customer empathy \\u2014 pay \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6150k/month", "Set up: reliable internet (Starlink recommended), headsets, CRM software (Zendesk/Freshdesk), quiet room", "Land first client: offer 30-day free trial to an e-commerce brand needing order support \\u2014 convert to paid contract", "Charge: $8\\u2013$15/agent/hour for inbound support; $12\\u2013$25/agent/hour for tech support", "Certify agents with COPC or CSAT training \\u2014 international quality standards unlock premium clients"]', 0),
('Industrial Safety (HSE) Training & Certification', 'industrial-safety-training', '🦺', 'trade', 'Provide NEBOSH, ISPON, and IOSH health and safety training to oil & gas, construction, and manufacturing companies. A 5-day NEBOSH International Certificate course earns ₦300k–₦1m per class of 15 students.', 10000, 500000, 'month', 'intermediate', 100000, '["B2B", "Compliance", "Recurring", "NEBOSH Materials", "Training Room", "PowerPoint", "Paystack", "LinkedIn"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Get accredited as a NEBOSH or IOSH approved training provider \\u2014 apply directly through their websites", "Recruit 2\\u20133 certified HSE facilitators as associates for different course modules", "Target: oil servicing companies, construction firms, manufacturing plants, maritime companies in Port Harcourt, Lagos, Warri", "Charge: NEBOSH IGC 5-day course \\u20a6350k\\u2013\\u20a6600k per student; 15 students = \\u20a65m\\u2013\\u20a69m per cohort", "Build corporate contracts: annual HSE training calendar at \\u20a62m\\u2013\\u20a65m/year per company"]', 0),
('Full-Service Party & Event Equipment Rental', 'party-rental-complete', '🎉', 'trade', 'Rent complete event setups: chairs, tables, canopies, lights, backdrop, photo booth, and DJ equipment as a package. One full "party package" rented per weekend earns ₦150k–₦500k with near-zero marginal cost.', 5000, 200000, 'week', 'intermediate', 1, '["Events", "Asset Business", "Recurring", "Event Chairs & Tables", "LED Lighting", "Canopies (Marquees)", "Photo Booth Machine", "Delivery Van"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Build inventory: 300 chairs, 50 tables, 10 canopies, LED uplighting, backdrop stand, photo booth (\\u20a61m\\u2013\\u20a62m total)", "Create 3 packages: Economy (chairs + tables), Standard (add canopy + lights), Premium (add backdrop + photo booth)", "Price: Economy \\u20a680k, Standard \\u20a6150k, Premium \\u20a6300k per event \\u2014 all-inclusive for one-day rental", "Market to event planners, churches, families celebrating weddings, and corporate event managers", "Add a delivery + setup service at \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k extra \\u2014 clients are happy to pay for convenience"]', 0),
('Pan-African Language Translation Agency', 'translation-agency-africa', '🌍', 'digital', 'Build a translation agency covering all major African languages: Swahili, Amharic, Zulu, Hausa, Yoruba, Igbo, French, Arabic, and Portuguese. International NGOs, UN agencies, and MNCs pay $0.15–$0.30/word.', 5000, 300000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Language", "B2B", "USD Income", "CAT Tools (Phrase TMS)", "ProZ.com", "LinkedIn", "Payoneer", "Project Management Software"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Recruit a roster of 20+ vetted translators across 10 African languages via ProZ.com and LinkedIn", "Build a simple website and list on ATA (American Translators Association) directory for credibility", "Price: $0.12\\u2013$0.18/word for standard documents; $0.20\\u2013$0.35/word for legal/medical translations", "Target: World Bank, USAID, EU Africa programs, multinational companies expanding across Africa", "Apply for preferred vendor status with UN agencies \\u2014 UNHCR, UNICEF, WHO all use external translators heavily"]', 0),
('Full-Service Digital Marketing Agency', 'digital-marketing-agency-nigeria', '📣', 'digital', 'Provide SEO, paid ads, social media, email marketing, and web design under one roof for Nigerian and international SMEs. Agencies billing $2,000–$15,000/month per client are the standard internationally.', 10000, 500000, 'month', 'advanced', 50000, '["B2B", "Scalable", "USD Income", "Google Ads", "Meta Ads Manager", "Semrush", "HubSpot", "Slack"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Niche your agency: \\"Digital Marketing for Nigerian Fintech Startups\\" wins faster than \\"we do everything for everyone\\"", "Hire specialist freelancers as white-label partners: one SEO expert, one PPC expert, one content writer", "Land 3 local clients at \\u20a6150k\\u2013\\u20a6300k/month to build a Nigerian case study portfolio", "Pitch international clients via LinkedIn and Clutch.co agency directory \\u2014 international rates are 3\\u20135x local", "Build productized service packages: \\"Social Media Growth Package\\" at $1,500/month removes endless scope creep"]', 0),
('Modern Funeral Planning & Celebration of Life', 'funeral-planning-services', '🕊️', 'trade', 'Help families plan dignified, organized, and beautiful funerals and burial ceremonies. Nigerian funerals are massive social events — organized, stress-free planning services earn ₦200k–₦2m per event.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 30000, '["Service", "Community", "Premium", "Vendor Partnership Network", "WhatsApp Business", "Invoice App", "Paystack", "Canva (for packages)"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Build vendor network: casket supplier, mortician, caterer, florist, PA system, and transport company", "Create service packages: Basic (\\u20a6100k), Standard (\\u20a6300k), Premium (\\u20a6800k+) with clear deliverables per tier", "Market to: religious organizations, burial societies, professional associations, and diaspora Nigerian families", "Partner with insurance companies offering funeral cover \\u2014 they need vetted service providers urgently", "Add: repatriation coordination for diaspora families \\u2014 bringing bodies home from UK/US earns \\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a62m per case"]', 0),
('Certified Document Translation for Visa/Immigration', 'immigration-document-translation', '📄', 'digital', 'Translate and certify birth certificates, marriage certificates, academic transcripts, and court documents for Nigerians applying for visas and immigration to Canada, UK, USA, and Europe.', 1500, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Language", "Remote", "Daily Income", "Google Docs", "Paystack", "WhatsApp Business", "Canva (cover letter)", "Legal Notary Partner"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Develop standard certified translation format for each target country\'s immigration authority requirements", "Partner with a Nigerian lawyer for notarization (\\u20a62k\\u2013\\u20a65k per document notarized)", "Price: \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k per 1-page document; \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k for academic transcript (multi-page)", "Market in: Nigerian visa WhatsApp groups, Relocate.ng community, Canada/UK immigration Facebook groups", "Build urgency service: 24-hour rush translation at 2x price \\u2014 desperate applicants pay immediately"]', 0),
('YouTube Channel Management Service', 'youtube-channel-management', '▶️', 'digital', 'Manage all aspects of YouTube channels for busy creators and brands: editing, SEO, thumbnails, upload schedule, analytics, and sponsorship outreach. Channels pay $500–$5,000/month for full channel management.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 30000, '["Creative", "USD Income", "Remote", "DaVinci Resolve", "TubeBuddy", "VidIQ", "Canva (thumbnails)", "Trello"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Master YouTube Studio analytics: CTR, watch time, impressions, audience retention \\u2014 know what moves the needle", "Learn DaVinci Resolve (free) or Premiere Pro for professional video editing", "Offer a free 30-day channel audit to 5 YouTubers \\u2014 show them specific growth opportunities", "Charge: $300\\u2013$500/month for editing only; $1,000\\u2013$3,000/month for full management", "Build systems: editorial calendar, batch editing workflow, and weekly analytics reports \\u2014 clients love structure"]', 0),
('Christian / Islamic Life & Purpose Coaching', 'spiritual-life-coaching', '🙏', 'digital', 'Coach Nigerians through career, relationship, and life decisions using faith-based frameworks. The deeply religious Nigerian market pays ₦50k–₦300k for purpose coaching aligned to their belief system.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Coaching", "Faith-Based", "Remote", "Zoom", "Calendly", "Paystack", "Instagram", "Canva"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Get certified: ICF-accredited life coaching program (online, 3\\u20136 months) \\u2014 essential for credibility", "Define your niche: \\"Christian career coach for ambitious Nigerian women\\" is far more powerful than \\"life coach\\"", "Offer free 20-minute discovery calls via WhatsApp video \\u2014 close into 3-month package at \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6200k", "Build authority: preach/teach at your church or mosque, host free weekly online sessions, be active on Instagram", "Create a digital product: \\"30-Day Purpose Discovery Journal\\" at \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k for passive income alongside coaching"]', 0),
('NGO & Social Enterprise Consulting', 'social-entrepreneurship-consulting', '🌱', 'digital', 'Help NGOs, foundations, and social enterprises develop strategies, write grant proposals, and build operational systems. A single successful grant proposal worth $100k earns the consultant $5k–$15k in fees.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Consulting", "NGO", "B2B", "Microsoft Word", "Google Workspace", "LinkedIn", "Devex", "Paystack"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Build expertise: 3+ years in NGO program management, M&E, or grant writing is minimum credibility", "Create a portfolio: volunteer to write 2 grant proposals for small NGOs \\u2014 use the results as case studies", "Register on NGO grant platforms: Devex, Idealist, and UNjobs as a freelance consultant", "Charge: grant writing \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6300k per proposal; strategic planning \\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a61.5m per project", "Network at Nigeria NGO Forum, Ashoka, and Ford Foundation events \\u2014 referrals dominate this space"]', 0),
('Petroleum Products Micro-Trading', 'petroleum-products-trading', '⛽', 'trade', 'Become a licensed NNPC/DPR retail distributor of kerosene, diesel, and LPG to factories, bakeries, and generators. Diesel alone powers 80% of Nigerian businesses — demand is recession-proof.', 250000, 10000000, 'month', 'advanced', 500000, '["High Capital", "B2B", "Commodity", "Scalable", "DPR Portal", "QuickBooks", "WhatsApp Business", "GPS Tracker"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Apply for DPR retail outlet licence at your state DPR office (\\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6150k fees)", "Secure supply from NNPC depot or licensed major marketers (Total, Ardova, MRS)", "Sign supply contracts with bakeries, factories, construction sites, and hospitals \\u2014 they need 500\\u20135000 litres weekly", "Buy or rent a 5,000\\u201333,000 litre tanker truck for delivery logistics", "Set up automated billing: invoice on delivery, net-7 payment terms for corporate clients"]', 0),
('Cold Chain Logistics Company', 'cold-chain-logistics', '❄️', 'trade', 'Own refrigerated trucks and cold storage that move perishable foods, vaccines, and pharmaceuticals for hospitals, pharma companies, and supermarket chains across Nigeria.', 500000, 15000000, 'month', 'advanced', 2, '["B2B", "Scalable", "Logistics", "High Capital", "Food", "GPS Fleet Tracker", "Temperature Logger", "SAP/QuickBooks", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy or lease refrigerated truck (\\u20a62m\\u2013\\u20a68m for a used unit) \\u2014 Leyland, Isuzu NPR refrigerated", "Register company with CAC, get NAFDAC food transport permit", "Target: pharma distributors (GlaxoSmithKline, Emzor), supermarkets (Shoprite, Game, FoodCo), export companies", "Offer temperature-monitored delivery with digital proof \\u2014 your competitive edge", "Scale with GPS-tracked fleet: 5 trucks = \\u20a65m\\u2013\\u20a615m monthly revenue"]', 0),
('Private School Proprietorship', 'school-proprietorship', '🏫', 'trade', 'Own and operate a private nursery and primary school. Education is Nigeria\'s most recession-resistant sector — parents cut food budgets before school fees. Annual tuition per pupil runs ₦250k–₦1.5m.', 750000, 20000000, 'month', 'advanced', 1, '["Recurring", "Education", "High Capital", "Real Estate", "Scalable", "Schoolync", "QuickBooks", "CCTV System", "WhatsApp Parent Groups"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register with your state Ministry of Education (budget \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6300k in fees)", "Lease or build a facility: minimum 6 classrooms, toilets, security fence", "Hire qualified teachers (NCE/B.Ed minimum) \\u2014 WAEC/NECO recognition requires certified staff", "Set tuition: Lagos/Abuja middle-class market \\u20a6250k\\u2013\\u20a6800k/annum per pupil", "Use school management software (Schoolync, SchoolTrac) for fees and attendance tracking"]', 0),
('Licensed Insurance Brokerage Firm', 'insurance-brokerage', '🛡️', 'digital', 'Operate a licensed insurance brokerage placing corporate policies (marine, motor fleet, group life, property) and earn 15–30% commission. One large corporate client can mean ₦5m+ annual premium.', 350000, 8000000, 'month', 'advanced', 500000, '["Recurring", "B2B", "Finance", "Scalable", "Commission", "Insurance CRM", "NAICOM Portal", "HubSpot", "QuickBooks", "LinkedIn"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Obtain NAICOM broker licence \\u2014 partner with existing broker as sub-agent first to build book", "Write CIIN foundation exams to qualify as Associate of the Chartered Insurance Institute of Nigeria", "Target SMEs with 10+ employees for group life insurance \\u2014 mandatory under the Employees Compensation Act", "Work with underwriters: AIICO, AXA Mansard, Custodian, Leadway for policy placement", "Build recurring book: motor fleet renewals, annual property covers, and group life renew automatically"]', 0),
('Fintech Agent Network Builder', 'fintech-agent-network', '💳', 'trade', 'Recruit, train, and manage a network of 50–500 mobile money agents under a super-agent licence. You earn override commission on every transaction your agents process — passive income at scale.', 250000, 7000000, 'month', 'advanced', 300000, '["B2B", "Scalable", "Finance", "Tech", "Recurring", "Agent Management Dashboard", "WhatsApp Business", "Google Sheets", "Zoom Training"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Obtain super-agent licence: OPay, Moniepoint, Palmpay, or Zenith Bank Mobile Money", "Recruit agents in underserved LGAs \\u2014 markets, motor parks, rural areas with no branches", "Provide initial float capital (\\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k per agent) as working capital \\u2014 recoverable", "Train agents via WhatsApp video on dispute resolution and transaction limits", "Earn 0.2\\u20130.5% override on all agent transactions \\u2014 100 agents doing \\u20a65m/day = \\u20a61m+ monthly"]', 0),
('Real Estate Mini-Developer', 'real-estate-development', '🏗️', 'trade', 'Buy land in high-growth urban fringes (Ibeju-Lekki, Lugbe Abuja, Trans-Ekulu Enugu), build 2–4 units, and sell or rent. Nigerian property doubles every 5–7 years in growth corridors.', 1500000, 50000000, 'month', 'advanced', 3, '["High Capital", "Real Estate", "Construction", "Scalable", "High ROI", "CAC Registration", "WhatsApp (sales)", "Legal CRM", "Property Valuation Software"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Identify growth corridors: follow FHA/estate developer announcements and infrastructure news", "Due diligence: survey, CofO/deed of assignment, governor\'s consent verification via lawyer", "Partner with a registered quantity surveyor for build cost estimation before purchase", "Use a trusted contractor with stage-payment contracts (not lump sum) to reduce fraud risk", "Sell off-plan to reduce holding costs \\u2014 collect deposits before construction begins"]', 0),
('Pharmaceutical Wholesale Distribution', 'pharmaceutical-distribution', '💊', 'trade', 'Become a licensed NAFDAC/PCN pharmaceutical distributor supplying drugs and medical consumables to hospitals, pharmacies, and clinics. Pharmaceutical distribution in Nigeria is a ₦3 trillion industry.', 500000, 20000000, 'month', 'advanced', 1, '["B2B", "Recurring", "Healthcare", "Scalable", "High Capital", "Pharmacy ERP Software", "NAFDAC Portal", "QuickBooks", "Invoicing App"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Obtain PCN wholesale pharmacy licence and NAFDAC distribution registration", "Secure climate-controlled warehouse: minimum 100 sqm with temperature and humidity logs", "Open accounts with: Emzor, May & Baker, Fidson, GSK Nigeria as supply sources", "Build client base: private hospitals (most profitable), mission hospitals, retail pharmacies", "Deploy medical reps to hospitals \\u2014 pay commission-based, target heads of pharmacy departments"]', 0),
('Waste Management & Recycling Company', 'waste-management-company', '♻️', 'trade', 'Collect, sort, and sell recyclables (PET, aluminium, cardboard) to offtakers while charging estates and businesses collection fees. Nigeria generates 32 million tonnes of solid waste annually — most uncollected.', 350000, 8000000, 'month', 'advanced', 500000, '["B2B", "Green Energy", "Scalable", "Recurring", "Construction", "Route Planning App", "QuickBooks", "WhatsApp Business", "Weighing Scale + Receipt Printer"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register a limited liability company \\u2014 collection contracts require corporate identity", "Buy a truck or hire: Kia K2700 (\\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a62m) or hire at \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a625k/trip", "Sign collection contracts with estates (\\u20a6150k\\u2013\\u20a6500k/month each), schools, factories", "Sort waste at depot: PET bottles \\u20a6100\\u2013\\u20a6150/kg, aluminium \\u20a6400\\u2013\\u20a6600/kg \\u2014 sell to Wecyclers or Vicmart", "Apply for UNIDO and Lagos LASEPA recycling grants and equipment support"]', 0),
('Processed Agro-Export Business', 'export-agro-processed', '🌍', 'trade', 'Process and export cashew, dried ginger, hibiscus (zobo), sesame seeds, and moringa to European and Asian buyers. One 20-foot container of processed cashew earns $15,000–$30,000.', 3000000, 80000000, 'month', 'advanced', 1, '["Export", "Agriculture", "USD Income", "B2B", "Scalable", "NEPC Portal", "Alibaba.com Supplier Account", "Moisture Meter", "Vacuum Sealer", "Shipping Containers"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register with NEPC (Nigerian Export Promotion Council) \\u2014 free export certificate", "Source from producing states: cashew from Oyo/Kogi, ginger from Kaduna, hibiscus from Kano", "Process: sort, dry, pack to EU phytosanitary standards (engage NAFDAC and NSPRI)", "Find buyers via NEPC trade fairs, Alibaba.com verified supplier, and EU food importer outreach", "Ship via Apapa Port \\u2014 use a reputable customs agent and get all HS code documents"]', 0),
('Solar EPC (Engineering & Construction) Company', 'solar-epc-company', '☀️', 'trade', 'Design and install commercial solar systems for factories, hotels, hospitals, and estates. A single 100kVA system earns ₦10m–₦30m, plus O&M contracts paying ₦500k+/year per client.', 1500000, 50000000, 'month', 'advanced', 1, '["Green Energy", "B2B", "Scalable", "High Capital", "Recurring", "AutoCAD / PVsyst", "QuickBooks", "WhatsApp Business", "Drone for site survey"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Obtain NERC service contractor permit", "Hire or partner with a registered electrical engineer for technical sign-off", "Target commercial buildings (hotels, factories, hospitals) \\u2014 pain point is diesel cost", "Quote: include panels, inverters, batteries, installation, and 5-year maintenance contract", "Build portfolio with 3 showcase projects \\u2014 photograph and share ROI data (client diesel savings)"]', 0),
('Customs Clearing & Freight Forwarding', 'customs-clearing-forwarding', '🚢', 'trade', 'Clear imported goods through Nigerian Customs on behalf of importers and handle international freight. One clearing earns ₦50k–₦500k. Volume importers need monthly clearing agents.', 350000, 10000000, 'month', 'advanced', 500000, '["B2B", "Scalable", "Logistics", "Finance", "Recurring", "PortalNCS", "QuickBooks", "TradeDesk", "MS Excel", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Obtain CAC registration + NCS agent licence (Form NCS-C1) \\u2014 budget \\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6500k in fees", "Join NAGAFF (National Association of Government Approved Freight Forwarders) for credibility", "Learn HS code classification, Form M, NESS payment, and PAAR on PortalNCS", "Build importer client base: SMEs importing machinery, electronics, and raw materials", "Hire trained ops staff \\u2014 clearing requires daily interaction with customs, NAFDAC, NAQS, and SON"]', 0),
('Digital Media Production House', 'media-production-house', '🎬', 'digital', 'Produce commercial videos, brand films, and digital campaigns for corporations and NGOs. A single corporate brand video costs ₦1.5m–₦10m. NGO donor campaigns are USD-denominated.', 600000, 20000000, 'month', 'advanced', 500000, '["Creative", "B2B", "Scalable", "USD Income", "Premium", "Adobe Premiere", "After Effects", "DaVinci Resolve", "Frame.io", "Notion"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Invest in core gear: Sony FX3/FX6, DJI drone, Rode mics, LED lighting kit \\u2014 buy quality used gear first", "Build reel: produce 3 high-quality spec spots for fictional brands or NGOs", "Register on NG-Brand ecosystem: attend Lagos Fashion Week, Inspiration Nigeria, TFMI events", "Price correctly: \\u20a61.5m minimum for corporates, \\u20a65m+ for FMCG brands", "Offer full-service: script, shoot, edit, motion graphics \\u2014 one vendor is easier for clients to buy"]', 0),
('Cooperative Microfinance Society', 'microfinance-cooperative', '🏦', 'trade', 'Register a cooperative society, pool member savings, and lend to traders and SMEs at 3–5% monthly interest. With ₦5m in member deposits you earn ₦150k–₦250k/month in interest income alone.', 200000, 5000000, 'month', 'advanced', 200000, '["Finance", "Recurring", "Community", "Scalable", "B2B", "Cooperative Management Software", "QuickBooks", "Excel Credit Tracker", "WhatsApp Group"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register as a cooperative society with your state Cooperative Federation (\\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k fees)", "Recruit founding members: minimum 10 people contributing \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6200k each", "Establish credit policy: weekly contributions, loan ceiling 3x savings, guarantors required", "Disburse first loans to market traders \\u2014 weekly repayment reduces default risk", "Apply to CBN SME loan programmes as a cooperative \\u2014 access subsidised capital at 5\\u20139%"]', 0),
('Tech Skills Training Institute', 'tech-training-institute', '🖥️', 'trade', 'Run a structured training institute teaching coding, product design, data analysis, and cybersecurity with job placement. One cohort of 30 students at ₦150k each = ₦4.5m per programme.', 1000000, 25000000, 'month', 'advanced', 500000, '["Education", "Scalable", "B2B", "Recurring", "Tech", "LMS (Moodle/Thinkific)", "GitHub Classroom", "Zoom", "Slack", "Trello"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Lease facility with 20+ workstations or adopt hybrid (physical + online) model", "Develop 12-week curriculum: full-stack web dev, data analytics, UI/UX, or cybersecurity", "Partner with tech companies for internships and job placement \\u2014 your key differentiator", "Market: JAMB post-result period, NYSC orientation, LinkedIn, university department boards", "Register with ITF (Industrial Training Fund) \\u2014 students can access 20\\u201350% subsidised fees"]', 0),
('Hotel & Short-Let Management Company', 'hotel-management-company', '🏨', 'trade', 'Manage short-let apartments and small hotels on behalf of property owners — handle bookings, cleaning, and guest relations — earning 20–30% of every booking. No need to own the property.', 350000, 10000000, 'month', 'advanced', 200000, '["Real Estate", "Recurring", "Premium", "Scalable", "B2B", "Airbnb Host Platform", "Booking.com Partner", "HostAway PMS", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Start by managing 3\\u20135 short-let apartments in Lekki, VI, Abuja Maitama, or GRA", "List on Airbnb, Booking.com, Hotels.ng, and WhatsApp referral network simultaneously", "Standardize operations: cleaning checklist, linen standard, welcome pack, guest messaging", "Charge owner 25\\u201330% of all revenue \\u2014 10 properties at \\u20a6100k/night x 20 nights = \\u20a65m gross", "Add revenue streams: airport pickup, event decorating, food partnership \\u2014 cross-sell every check-in"]', 0),
('Private Security Company', 'private-security-company', '🔒', 'trade', 'License and deploy security guards and CCTV surveillance for estates, banks, and corporate clients. One estate with 20 guards at ₦60k/guard/month = ₦1.2m monthly revenue.', 500000, 20000000, 'month', 'advanced', 500000, '["B2B", "Recurring", "Scalable", "Service", "High Capital", "Attendance Management App", "CCTV Platform", "Payroll Software", "QuickBooks"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register with CAC as a limited company", "Obtain NSCDC private guard company licence \\u2014 budget \\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6500k", "Recruit retired military and police officers as supervisors for credibility", "Target: gated estates (guaranteed recurring contract), schools, banks, factories", "Deploy CCTV installation as add-on service \\u2014 higher margin, less labour-intensive"]', 0),
('Government Contract Business (SME)', 'government-contractor', '📋', 'trade', 'Register as a pre-qualified government contractor for stationery, IT equipment, printing, or minor construction for federal and state MDAs. A single supply order can be ₦5m–₦50m.', 1500000, 50000000, 'month', 'advanced', 500000, '["B2B", "High Capital", "Scalable", "Construction", "Premium", "BPP Portal", "CAC Certificate", "PENCOM Clearance", "Tax Clearance Certificate", "Excel Bid Tracker"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register on BPP procurement portal and your state procurement bureau", "Pre-qualify in categories: IT supplies, stationery, printing, or minor works", "Build MDA contacts \\u2014 procurement officers and admin directors are key gatekeepers", "Respond to tenders in Official Gazette and procurement portals \\u2014 never miss a publication cycle", "Always use a letter of credit or advance payment confirmation before supplying \\u2014 payment cycles are 90\\u2013180 days"]', 0),
('Sachet & Bottled Water Production Plant', 'bottled-water-factory', '💧', 'trade', 'Set up a NAFDAC-certified sachet and table water production plant supplying offices, schools, and distributors. At 10,000 sachets/day at ₦5 profit each = ₦50k daily from one machine.', 200000, 8000000, 'month', 'advanced', 1, '["FMCG", "Manufacturing", "B2B", "Scalable", "Daily Cash", "NAFDAC Portal", "Water Testing Lab", "Sealing Machine", "Borehole + Treatment Plant", "Logistics Van"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Conduct water source analysis with a NAFDAC-certified lab \\u2014 must pass 29 tests", "Register with NAFDAC for sachet water (NW) number \\u2014 budget \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6300k and 3\\u20134 months", "Buy sealing machine, water treatment plant (reverse osmosis), and polyfilm rolls \\u2014 used from \\u20a6800k", "Distribute: supply buses and street hawkers take 100+ bags/day; supply corporate offices for bottled water contracts", "Expand to bottled water for hotels and airlines \\u2014 higher margin, better brand positioning"]', 0),
('Medical Diagnostics Laboratory', 'medical-diagnostics-lab', '🔬', 'trade', 'Open a MLSCN-accredited diagnostics lab offering blood tests, urinalysis, and corporate medical checks. Corporate wellness contracts pay ₦500k–₦5m annually per company.', 500000, 15000000, 'month', 'advanced', 2, '["Healthcare", "Recurring", "B2B", "Premium", "Scalable", "Lab Information System (LIS)", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack", "Referring Clinic Network"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register with MLSCN and obtain practising permit", "Hire a registered Medical Laboratory Scientist (MLS) \\u2014 statutory requirement", "Equip: haematology analyser, biochemistry analyser, microscope, centrifuge \\u2014 quality used units from \\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a62m", "Sign corporate health contracts: manufacturing companies require annual pre-employment medicals", "Market to hospitals without in-house labs \\u2014 refer all tests to you and split fee 50/50"]', 0),
('Industrial & Commercial Cleaning Company', 'industrial-cleaning-company', '🧹', 'trade', 'Provide specialized cleaning to factories, hospitals, offshore rigs, and large commercial buildings. Industrial cleaning contracts run ₦500k–₦5m/month — essential, invisible, and rarely competed for professionally.', 350000, 15000000, 'month', 'advanced', 300000, '["B2B", "Recurring", "Scalable", "Service", "NIPEX Portal", "NAPIMS Registration", "QuickBooks", "HSE Documentation System", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register company and target ISO 9001 compliance \\u2014 required for oil and gas clients", "Buy professional equipment: floor scrubbers, pressure washers, industrial vacuums (\\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6500k starter kit)", "Target verticals: hospitals, factories, hotels, offshore catering companies", "Bid on NIPEX (NNPC procurement portal) for facility cleaning \\u2014 massive contracts", "Build HSE compliance portfolio: OHSAS 18001, SHE induction certificates \\u2014 unlocks larger contracts"]', 0),
('Events AV & Staging Company', 'events-audiovisual-company', '🎤', 'trade', 'Own LED screens, line-array speakers, trusses, and generators for concerts, conferences, and weddings. One large concert technical rider earns ₦2m–₦10m. Ten events a month = ₦20m–₦50m gross.', 600000, 25000000, 'month', 'advanced', 2, '["Events", "B2B", "Scalable", "Premium", "Recurring", "Event Management Software", "WhatsApp Business", "Inventory Tracking App", "Generator Fleet", "Repair Toolkits"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Invest in core inventory: 2x line-array boxes, 2x subwoofers, digital mixer, LED stage wash lights \\u2014 buy quality used Yamaha or QSC gear", "Register and join EXMAN (Experiential Marketers Association of Nigeria) for credibility", "Build relationships with event planners, concert promoters, and corporate event managers \\u2014 referral industry", "Price by complexity: corporate conferences \\u20a6300k\\u2013\\u20a61.5m, concerts \\u20a61m\\u2013\\u20a68m, large festivals \\u20a65m+", "Install permanent AV for churches, hotels, and conference centres \\u2014 recurring service income"]', 0),
('Oil & Gas Manpower Supply Agency', 'oil-gas-manpower-agency', '⚙️', 'trade', 'Supply skilled workers (welders, riggers, safety officers, catering staff) to oil and gas companies and EPC contractors. A contract supplying 50 workers earns ₦3m–₦10m monthly in margin.', 600000, 25000000, 'month', 'advanced', 500000, '["B2B", "Recurring", "Scalable", "Premium", "High Capital", "NIPEX Portal", "NCDMB Registration", "Payroll Software", "Document Management System", "LinkedIn Recruiter"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register with CAC and join PETAN (Petroleum Technology Association of Nigeria)", "Obtain ITF accreditation for your training programmes", "Build a roster of certified workers: ISO-certified welders, HUET-certified offshore riggers, BOSIET-certified reps", "Respond to NIPEX and Shell/Chevron/Total vendor tenders \\u2014 budget 3\\u20136 months to pre-qualify", "Structure contracts: you pay workers (deducting NSITF, PAYE, pension) \\u2014 margin is 15\\u201330% above labour cost"]', 0),
('Food/Service Franchise Operator', 'franchise-operator', '🍟', 'trade', 'Buy into a Nigerian or international franchise (Kilimanjaro, Tastee Fried Chicken, Domino\'s, Cold Stone) and operate one or more outlets. Proven menu, training, and marketing reduce risk significantly.', 800000, 20000000, 'month', 'advanced', 3, '["Food", "Scalable", "B2B", "Recurring", "Premium", "POS System", "Inventory Management App", "HR/Payroll Software", "CCTV System", "WhatsApp Customer Service"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Research options: Kilimanjaro (\\u20a65m\\u2013\\u20a615m fee), TFC (\\u20a63m\\u2013\\u20a68m), Cold Stone (\\u20a610m\\u2013\\u20a620m)", "Visit existing franchisees \\u2014 not the franchisor \\u2014 to validate actual profitability", "Secure high-traffic location: malls, busy road junctions, near universities or hospitals", "Negotiate agreement carefully: territory exclusivity, renewal terms, royalty rate (3\\u20138%)", "Build operations culture early: standardize staff training, waste management, and daily cash reconciliation"]', 0),
('AI Chatbot Builder for SMEs', 'ai-chatbot-builder', '🤖', 'digital', 'Build and deploy WhatsApp and website chatbots for Nigerian SMEs using no-code tools like Manychat and Tidio. Businesses pay ₦50k–₦200k for setup plus ₦20k–₦50k/month in retainer.', 3000, 90000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["AI", "B2B", "Recurring", "Tech", "Manychat", "Tidio", "WhatsApp Business API", "Paystack", "Notion (client SOPs)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Learn Manychat and Tidio on YouTube \\u2014 both have free tiers you can demo with", "Build 2 showcase bots: one for a restaurant (menu + orders) and one for a salon (bookings)", "Pitch local businesses: \\"Your WhatsApp replies on autopilot 24/7 \\u2014 no missed sales\\"", "Charge: \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6150k setup + \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k/month maintenance and updates", "Scale: white-label a more powerful platform like Chatfuel and charge enterprise clients \\u20a6200k+ setup"]', 0),
('Drone Photography & Videography', 'drone-photography', '🚁', 'trade', 'Provide aerial photography and videography for real estate listings, weddings, construction progress, and corporate brand films. One wedding aerial session earns ₦50k–₦150k.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 200000, '["Creative", "B2B", "Premium", "Events", "DJI Drone", "Adobe Premiere", "LUTs Pack", "NCAA Registration", "Instagram Portfolio"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy DJI Mini 4 Pro or DJI Air 3 (\\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6400k) \\u2014 excellent quality, portable, reliable", "Register with Nigerian Civil Aviation Authority (NCAA) for commercial drone operations", "Build reel: shoot 5 free or discounted sessions for real estate agents and event vendors", "Charge: real estate aerial \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k, weddings \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6200k, construction monthly \\u20a6150k+", "Add cinematic video editing as add-on \\u2014 edited drone highlight reel commands 2\\u20133x premium"]', 0),
('Podcast Production & Editing Agency', 'podcast-production-agency', '🎙️', 'digital', 'Edit, mix, and produce podcasts for Nigerian and international creators. Busy podcasters pay $200–$1000/episode for professional editing. One retainer client pays your rent.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Creative", "Remote", "Recurring", "USD Income", "Adobe Audition", "Audacity", "Descript", "Upwork", "Notion (client workflow)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Learn Audacity and Adobe Audition basics on YouTube \\u2014 mastery in 1 week", "Create a portfolio with 3 edited sample episodes (use free Creative Commons podcasts)", "Sign up on Upwork and Podcast.co as a podcast editor \\u2014 set rate at $25\\u2013$50/hour", "Offer value-adds: show notes writing, audiogram clips for social media, transcript", "Scale: hire 2\\u20133 editors and become an agency \\u2014 take 30% margin on each episode"]', 0),
('Professional Resume & LinkedIn Optimisation', 'resume-linkedin-writing', '📄', 'digital', 'Write ATS-optimised CVs and LinkedIn profiles for Nigerian job seekers, diaspora returnees, and professionals applying to international roles. One premium CV earns ₦15k–₦60k.', 1500, 40000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Remote", "No Capital", "Service", "USD Income", "Google Docs", "Canva (visual CVs)", "LinkedIn", "Paystack", "Calendly"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Study 10 high-performing LinkedIn profiles in finance, tech, and consulting \\u2014 learn the pattern", "Create your own outstanding LinkedIn profile as proof of concept \\u2014 it is your best sales tool", "Charge: basic CV \\u20a615k, premium CV + LinkedIn optimisation \\u20a640k\\u2013\\u20a660k, executive package \\u20a6100k+", "Get clients: NYSC WhatsApp groups, LinkedIn posts, university alumni groups, Facebook career groups", "Add: interview coaching at \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k per session \\u2014 natural upsell for every CV client"]', 0),
('Mobile Car Detailing & Ceramic Coating', 'car-detailing-mobile', '🚘', 'trade', 'Detail and deep-clean cars at clients\' homes, offices, and estates using professional products. A full detail earns ₦15k–₦50k; ceramic coating commands ₦80k–₦300k per car.', 3000, 100000, 'day', 'beginner', 20000, '["Daily Cash", "Mobile Service", "Skill", "Foam Cannon", "Polisher", "Ceramic Coating Products", "Instagram", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy professional kit: foam cannon, polisher, microfibre towels, ceramic spray, vacuum (\\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a660k)", "Watch 20 hours of professional car detailing tutorials on YouTube before your first paid job", "Build before/after portfolio on Instagram and WhatsApp Status \\u2014 results sell themselves", "Charge: exterior wash \\u20a65k, full interior+exterior detail \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a630k, paint correction \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6150k", "Scale: train 2 employees and operate 3 teams simultaneously \\u2014 multiply income 3x without working more hours"]', 0),
('Influencer & Creator Management Agency', 'influencer-agency', '⭐', 'digital', 'Manage Nigerian micro and macro influencers — negotiate brand deals, coordinate campaigns, and take 15–25% commission. One influencer with ₦1m/month in deals earns you ₦150k–₦250k doing nothing extra.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Creative", "B2B", "Recurring", "Commission", "Google Slides (media kits)", "Sprout Social", "Instagram Insights", "Gmail", "Paystack"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Sign 5\\u201310 micro-influencers (10k\\u2013100k followers) in food, fashion, tech, and lifestyle niches", "Create a media kit for each creator: audience demographics, engagement rate, past brand deals", "Pitch brands and ad agencies directly \\u2014 marketing managers actively seek influencer agencies", "Standard commission: 15\\u201325% of every deal you close for the influencer", "Add services: campaign strategy, content approval, performance reporting \\u2014 invoice brands for project management too"]', 0),
('Print-On-Demand Clothing Store (Afrobeats/Naija)', 'print-on-demand-store', '👕', 'digital', 'Design and sell Nigeria-themed T-shirts, hoodies, and mugs on Merch by Amazon, Redbubble, and Printify. Designs celebrating Afrobeats, Lagos culture, and Naija slang sell to diaspora globally.', 1500, 40000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["No Capital", "USD Income", "Passive", "Creative", "Canva Pro", "Kittl", "Merch by Amazon", "Redbubble", "EverBee"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Open accounts on Merch by Amazon, Redbubble, and Printify + Etsy store", "Use Canva Pro or Kittl to design: Afrobeats icons, Lagos skyline, Yoruba proverbs, Pidgin humour", "Upload 20\\u201350 designs across multiple products: T-shirts, mugs, phone cases, tote bags", "Research: use EverBee or Merch Informer to find trending niches before designing", "SEO your listings: \\"Lagos Nigeria shirt\\", \\"Afrobeats fan gift\\", \\"Naija diaspora hoodie\\" \\u2014 keywords drive organic sales"]', 0),
('Pet Sitting, Dog Walking & Grooming', 'pet-sitting-services', '🐕', 'trade', 'Lagos and Abuja\'s pet ownership boom creates massive demand for dog walkers, pet sitters, and groomers. Busy professionals pay ₦5k–₦20k/day for pet care; grooming earns ₦5k–₦30k per session.', 2000, 50000, 'day', 'beginner', 5000, '["Service", "Daily Cash", "No Capital", "WhatsApp Business", "Instagram Pet Portfolio", "Rover (international platform)", "Paystack", "Google Maps"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Advertise in estate WhatsApp groups: \\"Professional Dog Walker/Pet Sitter \\u2014 Insured and Verified\\"", "Offer first session free or discounted to build trust with new pet owners", "Charge: dog walking \\u20a63k\\u2013\\u20a68k/session, pet sitting \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a620k/day, full groom \\u20a68k\\u2013\\u20a625k", "Build a photo diary of every pet in your care \\u2014 WhatsApp updates reassure anxious pet owners", "Scale: hire 3 certified pet carers, launch a mobile app booking system, partner with vets for referrals"]', 0),
('Paid WhatsApp Newsletter (Niche Intelligence)', 'whatsapp-newsletter', '📬', 'digital', 'Curate and sell a premium WhatsApp broadcast newsletter in a high-value niche — real estate deals, forex signals, tech opportunities, or government tenders. 200 subscribers at ₦5k/month = ₦1m monthly.', 1000, 30000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Passive", "Phone Only", "No Capital", "Recurring", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack Subscription Link", "Google Alerts (monitoring)", "Notion (drafts)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Pick a niche where you have a clear information edge: real estate, FMCG distribution, government tenders, forex", "Start free for 30 days \\u2014 grow to 500+ contacts before converting to paid", "Price: \\u20a62k\\u2013\\u20a610k/month depending on value of intelligence (the rarer and more actionable, the higher)", "Deliver 3\\u20135 high-quality intel items per week \\u2014 consistency and exclusivity justify the subscription", "Upsell: consulting calls at \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a6100k/hour for subscribers who want deeper advice"]', 0),
('VTU & Data Reseller Business (Aggregator Scale)', 'airtime-data-aggregator', '📡', 'digital', 'Go beyond basic VTU reselling — become a sub-dealer or API reseller with direct network rates. At 500 transactions/day across airtime, data, and bill payments, daily profit hits ₦10k–₦50k.', 2000, 60000, 'day', 'beginner', 10000, '["Daily Cash", "No Capital", "Recurring", "Phone Only", "VTpass / Clubkonnect App", "WhatsApp Business", "POS Machine", "Paystack", "Excel Tracker"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Register on VTU platforms: VTpass, Clubkonnect, Husmo, or SME Plug as a reseller", "Top up wallet and start selling to neighbours, friends, business owners, and market traders", "Negotiate: move from retail to sub-dealer level (\\u20a6500k+ monthly volume) for better rates", "Build a WhatsApp order channel \\u2014 promote and let orders flow in passively throughout the day", "Scale to aggregator: get MTN/Airtel sub-dealer agreement at \\u20a65m\\u2013\\u20a620m volume \\u2014 massive margin jump"]', 0),
