('Nanny Placement & Childcare Agency', 'baby-childcare-services', '👶', 'trade', 'Vet, train, and place professional nannies, au pairs, and housekeepers with Lagos and Abuja working-class families. Charge one-month salary placement fee (₦20k–₦80k) plus ₦10k–₦30k/month ongoing management.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 10000, '["Service", "B2B", "Recurring", "Premium", "WhatsApp Business", "Google Forms (intake)", "Paystack", "Excel Candidate DB", "LinkedIn"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Build a database of 30\\u201350 pre-vetted nannies: police verification, health check, references (\\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k per candidate)", "Market to: working mothers WhatsApp groups, maternity hospitals, corporate HR departments", "Standard fee: 1-month salary placement fee = \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a680k per successful placement", "Add monthly monitoring service: check-in with family and nanny \\u2014 \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a620k/month retainer", "Scale to full domestic staffing agency: drivers, cleaners, cooks \\u2014 one stop for household staffing"]', 0),
('Sublimation Printing Business (Custom Gifts)', 'sublimation-printing', '🎨', 'trade', 'Print custom photos, designs, and text on mugs, T-shirts, phone cases, and pillows using sublimation printing. Corporate orders and Valentine/birthday gifts drive demand year-round.', 2000, 60000, 'day', 'beginner', 60000, '["Creative", "Low Capital", "Daily Cash", "Gifting", "Sublimation Printer", "Heat Press Machine", "Adobe Photoshop", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy sublimation printer + heat press machine (\\u20a660k\\u2013\\u20a6120k bundle \\u2014 Aliexpress or local tech market)", "Source blank products: sublimation mugs, T-shirts, phone cases from Alaba or import in bulk", "Open Instagram and WhatsApp catalogue with your best samples \\u2014 gifting content goes viral easily", "Charge: custom mug \\u20a63k\\u2013\\u20a66k, T-shirt \\u20a64k\\u2013\\u20a68k, corporate branded set \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6200k for 20+ items", "Crack corporate orders: branded merchandise for companies, events, NYSC graduation kits"]', 0),
('Ghostwriting & Content Creation Service', 'ghostwriting-service', '✍️', 'digital', 'Write books, LinkedIn articles, newsletters, and speeches on behalf of busy executives, entrepreneurs, and thought leaders. One ghostwritten business book earns $500–$5,000; a monthly LinkedIn retainer earns $500–$1,500.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Remote", "USD Income", "No Capital", "Creative", "Google Docs", "Grammarly", "Hemingway App", "Reedsy", "Notion (content calendar)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Build a writing portfolio with 5 sample long-form pieces in business, finance, and leadership niches", "Sign up on Reedsy (ghostwriting marketplace), Upwork, and reach out on LinkedIn directly", "LinkedIn ghostwriting retainer: 8\\u201312 posts per month at $400\\u2013$1500 monthly \\u2014 easiest entry point", "Book ghostwriting: charge $2,000\\u2013$10,000+ for 30,000\\u201360,000 word business/memoir books", "Hire junior writers for research and drafts \\u2014 you handle client relationship and final editing at scale"]', 0),
('E-Commerce Store Manager (Jumia/Konga/Shopify)', 'online-store-management', '🛒', 'digital', 'Manage product listings, order fulfilment, customer service, and ad campaigns for businesses selling on Jumia, Konga, and Shopify. Brands pay ₦50k–₦200k/month for a dedicated store manager.', 2500, 80000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Remote", "Recurring", "B2B", "No Capital", "Jumia Seller Center", "Shopify Admin", "Meta Ads Manager", "Canva", "Paystack"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Learn Jumia Seller Center and Shopify admin \\u2014 both have free tutorials (5 hours each)", "Create a case study: offer to manage 1 store for free for 30 days in exchange for a testimonial", "Services to offer: product uploads, SEO-optimized descriptions, ad campaigns, inventory management, returns handling", "Charge: \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6100k/month for Jumia management, \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6200k/month for Shopify + ad management", "Scale to agency: manage 10 stores with a team of 3 \\u2014 you handle client relations and strategy"]', 0),
('Church Technology & AV Setup Service', 'church-event-tech', '⛪', 'trade', 'Set up, maintain, and upgrade sound systems, projectors, live streaming, and church management software for local churches. Nigeria has 500,000+ registered churches — all need tech help.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 10000, '["Service", "B2B", "Recurring", "Community", "Yamaha Mixer", "OBS Studio (streaming)", "PowerPoint/ProPresenter", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Offer free AV audit to 5 local churches \\u2014 identify: poor sound, no live stream, bad projector", "Create a package: Basic Sound Setup \\u20a650k, Full AV + Streaming Setup \\u20a6150k\\u2013\\u20a6400k", "Sell monthly maintenance: \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k/month to handle all tech problems so the pastor doesn\'t worry", "Add church management software: ChurchPad, Church Insight \\u2014 train admin staff at \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k setup fee", "Scale to 30 churches on monthly retainer = \\u20a6600k\\u2013\\u20a61.5m in stable monthly recurring income"]', 0),
('Rent-to-Rent Short-Let Arbitrage', 'rental-property-airbnb-flip', '🏡', 'trade', 'Lease apartments long-term at ₦600k–₦1.5m/year and sublet on Airbnb and Hotels.ng at ₦25k–₦80k/night. One well-located apartment can generate ₦500k–₦2m/month with the right occupancy rate.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 300000, '["Real Estate", "Passive", "No Capital Needed", "Scalable", "Airbnb Host", "Booking.com", "HostAway PMS", "WhatsApp Business", "Interior Styling"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Find landlords willing to allow short-letting \\u2014 offer 10\\u201320% above standard long-term rent as incentive", "Sign a subletting agreement explicitly permitting Airbnb \\u2014 non-negotiable protection for your investment", "Furnish professionally: buy quality used furniture, invest in photography (\\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6150k total fit-out per room)", "List on Airbnb, Booking.com, Hotels.ng, and Shortlet Nigeria simultaneously for maximum occupancy", "Target 70%+ occupancy: price dynamically (higher on weekends and public holidays) for maximum revenue"]', 0),
('Sports Prediction & Betting Tips Service', 'sports-betting-tips', '⚽', 'digital', 'Run a paid WhatsApp or Telegram channel delivering researched football predictions and betting tips. Nigerian punters pay ₦2k–₦10k/month per subscriber for quality tips — 500 subscribers = ₦1m–₦5m/month.', 1500, 40000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Phone Only", "Recurring", "Community", "Social Media", "WhatsApp Business", "Telegram Premium", "Paystack Subscription", "Excel Stats Tracker", "SofaScore / Flashscore"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Build a free public channel for 30 days \\u2014 track your record publicly to build credibility and following", "Convert followers to paid tier: WhatsApp or Telegram premium at \\u20a63k\\u2013\\u20a68k/month", "Focus on value bets: over/under, both-teams-to-score, and accumulator packages \\u2014 educate as well as tip", "Show ROI data transparently: monthly win/loss records build massive trust and justify premium pricing", "Partner with betting platforms for affiliate deals \\u2014 earn bonus on every subscriber who registers and deposits via your link"]', 0),
('Private Car Hire & Chauffeur Service', 'car-hire-driver', '🚗', 'trade', 'Offer fixed-rate private car hire to corporate clients, event-goers, and frequent travelers who want a known, trusted driver rather than ride-hailing unpredictability. Contracts pay ₦150k–₦500k/month.', 4000, 120000, 'day', 'intermediate', 1, '["Daily Cash", "Transport", "Asset", "Premium", "WhatsApp Business", "Google Maps", "Booking Spreadsheet", "Clean Car", "Professional Dress Code"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register as a vendor with at least 3 corporate HR departments \\u2014 monthly driver contracts are the goal", "Build a WhatsApp contact list of 200+ frequent clients: expatriates, businesspeople, event managers", "Charge: \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k/day for full-day hire, \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a625k/half day, \\u20a6300k\\u2013\\u20a6500k/month fixed corporate contract", "Add premium services: airport meet-and-greet, clean suit dress code, phone charger, water \\u2014 tiny costs, huge perception", "Scale: hire 5 professional drivers for your fleet \\u2014 earn 30\\u201340% per trip as fleet owner"]', 0),
('Online Bakery & Cake Design Studio', 'online-bakery', '🎂', 'trade', 'Bake custom celebration cakes, cupcakes, and pastries for birthdays, weddings, and corporate events. A custom 3-tier wedding cake earns ₦80k–₦300k; birthday cakes earn ₦15k–₦80k each.', 2000, 60000, 'day', 'beginner', 20000, '["Creative", "Low Capital", "Daily Cash", "Social Media", "Instagram Business", "WhatsApp Catalogue", "Canva (menu design)", "Paystack", "Moulds + Piping Set"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Master 3 signature cake designs and photograph them professionally on clean backgrounds", "Open Instagram business account \\u2014 post daily Reels of your process (cutting, decorating, boxing)", "Price: custom birthday cake \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a650k, wedding cake \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6300k, cupcake dozen \\u20a68k\\u2013\\u20a620k", "Take 70% deposit before baking \\u2014 use deposit to fund ingredients for each order", "Scale: hire an assistant at \\u20a640k\\u2013\\u20a660k/month to handle basic baking so you focus on design and orders"]', 0),
('Talent Recruitment & Headhunting Agency', 'recruitment-headhunting', '🤝', 'digital', 'Place mid-level to senior professionals with Nigerian companies and earn 10–20% of the placed candidate\'s annual salary as a one-time fee. Placing one ₦3m/year manager earns you ₦300k–₦600k.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["B2B", "Commission", "Remote", "Scalable", "LinkedIn Recruiter", "Breezy HR", "Google Workspace", "Paystack", "Excel Candidate Tracker"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Register your recruitment agency with NECA (Nigeria Employers\' Consultative Association) for credibility", "Build a LinkedIn presence: connect with 500+ professionals in your target sectors (tech, finance, FMCG)", "Land first client: approach a growing startup or SME with a \\"No placement, no fee\\" offer", "Standard fee: 10\\u201315% of annual gross salary for permanent placement; 20\\u201325% for C-suite roles", "Add contract staffing: place temps and earn 20\\u201330% markup on their daily/monthly rate \\u2014 recurring income"]', 0),
('JAMB/WAEC Home Tutorial Centre', 'tutoring-center', '🎓', 'trade', 'Prepare secondary school students for WAEC, NECO, JAMB, and Post-UTME. A Saturday tutorial centre with 30 students at ₦10k–₦20k/term earns ₦300k–₦600k every 3 months.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 10000, '["Education", "Recurring", "Community", "Daily Cash", "Whiteboard + Markers", "Past Question Banks (WAEC/JAMB)", "WhatsApp Group", "Paystack", "Google Forms (registration)"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Identify 3 key subjects you can teach excellently: Maths, English, Physics, Biology, Chemistry \\u2014 or all", "Rent a hall space or use your home: starting from \\u20a610k/month in most communities", "Advertise: estate notice boards, church groups, WhatsApp, and school gate announcements", "Charge: \\u20a68k\\u2013\\u20a620k per student per 3-month term; full JAMB intensive package \\u20a625k\\u2013\\u20a650k", "Scale: hire 2\\u20133 subject specialists, open multiple arms for different classes, rebrand as a learning academy"]', 0),
('Market Research & Data Collection Agency', 'market-research-fieldwork', '📋', 'trade', 'Conduct field surveys, focus groups, mystery shopping, and consumer research for brands, NGOs, and international research firms. One 200-person survey project earns ₦200k–₦1m.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 20000, '["B2B", "Remote", "USD Income", "Niche", "KoBoToolbox", "ODK Collect", "Google Forms", "Excel", "GeoPoll / Ipsos Vendor Portal"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register on GeoPoll, Ipsos Nigeria vendor list, and international platforms like UserTesting", "Build a team of 20\\u201350 trained field interviewers across Lagos, Abuja, Kano, and Port Harcourt", "Pitch directly to: FMCG brands (Nestl\\u00e9, Unilever, PZ), telecom companies, NGOs, and government agencies", "Price: \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k per completed interview (depending on complexity), survey programming \\u20a6100k+, focus group \\u20a6200k+", "Add digital surveys: SurveyCTO or Kobo Toolbox for mobile data collection \\u2014 faster, cheaper, more professional"]', 0),
('Website Maintenance & Hosting Retainer Service', 'website-maintenance-retainer', '🌐', 'digital', 'Handle monthly website updates, security patches, backup, and performance for SMEs who built a site and have no idea how to maintain it. A portfolio of 20 clients at ₦20k–₦50k/month earns ₦400k–₦1m monthly.', 1500, 40000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Recurring", "Tech", "B2B", "No Capital", "WordPress Admin", "Wordfence", "UpdraftPlus", "WP Rocket", "Cloudflare"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Master WordPress basics: updates, backups, security plugins (Wordfence, UpdraftPlus), performance (WP Rocket)", "Identify small business websites with outdated plugins, no SSL, or slow loading \\u2014 these are your prospects", "Offer free site audit showing 5 critical issues \\u2014 then sell the solution as a monthly care plan", "Charge: \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k/month basic care plan; \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6100k/month with content updates and SEO reporting", "Add hosting reselling: buy reseller hosting from Namecheap, host 30 client sites, charge \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6100k/year each"]', 0),
('Custom Tailoring & Alterations Studio', 'tailoring-alterations', '🪡', 'trade', 'Sew custom Agbada, Senator, corporate wears, and occasion dresses from your home studio. Skilled tailors earn ₦5k–₦80k per outfit; bridal and aso-oke specialists command ₦100k–₦500k per set.', 2000, 60000, 'day', 'beginner', 30000, '["Creative", "Daily Cash", "Low Capital", "Skill", "Industrial Sewing Machine", "Overlocker", "Measuring Tape", "Instagram Portfolio", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Invest in a quality industrial sewing machine: Singer, Butterfly, or Janome (\\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k)", "Build a portfolio of 15\\u201320 pieces: Agbada, corporate suits, evening dresses \\u2014 photograph on models", "Post on Instagram Stories and WhatsApp Status daily \\u2014 fashion content spreads organically in Nigeria", "Charge: simple alteration \\u20a62k\\u2013\\u20a65k, Senator suit \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a640k, Agbada \\u20a640k\\u2013\\u20a6120k, bridal \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6500k", "Build recurring client base: corporate clients who need new outfits for every official event are goldmines"]', 0),
('Language Translation & Interpreting Service', 'translation-interpreting', '🌍', 'digital', 'Translate documents, websites, and legal/medical content for businesses, NGOs, and international organizations. Yoruba, Hausa, Igbo, and French-English translators are scarce and extremely well-paid.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Remote", "USD Income", "No Capital", "Niche", "SDL Trados (CAT Tool)", "OmegaT (free CAT)", "ProZ.com", "Google Docs", "Payoneer"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Create profiles on ProZ.com, TranslatorsCafe, and Upwork \\u2014 list all language pairs (English\\u2194Yoruba is rare and valuable)", "Get certified: ATA (American Translators Association) certification unlocks US government contracts", "Charge: general translation $0.10\\u2013$0.20 per source word; legal/medical $0.20\\u2013$0.40 per word", "Target NGOs in Nigeria: UNICEF, WHO, USAID all need local language translation for community programs", "Add interpreting (real-time spoken): conference interpreting earns $300\\u2013$800/day \\u2014 much higher than document work"]', 0),
('CCTV & Smart Security Installation', 'security-camera-installation', '📷', 'trade', 'Install CCTV systems, smart locks, and alarm systems for homes, offices, and shops. A 4-camera home system earns ₦40k–₦100k; large commercial installations earn ₦200k–₦800k.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 30000, '["Service", "B2B", "Recurring", "Tech", "CCTV Cameras (Hikvision/Dahua)", "DVR/NVR Unit", "Cat6 Cable", "Drill Set", "Remote Access App (iVMS-4500)"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Learn CCTV installation from YouTube \\u2014 master: cable routing, DVR setup, IP camera config, remote access (1 week)", "Do 3 free or discounted installs for neighbours to build your portfolio of before/after photos", "Source cameras from Computer Village (Lagos), Wuse Market (Abuja), or Aliexpress \\u2014 resell at 40\\u201380% markup", "Charge: 4-camera home kit \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6100k, 8-camera office system \\u20a6150k\\u2013\\u20a6300k, enterprise \\u20a6500k+", "Add annual maintenance contracts: \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k/year per client \\u2014 passive recurring income on every past install"]', 0),
('Agricultural Input Supply & Farm Advisory', 'agric-consultant-input-supplier', '🌱', 'trade', 'Supply certified seeds, fertilizers, agrochemicals, and farm advisory to smallholder farmers. Government subsidy programs (ADP, CBN) mean farmers have funds but lack access to quality inputs and knowledge.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 100000, '["Agriculture", "B2B", "Recurring", "Community", "NAFDAC Registration", "ADP Vendor Card", "WhatsApp Farmer Groups", "Excel Order Tracker", "Delivery Motorcycle"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register with NAFDAC as agro-input dealer and obtain state ADP vendor registration", "Source from: Premier Seed Nigeria, Notore Fertilisers, Bayer CropScience, Chi Farms for certified products", "Build farmer cooperative partnerships \\u2014 serve 10 cooperatives of 50 farmers each = 500 farmer clients", "Bundle advisory: soil testing, agronomic visit, harvest planning \\u2014 charge \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a620k/farm/season for consulting", "Access ADP and CBN Anchor Borrowers program contracts \\u2014 government supply can 10x your volume overnight"]', 0),
('YouTube Automation Channel (Faceless)', 'youtube-automation-channel', '▶️', 'digital', 'Run faceless YouTube channels using AI voiceovers, stock footage, and edited scripts on niches like Nigerian history, Afrobeats bios, and African finance. Monetized channels earn $500–$10,000/month passively.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'intermediate', 30000, '["Passive", "USD Income", "AI", "Scalable", "ElevenLabs AI Voice", "CapCut / DaVinci Resolve", "TubeBuddy (SEO)", "Pexels (footage)", "Claude AI (scripts)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Pick profitable niche: Nigerian billionaire stories, African history, Afrobeats artist bios, True Crime Africa", "Write scripts using Claude AI, generate voiceover using ElevenLabs ($5/month), add stock footage from Pexels/Pixabay", "Upload 3 videos per week consistently \\u2014 algorithm rewards consistency more than quality early on", "Apply for monetization at 1,000 subscribers + 4,000 watch hours (typically 4\\u20138 months in)", "Scale: run 3\\u20135 channels simultaneously using the same workflow \\u2014 each adds income without proportional effort"]', 0),
