('Logistics Coordinator & Dispatch Outsourcing', 'logistics-dispatch-coordinator', '📦', 'digital', 'Coordinate deliveries for small online businesses that ship 10–100 parcels daily. You book riders, track orders, handle failed deliveries, and invoice — all remotely. Businesses pay ₦30k–₦150k/month.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Remote", "B2B", "No Capital", "Recurring", "Sendbox", "Shipbubble", "GIG Logistics", "Trello (order tracking)", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Learn Sendbox, Shipbubble, and GIG Logistics APIs \\u2014 the tools e-commerce businesses use for delivery", "Approach online vendors (Instagram and WhatsApp sellers) who struggle with delivery management daily", "Handle: booking riders, generating tracking links, managing customer complaints, daily reconciliation", "Charge: \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k/month for up to 200 shipments/month; \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6200k for 200\\u20131000 shipments/month", "Scale: build a team of 3 coordinators, serve 10 mid-sized e-commerce brands \\u2014 become their fulfilment backbone"]', 0),
('Document Attestation & Notary Services', 'notary-document-attestation', '🔏', 'trade', 'Help individuals and businesses authenticate documents for embassies, immigration, FIRS, CAC, and overseas employment. One attestation bundle earns ₦20k–₦100k; immigration packages earn ₦100k–₦500k.', 3000, 90000, 'month', 'intermediate', 10000, '["Legal", "B2B", "Daily Cash", "Niche", "CAC Portal", "Ministry of Foreign Affairs Portal", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack", "Google Drive (doc tracking)"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Partner with a notary public or apply for your own commission from the state judiciary", "List all document types you can attest: degrees, birth certs, police clearance, marriage certs, power of attorney", "Build relationships at Federal Secretariat, state ministries, and embassies \\u2014 process knowledge is your edge", "Market on LinkedIn, Jiji, and diaspora Facebook groups: \\"UK Visa Documents Attestation \\u2014 Lagos, 24hrs\\"", "Charge: single document \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a630k; full immigration package (10+ docs) \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6300k"]', 0),
('Niche Perfume & Body Oil Business', 'perfume-oil-business', '🌸', 'trade', 'Blend and sell niche fragrances, attar oils, and designer-inspired perfumes. Nigerian fragrance demand is booming — a ₦500 blend sells for ₦3k–₦15k; luxury bottles hit ₦30k–₦100k.', 2000, 60000, 'day', 'beginner', 20000, '["Low Capital", "Creative", "FMCG", "Social Media", "Fragrance Concentrates", "Flacons + Atomisers", "Canva (labels)", "Instagram", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Source fragrance concentrates and carrier oils from Idumota (Lagos) or chemical suppliers \\u2014 \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a620k starter kit", "Learn basic blending ratios: 20\\u201330% concentrate in dipropylene glycol for body oils, 15\\u201320% in ethanol for EDP", "Bottle in nice flacons from Alaba or Aliexpress \\u2014 packaging is 60% of perceived value", "Build Instagram and TikTok with fragrance reviews, unboxings, and \\"what I smell like\\" content", "Create signature scent bundles: roll-on + body splash + oil for \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a630k \\u2014 increases average order value"]', 0),
('Immigration Consulting & Visa Advisory', 'immigration-consultant', '✈️', 'digital', 'Guide Nigerians through visa applications, study permits, and immigration pathways to Canada, UK, USA, Germany, and Australia. One successful case earns ₦100k–₦800k; express consultation alone earns ₦20k–₦80k.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Remote", "Premium", "Niche", "USD Income", "Zoom", "Calendly", "DocuSign", "Notion (case management)", "Paystack / Payoneer"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Study IRCC (Canada), UKVI (UK), and USCIS (USA) processes deeply \\u2014 free government resources exist", "Get certified: RCIC (Canada), ICCRC, or OISC (UK) \\u2014 international accreditation unlocks premium clients", "Start with a free \\"Immigration Roadmap Call\\" at 30 minutes to qualify and convert prospects", "Charge: Canadian Express Entry consultation \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6300k; full application management \\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a61.5m", "Partner with Nigerian diaspora Facebook groups and relocation influencers \\u2014 referrals are your pipeline"]', 0),
('POS Agent Network (Multi-Location)', 'pos-franchise-network', '🏧', 'trade', 'Expand beyond one POS terminal — deploy 5–20 terminals across your area with agents, earning ₦500–₦2000 per terminal per day in passive income from transaction fees.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'intermediate', 100000, '["Finance", "Scalable", "Daily Cash", "Recurring", "Moniepoint / OPay Super-Agent Portal", "Excel Fleet Tracker", "WhatsApp Agent Group", "Paystack (float top-up)"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register as an agent banking super-agent with Moniepoint, OPay, or PalmPay \\u2014 get sub-agent capacity", "Deploy terminals: give agents POS + float (\\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k each) and earn 40\\u201360% of their transaction fees", "Target: markets, bus parks, schools, hospitals \\u2014 any location with constant cash withdrawal demand", "Track remotely: all super-agent dashboards show real-time transaction volumes per terminal", "Scale to 50 terminals: at \\u20a61,000/terminal/day average that is \\u20a61.5m/month in passive income"]', 0),
('Product Photography Studio (E-Commerce)', 'ecommerce-photography', '📸', 'trade', 'Photograph products for Jumia sellers, Konga vendors, Instagram stores, and Amazon FBA exporters. Professional product photos increase conversion by 40–80% — sellers will pay ₦3k–₦15k per product shoot.', 3000, 90000, 'day', 'beginner', 30000, '["Creative", "B2B", "Recurring", "Daily Cash", "DSLR or Mirrorless Camera", "Softbox Lights", "Sweep Background", "Adobe Lightroom", "Instagram Portfolio"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Set up a home studio: white sweep background, 2 softbox lights, DSLR or Sony ZV-E10 (\\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k total)", "Build a portfolio shooting 20 products for free from local sellers \\u2014 document before/after sales results", "Pitch Jumia sellers in seller Facebook groups: \\"Your product photos are losing you sales \\u2014 here\'s proof\\"", "Price: \\u20a63k\\u2013\\u20a68k per product (simple), \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a620k lifestyle shoot, \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k full product catalogue", "Add video: 15-second product videos for \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k each \\u2014 Instagram Reels and TikTok ads need video content"]', 0),
('Laptop & Desktop Repair Service', 'ict-hardware-repairs', '🖥️', 'trade', 'Repair laptops, desktops, and accessories for students, SMEs, and professionals. Screen replacement earns ₦15k–₦50k; motherboard repair earns ₦30k–₦100k; data recovery commands ₦20k–₦150k.', 3000, 100000, 'day', 'intermediate', 20000, '["Technical", "Daily Cash", "Skill", "Recurring", "Soldering Station", "Hot Air Rework Station", "Multimeter", "AliExpress", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Build practical skills: watch 100+ hours of Louis Rossmann and Computer Clan repair tutorials on YouTube", "Invest in tools: soldering station, multimeter, hot air gun, BGA rework tools (\\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k starter kit)", "Source spare parts: Computer Village (Lagos), Wuse market (Abuja), or AliExpress for less common parts", "Advertise: university campuses, LinkedIn (corporate clients), estate WhatsApp groups", "Add data recovery as premium service: \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a6150k \\u2014 most people will pay almost anything to recover irreplaceable files"]', 0),
('Digital Marketing Agency for SMEs', 'digital-marketing-agency-sme', '📣', 'digital', 'Run Instagram, Facebook, and Google ads for Nigerian SMEs — restaurants, clinics, schools, and shops. A 5-client agency at ₦80k–₦200k/month each earns ₦400k–₦1m monthly.', 3000, 90000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["B2B", "Recurring", "Remote", "Scalable", "Meta Ads Manager", "Google Ads", "Canva", "Later (scheduling)", "Paystack"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Get Meta Blueprint and Google Ads certified \\u2014 both free, both credibility-builders", "Run your own \\"test\\" ad campaign with \\u20a65k to build screenshots for your portfolio", "Cold-outreach to local businesses with bad social media: restaurants, salons, clinics, schools", "Charge: \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6100k/month social media management + \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6300k/month ad spend management (% of budget)", "Productize: build a \\"SME Growth Package\\" \\u2014 defined deliverables make closing and delivering easier"]', 0),
('Local Language School (Yoruba/Hausa/Igbo/French)', 'language-school-local', '🗣️', 'trade', 'Teach Yoruba, Hausa, Igbo, or French to corporate employees, diaspora returnees, expats, and children. Demand from multinationals posting expats to Nigeria and from Nigerian diaspora reconnecting with roots.', 1500, 40000, 'month', 'beginner', 10000, '["Education", "Recurring", "Community", "Niche", "Zoom", "WhatsApp Group", "Canva (lesson slides)", "YouTube", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Create a 10-week structured curriculum: greetings, numbers, household words, conversation, culture", "Target corporate HR managers: multinationals bringing expats to Lagos, Abuja, Kano need language training fast", "Charge: private lesson \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a630k/hour, group class (5\\u201310 students) \\u20a68k\\u2013\\u20a615k/person/week", "Offer online via Zoom \\u2014 global diaspora will pay in dollars for Yoruba/Igbo/Hausa lessons ($30\\u2013$100/hour)", "Create a YouTube channel with free lessons \\u2014 builds audience, demonstrates value, generates leads"]', 0),
('Residential Deep Cleaning Service', 'cleaning-franchise-home', '🧹', 'trade', 'Offer professional home deep cleaning to busy middle-class families in Lagos, Abuja, and Port Harcourt. A 3-hour home clean earns ₦15k–₦50k; weekly recurring cleans build stable monthly income.', 2000, 50000, 'month', 'beginner', 5000, '["Service", "Daily Cash", "Recurring", "No Capital", "Professional Cleaning Kit", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack", "Trello (bookings)", "Branded Uniform"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy professional supplies: mop set, cleaning agents, microfibre cloths, vacuum cleaner (\\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a625k starter)", "Post in estate WhatsApp groups: \\"Professional Home Deep Clean \\u2014 From \\u20a615k. References available.\\"", "Build recurring clients: offer 10% discount for weekly/bi-weekly booking commitment \\u2014 these are your base income", "Charge: studio clean \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a620k, 2-bed \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a640k, duplex \\u20a640k\\u2013\\u20a680k; post-construction clean \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6300k", "Scale: hire and train 3 cleaners, buy branded uniforms, launch an agency brand with guaranteed staff insurance"]', 0),
('Waste Collection & Recycling Agent', 'waste-recycling-agent', '♻️', 'trade', 'Collect plastic bottles, cartons, metal scraps, and e-waste from homes, offices, and markets and sell to recycling depots. With a tricycle and network of 50 houses you earn ₦5k–₦20k daily.', 1500, 40000, 'day', 'beginner', 5000, '["Green", "Community", "Daily Cash", "Scalable", "Tricycle", "Weighing Scale", "Wecyclers / PackagAid Account", "WhatsApp Business", "Cash Float"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Identify nearest recycling depot: Wecyclers (Lagos), PackagAid, or Vicmart Recycling \\u2014 get their buy-back prices", "Build a collection route: 50\\u2013100 registered homes who call you for pickup in exchange for small payment or points", "Focus on: PET plastic (\\u20a6100\\u2013\\u20a6250/kg), cardboard (\\u20a650\\u2013\\u20a6100/kg), metals (\\u20a6500\\u2013\\u20a61000/kg), e-waste (\\u20a62k\\u2013\\u20a610k/unit)", "Partner with schools and offices for bulk monthly collection \\u2014 reliable volume beats daily hustle", "Scale: buy a second tricycle, add 2 collectors, expand to 10 estate contracts \\u2014 become a recycling SME"]', 0),
('Personal Income Tax Filing Service', 'tax-filing-consultant', '🧾', 'digital', 'File annual personal income tax (PIT) and business income tax returns for freelancers, SME owners, and corporate employees. Tax season earns ₦10k–₦80k per filing; year-round advisory adds monthly retainer income.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Finance", "Recurring", "B2B", "Remote", "FIRS TaxPro Max", "QuickBooks", "Excel", "Paystack", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Register on FIRS e-Tax portal as a tax agent and learn the TaxPro Max system inside-out", "Build expertise: study PAYE, VAT, WHT, CIT, and tertiary education tax \\u2014 all common SME obligations", "Target: online sellers, freelancers, and SME owners who ignore taxes until CBN blocks their account", "Charge: personal tax filing \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a630k, SME tax filing \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k, tax advisory retainer \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k/month", "Add value: \\"Tax Health Check\\" service showing businesses how much they can save legally \\u2014 lead with this to win clients"]', 0),
('Virtual & Hybrid Event Planning', 'virtual-event-planner', '🎪', 'digital', 'Plan and coordinate virtual conferences, webinars, online summits, and hybrid events for NGOs, corporates, and associations. A 2-day virtual conference earns ₦200k–₦1m in planning fees.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Events", "Remote", "B2B", "Creative", "Zoom Webinar", "Hopin", "StreamYard", "Eventbrite", "Canva (event graphics)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Master Zoom Webinar, Hopin, and StreamYard platforms \\u2014 they power 90% of virtual events", "Build event management SOP: speaker onboarding, registration, tech rehearsal, live management, post-event report", "Pitch to: NGOs (always running donor events), professional associations (ICAN, NMA, CIIN), universities", "Charge: \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6300k for simple webinar management; \\u20a6300k\\u2013\\u20a61m for full summit (100+ attendees, multi-day)", "Add sponsorship management: sell sponsorship slots in the events you produce \\u2014 additional income on top of planning fees"]', 0),
('Niche Affiliate Marketing Blog/Website', 'affiliate-marketing-blog', '💻', 'digital', 'Build a SEO-optimized blog in a high-commission niche (web hosting, finance, crypto, travel) and earn passive affiliate commissions. A 50-article site in the right niche earns $500–$10,000/month passively.', 1500, 40000, 'month', 'intermediate', 5000, '["Passive", "USD Income", "No Capital", "Scalable", "WordPress", "Ahrefs / Ubersuggest (SEO)", "Surfer SEO", "Hostinger", "Google Analytics"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Pick a niche with high affiliate payouts: web hosting (Bluehost \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a650k/referral), crypto exchanges, VPNs", "Register domain (Namecheap \\u20a63k/year) + hosting (Hostinger \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a610k/year) and install WordPress", "Write 50 detailed, SEO-optimized articles using Surfer SEO or NeuronWriter for keyword guidance", "Join affiliate programs: Jumia Affiliate, Amazon Associates, Bluehost, Binance, NordVPN \\u2014 all free to join", "Monetize further: display ads via Ezoic or Mediavine once traffic exceeds 10,000 monthly visits"]', 0),
('Elder Care & Home Support Services', 'elder-care-services', '👴', 'trade', 'Provide companionship, medication management, errand running, and basic health monitoring for elderly Nigerians whose children are busy or abroad. Diaspora families pay ₦50k–₦200k/month for peace of mind.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 10000, '["Healthcare", "Recurring", "Premium", "Community", "WhatsApp Business", "Weekly Report Template", "First Aid Kit", "Paystack", "Photo Update System (daily check-in photos)"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Get basic first aid and elderly care certification from NHREC-approved trainers (\\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a620k course)", "Target diaspora Nigerians on LinkedIn, diaspora Facebook groups: \\"We care for your parents back home\\"", "Services: daily check-in visits, medication tracking, doctor appointment escort, grocery shopping, phone calls", "Charge: 2-hour daily check-in \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a660k/month; live-in care companion \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6200k/month", "Partner with private hospitals for referrals \\u2014 doctors see elderly patients daily who lack home support"]', 0),
('Private School Bus & Student Transport', 'school-bus-service', '🚐', 'trade', 'Ferry students between home and school daily in a comfortable, safe bus or van. 30 students at ₦15k–₦30k/month per student = ₦450k–₦900k monthly from a single vehicle.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 1, '["Transport", "Recurring", "Asset", "B2B", "Toyota Hiace / Coaster", "FRSC Vehicle Papers", "Parent WhatsApp Group", "Monthly Receipt Booklet", "Tracker (safety)"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy or finance a Toyota Hiace or Coaster bus (18\\u201330 seats) \\u2014 reliability is non-negotiable for school runs", "Register with FRSC and get road worthiness certificate, driver\'s permit, and school transport approval", "Market to: PTA groups, estate WhatsApp groups, private school notice boards for the next term", "Charge: \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a630k/student/month \\u2014 collect one term in advance (3 months) to fund operating costs", "Scale: add a second bus on a different route, hire a professional driver \\u2014 double income, minimal added effort"]', 0),
('Mobile Money & Agency Banking Kiosk', 'mobile-pos-banking', '💳', 'trade', 'Set up a mini financial services kiosk offering POS withdrawals, transfers, airtime, DSTV renewal, electricity, and Opay/Palmpay wallet services. A busy kiosk earns ₦5k–₦30k daily.', 2000, 60000, 'day', 'beginner', 20000, '["Finance", "Daily Cash", "No Capital", "Community", "POS Machine (from Moniepoint)", "Cash Float", "Calculator", "Receipt Booklet", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register with Moniepoint, OPay, or PalmPay as an agent \\u2014 submit ID, BVN, and bank account details", "Fund your float: \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a680k initial cash float \\u2014 larger float = more transactions per day", "Set up kiosk in highest-footfall spot: market entrance, bus stop, hospital gate, church/mosque junction", "Offer all services: withdrawals, transfers, airtime, electricity, cable TV, school fees, betting deposits", "Track daily P&L: every \\u20a6500 withdrawal earns you \\u20a650\\u2013\\u20a6150; target 50\\u2013100 transactions/day"]', 0),
('Photography Studio Rental Business', 'photography-studio-rental', '🎞️', 'trade', 'Set up a professional photography studio with cycloramas, backdrops, and lighting and rent it by the hour to photographers, content creators, and brands. At ₦10k–₦30k/hour a busy studio earns ₦200k–₦800k/month.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 300000, '["Creative", "Asset", "Passive", "B2B", "LED Studio Lights", "Seamless Backgrounds", "Google My Business", "Instagram", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Rent or use own space (minimum 200 sqm): convert to studio with white/grey/black cyclorama walls", "Invest in: 3-point LED lighting kit, seamless backdrop rolls, reflectors, posing furniture (\\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6500k)", "List on Google Maps, Instagram, and photography Facebook groups in your city", "Charge: \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a620k/hour; half day (4hrs) \\u20a635k\\u2013\\u20a660k; full day \\u20a660k\\u2013\\u20a6120k; with makeup room \\u20a6150k+", "Add-ons: hire out equipment (cameras, lenses), offer a resident makeup artist, provide a props room"]', 0),
('Crypto & Web3 Education & Bootcamp', 'cryptocurrency-education', '₿', 'digital', 'Teach Nigerians how to trade crypto safely, use DeFi, mint NFTs, and earn from Web3. Weekend bootcamps of 20 students at ₦30k–₦80k each earn ₦600k–₦1.6m per cohort.', 3000, 90000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Education", "Crypto", "Recurring", "Remote", "Zoom", "Selar.co", "Telegram", "Canva (slides)", "Paystack"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Design curriculum: Module 1 (wallets, exchanges), Module 2 (trading basics), Module 3 (DeFi & yield), Module 4 (NFTs & Web3 jobs)", "Run free 2-hour intro webinar weekly \\u2014 convert 20\\u201330% to paid cohort (\\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k per student)", "Cohort format: 4 weekends, Zoom + recorded replays + private Telegram community", "Build 1-year track record showing your own portfolio performance \\u2014 credibility drives conversion", "Diversify: sell beginner course on Selar.co (\\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k), advanced DeFi course (\\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k) as passive income"]', 0),
('Residential Solar & Inverter Installation', 'solar-installation-residential', '☀️', 'trade', 'Install solar panels and inverter systems for middle-class homes tired of generator costs. A 5kVA home solar system earns ₦400k–₦1.2m installation fee — and NEPA problems mean demand never ends.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 100000, '["Green Energy", "Technical", "Recurring", "High Demand", "Solar Sizing Calculator", "MC4 Crimper Set", "Clamp Meter", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Get trained: NABCEP solar certification (online) or local NASENI-accredited training (\\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k)", "Buy tools: cable crimpers, clamp meter, MC4 connectors, torque wrench, safety kit (\\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k)", "Sell first at cost to 3 neighbours \\u2014 use their systems as live showroom demos for estate marketing", "Charge: 2kVA off-grid system \\u20a6250k\\u2013\\u20a6500k; 5kVA hybrid \\u20a6600k\\u2013\\u20a61.2m; 10kVA commercial \\u20a62m\\u2013\\u20a64m", "Add O&M contracts: \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k/year per system for annual checks and battery topping \\u2014 passive recurring income"]', 0),
('International Dropshipping (UK/USA Market)', 'dropshipping-uk-usa', '🌐', 'digital', 'Sell products to UK and USA customers without holding inventory using Shopify + AliExpress or CJ Dropshipping. A winning product store earns $2,000–$20,000/month from Nigeria.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'intermediate', 20000, '["USD Income", "Scalable", "No Capital", "E-commerce", "Shopify", "CJ Dropshipping", "Minea (product research)", "Meta Ads Manager", "Payoneer"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Research winning products on Minea or AdSpy \\u2014 find products with viral ads but low market saturation", "Build Shopify store (\\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a615k/month) with professional theme, trust badges, and product videos", "Source from CJ Dropshipping or Zendrop for faster shipping than AliExpress \\u2014 shipping speed kills conversions", "Run Meta ads starting with $10\\u2013$20/day \\u2014 test 3\\u20135 creatives and scale the winner", "Open Payoneer account to receive USD \\u2014 Nigerian banks are not reliable for Shopify payouts"]', 0),
('Curated Beauty & Wellness Subscription Box', 'beauty-subscription-box', '💆', 'trade', 'Curate and deliver monthly boxes of skincare, haircare, and wellness products to subscribers. 200 subscribers at ₦10k/month = ₦2m monthly recurring revenue with 40–60% gross margins.', 2500, 80000, 'month', 'intermediate', 50000, '["FMCG", "Recurring", "Creative", "Scalable", "Instagram / TikTok", "Paystack Subscription", "Sendbox", "Canva (box design)", "Notion (product curation)"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Source 5\\u20138 beauty products per box at \\u20a64k\\u2013\\u20a66k cost; sell subscription at \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a615k \\u2014 50%+ gross margin", "Partner with local and emerging beauty brands for free/discounted products in exchange for exposure", "Build a waiting list via Instagram and TikTok beauty content before your official launch date", "Ship via Sendbox or GIG \\u2014 negotiate volume rates for better margins on delivery costs", "Add tiers: Basic Box (\\u20a68k), Premium Box (\\u20a615k), Luxury Box (\\u20a625k) \\u2014 upsell existing subscribers"]', 0),
('Interior Design & 3D Rendering Service', 'interior-design-render', '🛋️', 'digital', 'Create 3D interior design renders and space plans for developers, homeowners, and architects who need to visualize spaces before building or renovating. One detailed render earns ₦30k–₦150k.', 3000, 90000, 'month', 'intermediate', 50000, '["Creative", "Remote", "B2B", "Premium", "SketchUp Pro / Blender", "V-Ray / Cycles Renderer", "Pinterest (inspiration)", "Instagram Portfolio", "Paystack"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Learn SketchUp + V-Ray or Blender + Cycles \\u2014 both have free tiers; master in 4\\u20138 weeks on YouTube", "Build a portfolio of 5\\u201310 detailed renders (use free design briefs from Archdaily for practice projects)", "Market on Instagram with before/after design transformations and LinkedIn for architecture firm leads", "Charge: 1-room render \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k; full apartment \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6300k; commercial space \\u20a6300k\\u2013\\u20a6800k", "Specialize: \\"Nigerian Traditional + Modern Fusion\\" interior style is underserved and commands premium globally"]', 0),
('Corporate Gifting & Branded Merchandise', 'corporate-gifting-service', '🎁', 'trade', 'Supply branded gifts, hampers, and promotional merchandise to companies for Christmas, Sallah, staff appreciation, and client retention. One corporate order of 500 items earns ₦500k–₦5m.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'beginner', 30000, '["B2B", "Seasonal", "Recurring", "Events", "Canva (catalogue design)", "WhatsApp Business", "Excel Order Tracker", "Paystack", "Trade Fair Supplier Network"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Build a product catalogue: branded pens, mugs, bags, food hampers, custom diaries \\u2014 source from Trade Fair", "Approach corporate procurement teams starting September for Christmas orders (the biggest season)", "Pitch value: \\"We handle everything \\u2014 design, production, packaging, and delivery\\"", "Charge: 200% markup on cost of goods \\u2014 a \\u20a6500 item sells at \\u20a61,000\\u2013\\u20a61,500 with branding", "Build recurring relationships: companies that gift in December often gift at Sallah, Easter, and NYIF graduations"]', 0),
('Weekly Meal Prep & Subscription Delivery', 'subscription-meal-prep', '🍱', 'trade', 'Prepare and deliver weekly meal plans to busy professionals, gym-goers, and diet-conscious Nigerians. 30 subscribers at ₦25k/week = ₦3m/month in recurring food income.', 2000, 60000, 'day', 'beginner', 10000, '["Food", "Recurring", "Daily Cash", "Health", "WhatsApp Business", "Instagram", "Paystack Subscription", "Meal Prep Containers", "Delivery Bags"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Create a weekly menu of 5 meal options: local healthy alternatives to swallow and oily stews", "Build a client waitlist via Instagram and estate WhatsApp: \\"Clean Nigerian Meal Prep \\u2014 No Junk, No Stress\\"", "Charge: daily plan \\u20a63k\\u2013\\u20a65k/day; weekly plan \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a625k; full month \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a680k \\u2014 pay in advance", "Partner with nutritionists for \\"dietitian-approved\\" branding \\u2014 commands 30\\u201350% price premium", "Scale: hire 2 cooks, get an NASIs-certified kitchen space, serve corporate offices lunch delivery Monday\\u2013Friday"]', 0),
('Forex Prop Trading & Funded Account', 'forex-prop-trading', '📈', 'digital', 'Pass a proprietary trading firm evaluation (FTMO, MyForexFunds, The Funded Trader) and trade with $10k–$200k of firm capital. Earn 70–90% of profits with zero personal capital at risk.', 2000, 80000, 'month', 'intermediate', 20000, '["Finance", "USD Income", "Remote", "Phone Only", "MetaTrader 4/5", "TradingView", "FTMO / TFT Funded Account", "Myfxbook (trade journal)", "Excel Trade Log"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Choose a prop firm: FTMO (most reputable), TFT, or E8 Markets \\u2014 each has slightly different rules", "Develop and backtest your strategy for at least 200 trades on TradingView before attempting a live eval", "Pass Phase 1 and Phase 2: hit profit target (8\\u201310%) while obeying drawdown limits (5\\u201310% daily/overall)", "Trade the funded account conservatively \\u2014 capital preservation is more important than maximum profit", "Scale: pass multiple accounts, refer traders via affiliate program (earn 10\\u201330% of their eval fees)"]', 0),
('School Supplies & Stationery Distribution', 'school-supplies-distributor', '📚', 'trade', 'Supply notebooks, textbooks, pens, bags, and uniforms to schools, parents, and bookshops. Back-to-school season (September and January) can generate ₦500k–₦3m in 2 weeks.', 2000, 60000, 'week', 'beginner', 30000, '["B2B", "Seasonal", "Recurring", "Trading", "Wholesale Supplier Contacts", "WhatsApp Business", "Excel Inventory", "Paystack", "School Supply Catalogue (Canva)"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Source wholesale: Ikeja, Onitsha, Aba, or Kano stationery markets \\u2014 buy in bulk at 40\\u201360% of retail price", "Build a school supply contract: pitch school bursars for bulk exclusive supply of all student materials", "Charge: retail individual items at 100\\u2013150% markup; school supply contracts at negotiated bulk rates", "Peak timing: stock up by August for September rush and by December for January resumption", "Add customization: print school names on notebooks, bags, and stationery \\u2014 schools pay premium for branded materials"]', 0),
('Personal Styling & Wardrobe Consulting', 'fashion-styling-wardrobe', '👗', 'trade', 'Help busy professionals, brides, and public figures build wardrobes and outfits for work, events, and media. A 3-hour wardrobe audit earns ₦30k–₦100k; styling a wedding party earns ₦200k–₦800k.', 3000, 90000, 'month', 'beginner', 10000, '["Creative", "Premium", "Service", "Social Media", "Instagram Portfolio", "Pinterest (inspiration boards)", "WhatsApp Business", "Canva (lookbooks)", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Build Instagram portfolio: style 5 friends or family members for free \\u2014 document every look professionally", "Offer \\"Wardrobe Audit\\": you visit the client\'s home, review their wardrobe, provide styling plan for \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k", "Target: working professionals needing interview/meeting outfits, brides, Instagram influencers, TV presenters", "Charge: wardrobe audit \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k, full restyle \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6300k, event styling \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6200k per event", "Partner with boutiques: earn 10\\u201315% referral on every client you send to shop \\u2014 an easy additional income stream"]', 0),
('Online STEM Tutoring (Local & International)', 'online-tutoring-stem', '🔬', 'digital', 'Tutor Nigerian and international students in Maths, Physics, Chemistry, and Biology via Zoom or platforms like Superprof and Preply. International rates reach $30–$100/hour for strong STEM tutors.', 1500, 40000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Education", "USD Income", "Remote", "Recurring", "Zoom", "Preply / Superprof", "Google Classroom", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack (local)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Create profiles on Preply, Superprof, Wyzant, and Tutoroo \\u2014 complete with photo, intro video, and credentials", "Set rate: start at $15\\u2013$20/hour on international platforms, increase as reviews accumulate", "Advertise locally: WAEC/JAMB WhatsApp groups, estate boards, and Facebook parenting groups at \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k/hour", "Offer: single sessions, monthly subscription (8 sessions), or exam intensive (daily for 2 weeks)", "Build group classes: tutor 5 students simultaneously at $10\\u2013$20/student \\u2014 5x the hourly rate for same 1 hour effort"]', 0),
('Funeral & Burial Coordination Services', 'funeral-services-coordinator', '🕊️', 'trade', 'Coordinate funeral logistics for families in shock — mortuary bookings, obituary printing, venue, caterers, and undertakers. Families pay ₦100k–₦500k for professional coordination during a very painful time.', 3000, 90000, 'month', 'intermediate', 20000, '["Service", "Community", "Recurring", "Niche", "Vendor Network Database", "Canva (obituary design)", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack", "Excel Event Tracker"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Build a network of vendors: mortuaries, coffin makers, caterers, printers, pastors, MCs, and grave spaces", "Create a \\"Full Burial Package\\" pricing sheet: Basic (\\u20a6150k), Standard (\\u20a6300k), Premium (\\u20a6600k+)", "Partner with hospitals, churches, and mosques \\u2014 they are informed of deaths first and refer to trusted coordinators", "Market delicately: church announcements, family association newsletters, estate boards \\u2014 not social media ads", "Add legacy services: obituary design, photo memorial books, family history video tribute \\u2014 \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a6100k extras"]', 0),
('Custom T-Shirt Printing (Campus & Corporate)', 'tshirt-printing-campus', '👕', 'trade', 'Print custom T-shirts for NYSC orientation camps, university departments, corporate away-days, and social clubs. One batch of 100 shirts at ₦3k margin each = ₦300k profit.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 50000, '["Low Capital", "Creative", "Daily Cash", "B2B", "DTF Printer or Screen Printing Kit", "Canva", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack", "Heat Press Machine"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy DTF or screen printing setup (\\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6150k) or partner with a local printer as a reseller first", "Target: NYSC camps (massive guaranteed demand every 3 weeks), university departments, corporate HRs", "Charge: \\u20a62,500\\u2013\\u20a65,000/shirt for standard orders; \\u20a68k\\u2013\\u20a620k for premium embroidery", "Use Canva to design mockups \\u2014 send clients a digital preview before printing", "Build a referral network: NYSC liaison officers and student union executives are worth their weight in orders"]', 0),
('Agricultural Commodity Brokerage', 'agro-commodity-broker', '🌽', 'trade', 'Connect farmers in producing states with buyers in consuming states — supermarkets, food processors, and market wholesalers. Earn 3–10% commission on multi-million-naira commodity trades without owning any stock.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Agriculture", "B2B", "Commission", "Trading", "AFEX Platform", "WhatsApp Broker Network", "Excel Deal Tracker", "Google Maps (farm locations)", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Build two contact lists simultaneously: farmers/cooperatives (supply side) and processors/retailers (demand side)", "Register on AFEX Commodities Exchange or ThriveAgric as a trading agent for added credibility", "Start with high-volume commodities: maize, soybeans, cassava, rice, groundnut \\u2014 year-round demand", "Always use a written agreement specifying your broker commission before introducing parties", "Scale: specialize in one commodity, build relationships in 2\\u20133 producing states and 3\\u20135 buying cities"]', 0),
('Tech Talent Recruitment Specialist', 'tech-recruitment-specialist', '🧑‍💻', 'digital', 'Place software developers, data scientists, and product managers with Nigerian startups, tech companies, and international employers hiring remotely from Nigeria. One senior dev placement earns ₦300k–₦1m.', 8000, 250000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["B2B", "Remote", "Commission", "USD Income", "LinkedIn Recruiter", "AngelList Talent", "Notion (candidate pipeline)", "Calendly", "Payoneer"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Build a talent database of 200+ verified Nigerian tech professionals with GitHub profiles and portfolio links", "Sign up as a recruiter on LinkedIn Recruiter Lite, AngelList, and Talent500 for access to job postings", "Partner with Nigerian tech startups (Flutterwave, Moniepoint, PiggyVest networks) for ongoing hiring needs", "Standard fee: 15\\u201320% of placed candidate\'s annual CTC \\u2014 a \\u20a65m/year dev earns you \\u20a6750k\\u2013\\u20a61m", "Tap remote work: place Nigerian devs with US/UK startups at $80k\\u2013$150k salaries \\u2014 your fee is 15\\u201320% of first-year salary"]', 0),
('Food Preservation & Value-Added Processing', 'food-preservation-processing', '🫙', 'trade', 'Process raw farm produce into packaged, shelf-stable products — dried pepper, crayfish powder, ogiri, locust beans, groundnut oil, and chin-chin. Value-added products earn 3–10x raw commodity margins.', 2000, 60000, 'day', 'beginner', 10000, '["Agriculture", "FMCG", "Low Capital", "Scalable", "Grinder/Blender", "NAFDAC Portal", "Packaging Machine", "Canva (label design)", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Pick one product to master first: dried ground pepper, packaged crayfish, or groundnut oil \\u2014 specialize", "Source raw materials from farm markets at peak harvest (cheapest time) and process in bulk", "Package in branded nylon/bottles with NAFDAC notification \\u2014 professional packaging commands 50% premium", "Sell to: supermarkets (shelf space deal), online (Jumia, WhatsApp), and market wholesalers", "Get NAFDAC food processing registration (\\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a680k) to supply formal retail and export channels"]', 0),
('Online Pharmacy & Health Products Reseller', 'online-pharmacy-reseller', '💊', 'digital', 'Resell NAFDAC-registered pharmaceuticals, supplements, and health products via WhatsApp, Jumia, and your own store. Nigerians spend ₦3–5 trillion annually on healthcare — online pharmacy is massively underserved.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'intermediate', 50000, '["Healthcare", "B2B", "Recurring", "E-commerce", "PCN Registration", "WhatsApp Business", "Jumia Seller Center", "Paystack", "Excel Inventory"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Register as a pharmaceutical premises with PCN (Pharmacists Council of Nigeria) \\u2014 mandatory for legal operation", "Source from: Emzor, GSK, Fidson, Swipha, and wholesalers in Isale Eko (Lagos) or Kano drug market", "Start with fast-moving products: malaria drugs, vitamins, pain relievers, family planning products, supplements", "Sell via WhatsApp (fastest), Jumia Health, and your own website \\u2014 free Jumia store to test demand", "Add health consultation: partner with a pharmacist for \\u20a6500\\u2013\\u20a62k triage consultations to drive product sales"]', 0),
('Afrocentric Fashion Export (Etsy/Depop)', 'export-fashion-afro', '🌍', 'digital', 'Sell authentic Nigerian fabrics, Ankara clothing, adire, and Afrocentric fashion on Etsy and Depop to global diaspora and fashion-forward buyers. One handmade Ankara dress sells for $40–$150.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 20000, '["Creative", "USD Income", "Export", "Fashion", "Etsy", "Depop", "Canva (store branding)", "DHL Shipping Account", "Payoneer"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Open Etsy and Depop stores with clear \\"Made in Nigeria\\" and \\"Afrocentric\\" branding \\u2014 origin is your USP", "Source: Ankara fabric (\\u20a61k\\u2013\\u20a63k/yard), aso-oke, adire, kente from Balogun, Tejuosho, or Aba markets", "Start with ready-to-wear pieces and fabric bundles \\u2014 items that need no custom sizing ship fastest", "Photography is everything: use bright natural light, black model photos, and flat-lay product shots", "Ship via DHL or UPS eCommerce \\u2014 factor DHL rates (\\u20a68k\\u2013\\u20a625k/kg) into your pricing model"]', 0),
('Fleet Management & GPS Tracking Service', 'fleet-management-service', '🚛', 'digital', 'Install GPS trackers and manage real-time fleet monitoring for logistics companies, schools, and delivery businesses. Monthly SaaS-style management fee per vehicle = pure recurring revenue.', 3000, 90000, 'month', 'intermediate', 50000, '["B2B", "Tech", "Recurring", "Logistics", "Traccar Platform", "GPS Tracker Hardware", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack Subscription", "Google Maps API"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Become a reseller for Traccar, Fleet Complete, or local platforms like VehicleTracker.ng", "Buy GPS tracker hardware at wholesale (\\u20a68k\\u2013\\u20a625k/unit) and install on client vehicles", "Charge: \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k installation per tracker + \\u20a63k\\u2013\\u20a68k/vehicle/month for SaaS monitoring subscription", "Target: transport companies (buses, trucks), school buses, oil-field logistics firms, courier companies", "Add driver behavior reporting: speeding alerts, route deviation, idle time \\u2014 compliance saves clients insurance premium"]', 0),
('Voice-Over Artist & Audio Branding', 'voice-over-artist', '🎤', 'digital', 'Record voice-overs for TV adverts, explainer videos, e-learning courses, and radio commercials. A 30-second TV commercial VO earns ₦30k–₦150k; e-learning narration earns $20–$50 per finished hour.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 20000, '["Creative", "Remote", "USD Income", "No Capital", "AT2020 USB Mic", "Adobe Audition / Audacity", "Acoustic Foam Panels", "Voices.com", "Payoneer"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Buy: Audio-Technica AT2020 USB mic + pop filter + acoustic foam panels \\u2014 home studio for \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k", "Record a 60-second demo reel showcasing multiple styles: corporate, conversational, dramatic, upbeat", "Create profiles on Voices.com, Voice123, Backstage, and Fiverr with your demo prominently featured", "Target Nigerian ad agencies directly \\u2014 they book VO artists for every TV and radio campaign", "Specialize in Pidgin English, Yoruba, Igbo, or Hausa VO \\u2014 bilingual artists earn significantly more per job"]', 0),
('Legal & Medical Transcription Service', 'legal-transcription', '📝', 'digital', 'Transcribe legal proceedings, court hearings, medical dictation, and research interviews for law firms, hospitals, and international organizations. Specialized transcription earns $0.75–$3.00 per audio minute.', 1500, 40000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Remote", "USD Income", "No Capital", "Niche", "Express Scribe", "Rev.com / TranscribeMe", "Payoneer", "Noise-Cancelling Headphones", "Google Docs"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Test your speed: aim for 65+ WPM with high accuracy \\u2014 free typing tests at Keybr.com", "Build profiles on Rev.com, TranscribeMe, GoTranscript, and Scribie \\u2014 all accept Nigerian transcriptionists", "Study legal and medical terminology: free glossaries exist online; specialty knowledge earns premium rates", "Invest in Express Scribe transcription software (free version works) and a good pair of headphones", "Scale: become a proofreader at higher rates once you hit 98%+ accuracy \\u2014 or recruit and manage other typists"]', 0),
('Content Localization & Cultural Adaptation', 'content-localization', '🌐', 'digital', 'Adapt international content (apps, websites, marketing campaigns) for Nigerian, West African, or pan-African markets — adjusting language, cultural references, imagery, and context. Brands pay $500–$5,000 per project.', 3000, 90000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Remote", "USD Income", "Niche", "B2B", "Google Docs", "Notion", "LinkedIn", "Payoneer", "Loom (client presentations)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Define your specialization: \\"Nigerian market localization for fintech apps\\" is more valuable than \\"general translation\\"", "Build a portfolio: adapt 3 existing global campaigns for the Nigerian context \\u2014 show what you would change and why", "Find clients on Toptal, PeoplePerHour, and through LinkedIn outreach to global brands entering Africa", "Charge: website localization review $500\\u2013$2,000; full campaign cultural audit $2,000\\u2013$8,000; app localization $3,000\\u2013$10,000+", "Add: ongoing cultural consultancy retainer for brands maintaining Nigerian presence \\u2014 $1,000\\u2013$3,000/month"]', 0),
('Solar & Generator Preventive Maintenance', 'solar-maintenance-contracts', '🔧', 'trade', 'Offer annual and bi-annual maintenance contracts for solar systems, inverters, and generators in residential estates and commercial buildings. 50 maintenance contracts at ₦30k/year each = ₦1.5m pure recurring income.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 20000, '["Technical", "Recurring", "High Demand", "Green Energy", "Multimeter", "Battery Load Tester", "Laptop (reports)", "WhatsApp Business", "Service Contract Template"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Create a professional maintenance checklist: battery health check, panel cleaning, inverter firmware, generator service", "Target: estates with existing solar/inverter installations \\u2014 approach facility managers and estate management offices", "Offer a free inspection to convert to paid maintenance contract", "Charge: inverter/solar annual contract \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k/year; generator service \\u20a610k\\u2013\\u20a630k per service visit", "Scale to 100+ contracts: hire 2 trained technicians, you manage scheduling and client relationships"]', 0),
('Nigerian Podcast Network & Ad Sales', 'podcast-hosting-naija', '🎙️', 'digital', 'Launch a Nigerian podcast that attracts sponsorships, listener donations, and premium memberships. Top Nigerian podcasts earn ₦500k–₦5m/month from brand sponsorships and Patreon-style memberships.', 1500, 40000, 'month', 'intermediate', 20000, '["Creative", "Passive", "USD Income", "Community", "ATR2100x Mic", "Audacity", "Anchor.fm / Spotify for Podcasters", "Canva (cover art)", "Patreon"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Pick an underserved niche: Nigerian true crime, African business stories, mental health, relationship advice \\u2014 original beats generic", "Gear: Audio-Technica ATR2100x mic (\\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a625k) + free Audacity software + Anchor.fm free hosting to start", "Release 20+ episodes before pitching sponsors \\u2014 show consistent publishing cadence and audience engagement", "Monetize: Patreon/Buymeacoffee memberships (\\u20a62k\\u2013\\u20a65k/month), brand sponsorships (\\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6500k/episode at scale)", "Cross-promote: appear on 10 other Nigerian podcasts as a guest \\u2014 fastest way to grow a relevant audience"]', 0),
('Property Scouting & Deal Finding Service', 'real-estate-scouting', '🔍', 'trade', 'Find off-market properties, distressed sales, and undervalued land for investors and developers. Serious property investors pay ₦50k–₦500k as a sourcing fee for each verified deal you bring them.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Real Estate", "Commission", "No Capital", "Niche", "Google Maps (area research)", "Land Registry Portal", "WhatsApp Network", "Paystack", "Excel Deal Pipeline"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Build a database of motivated sellers: families needing quick cash, owners relocating abroad, distressed landlords", "Study: current market prices per sqm in your focus area \\u2014 you must know when something is underpriced", "Register on PropertyPro, Nigeria Property Centre, and Jiji as a Scout/Agent for lead flow", "Source deals: estate WhatsApp groups, church notice boards, estate court auctions, and probate sales", "Charge: 2\\u20135% of property value as a sourcing fee \\u2014 for \\u20a610m land you earn \\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6500k for the introduction"]', 0),
('Executive Virtual Assistant (Premium)', 'executive-virtual-assistant', '🗂️', 'digital', 'Provide high-level remote executive support — calendar management, research, travel booking, email triage, and project coordination — for CEOs and founders who pay $500–$3,000/month for a reliable assistant.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Remote", "Recurring", "USD Income", "No Capital", "Notion", "Asana", "Google Workspace", "Calendly", "Slack"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Build your tech stack: master G Suite, Notion, Asana, Trello, Zoom, Calendly, and Slack before applying", "Create a portfolio showcasing your organizational systems: sample project tracker, travel itinerary, research brief", "Apply on Belay Solutions, Boldly, Wing, and Time Etc \\u2014 premium VA firms with vetted clients", "Charge independently: $25\\u2013$50/hour or $800\\u2013$2,500/month fixed retainer for 20\\u201340 hours/month", "Specialize: \\"Executive VA for tech startup founders\\" or \\"VA for real estate investors\\" commands 2\\u20133x general VA rates"]', 0),
('Herbal & Natural Wellness Product Line', 'herbal-wellness-products', '🌿', 'trade', 'Create and sell herbal teas, moringa products, black soap, shea butter skincare, and natural remedies. Nigeria\'s wellness market is exploding — authentic Nigerian herbal products sell locally and export globally.', 2000, 60000, 'day', 'beginner', 10000, '["Healthcare", "FMCG", "Creative", "Scalable", "NAFDAC Portal", "Instagram / TikTok", "Etsy (export)", "Paystack", "Canva (labels)"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Source: moringa leaves, ginger, turmeric, black seed oil, shea butter from Kano, Jos, or Sokoto markets", "Process and package in attractive branded bottles, tins, or pouches \\u2014 get NAFDAC listing for food/cosmetics", "Build content: educational Instagram and TikTok on natural remedies and wellness \\u2014 health content gets massive organic reach", "Sell to: health food stores, pharmacies, Instagram/WhatsApp customers, and Jumia Health category", "Export niche: moringa powder and black soap sell exceptionally well on Etsy and Amazon to the US market"]', 0),
('Office & Commercial Cleaning Contracts', 'commercial-cleaning-contracts', '🏢', 'trade', 'Clean offices, banks, hospitals, and commercial buildings on a daily or weekly contract basis. One bank branch cleaning contract pays ₦100k–₦300k/month; a 10-branch contract pays ₦1m–₦3m/month.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 20000, '["B2B", "Recurring", "Service", "Scalable", "Industrial Cleaning Equipment", "Company Registration", "WhatsApp Team Group", "Payroll Software", "Service Contract Template"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register company and get business account \\u2014 corporate clients will not pay individuals for cleaning contracts", "Buy commercial-grade equipment: industrial mop set, vacuum, floor polisher (\\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a680k starter)", "Target: banks (largest consistent clients), telecom offices, schools, hospitals, and factory facilities", "Price by area: \\u20a6500\\u2013\\u20a62,000/sqm per month depending on frequency and soil level", "Hire trained, uniformed cleaners \\u2014 pay monthly and manage through a WhatsApp shift team group"]', 0),
('Car Wash & Express Detailing Station', 'car-wash-detailing-station', '🚿', 'trade', 'Run a physical car wash location offering express washes and full detailing. A busy Lagos or Abuja car wash does 30–80 cars daily at ₦2,000–₦8,000 each — earning ₦100k–₦500k daily at scale.', 2000, 60000, 'day', 'beginner', 30000, '["Daily Cash", "Low Capital", "Service", "Recurring", "Pressure Washer", "Water Storage Tank", "WhatsApp Business", "POS Machine", "Branded Signboard"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Secure a pitch: roadside space near a petrol station, inside an estate, or near a supermarket carpark", "Buy: pressure washer (\\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a640k), water tank, hose, shampoo, microfibre towels \\u2014 simple starter kit", "Offer tiered services: rinse & wipe \\u20a61,500, full wash \\u20a63,000, interior + exterior \\u20a66,000, full detail \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a630k", "Hire 2\\u20133 washers on daily pay (\\u20a62,000\\u2013\\u20a63,000/day each) once volume justifies \\u2014 you manage and supply", "Add: tyre shine, engine bay cleaning, deodorizing \\u2014 upsell every customer for 30\\u201350% higher ticket"]', 0),
('2D Animation & Motion Graphics Studio', 'animation-motion-graphics', '🎞️', 'digital', 'Create explainer videos, animated ads, motion graphics, and logo animations for brands and agencies. A 60-second explainer animation earns ₦150k–₦600k; international clients pay $500–$3,000 for the same.', 3000, 90000, 'month', 'intermediate', 30000, '["Creative", "Remote", "USD Income", "B2B", "Adobe After Effects", "Illustrator", "Lottie (web animations)", "Behance Portfolio", "Payoneer"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Master After Effects (industry standard) or Blender 2D \\u2014 both have extensive free YouTube courses", "Build a reel: create 3 quality explainer videos for fictional brands \\u2014 60 seconds each in different styles", "Sell on Fiverr, Upwork, and Behance initially; transition to direct client outreach for better rates", "Charge: logo animation \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a660k, 30-second social media ad animation \\u20a660k\\u2013\\u20a6150k, 90-second explainer \\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6600k", "Outsource to junior animators once you hit capacity \\u2014 take 40\\u201350% project margin as creative director"]', 0),
('Corporate & Conference Photography', 'professional-photography-events', '📷', 'trade', 'Cover corporate events, conferences, staff days, and product launches for companies. A full-day corporate shoot earns ₦50k–₦200k; a 3-day conference earns ₦200k–₦600k.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'beginner', 80000, '["Creative", "B2B", "Daily Cash", "Recurring", "Sony / Canon Full-Frame Camera", "Adobe Lightroom", "Wetransfer (image delivery)", "LinkedIn", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Invest in a reliable kit: Sony A7III or Canon R6 + 24\\u201370mm f/2.8 lens (\\u20a6150k\\u2013\\u20a6400k used)", "Build a corporate portfolio: attend 3 free events (volunteer with NGOs, churches) and document them professionally", "Create a corporate photography one-pager: rates, deliverables, turnaround time, licensing terms", "Approach corporate communications teams and event agencies \\u2014 they book photographers for every company event", "Charge: half day \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a680k, full day \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6200k; conference \\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6600k; product launch \\u20a6150k\\u2013\\u20a6400k"]', 0),
('Agricultural Land Leasing & Farm Management', 'agric-land-leasing', '🌾', 'trade', 'Lease agricultural land from rural landowners at ₦30k–₦200k/hectare/year and sublease to farmers or cultivate yourself with hired labour. Well-managed farmland generates 3–5x the lease cost in annual returns.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 100000, '["Agriculture", "Asset", "Passive", "Scalable", "Land Lease Agreement Template", "NIRSAL Portal", "AFEX Commodities Platform", "Excel Farm Budget", "WhatsApp Farm Team"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Identify land in Benue, Kogi, Nasarawa, Kaduna, or Ogun \\u2014 high-yield states with affordable farmland", "Lease 5\\u201320 hectares from landowners under a 3\\u20135 year lease agreement with legal documentation", "Cultivate maize, cassava, soybeans, or vegetables using hired casual labour (\\u20a62k\\u2013\\u20a65k/day per worker)", "Sell harvest to aggregators (AFEX, Thrive Agric), processors, or directly to market traders", "Access financing: CBN Anchor Borrowers Programme (5\\u20139% loans), NIRSAL Agric Fund for expansion capital"]', 0),
('Beauty Supply & Cosmetics Wholesale', 'beauty-supply-wholesale', '💄', 'trade', 'Import or source beauty supplies — weaves, wigs, lashes, makeup, and skincare — and sell wholesale to salons, beauticians, and retail vendors. A single weave container import earns ₦1m–₦5m gross profit.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 100000, '["FMCG", "B2B", "Trading", "Scalable", "Alibaba Supplier Account", "WhatsApp Business (price list)", "Excel Order Tracker", "Customs Agent Contact", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Source: Brazilian and Peruvian bundles from Alibaba China vendors or Guangzhou hair market for import", "Local source: Alaba International, Dosunmu Lagos, or Onitsha Main Market for wholesale distribution", "Build a customer base: 20 salons and wig shops ordering consistently = \\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a61m monthly turnover", "Offer credit to trusted buyers: 30-day net terms for established salons \\u2014 loyalty earns you repeat orders monthly", "Import directly: once volume exceeds \\u20a63m/month, direct Guangzhou imports beat local wholesale by 40\\u201360%"]', 0),
('Grant Writing & NGO Fundraising Service', 'grant-writing-ngo', '📋', 'digital', 'Write grant proposals for Nigerian NGOs, CBOs, and social enterprises targeting international donors (USAID, EU, Ford Foundation, Gates). Successful grant writers earn 5–10% of grants secured — one ₦50m grant earns ₦2.5m–₦5m.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Remote", "USD Income", "Niche", "B2B", "Google Workspace", "Notion (proposal templates)", "Donor Search Platforms (Foundation Directory)", "LinkedIn", "Payoneer"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Study successful USAID, EU, and DFID grant applications \\u2014 many are publicly available online", "Build a portfolio: write 2 grant proposals for free for registered NGOs in exchange for testimonials", "List on Idealist.org and Development Aid jobs \\u2014 \\"Grant Writer\\" and \\"Resource Mobilization Consultant\\" roles abound", "Charge: flat fee \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6500k per proposal, or success fee 5\\u201310% of grant value if awarded", "Specialize by sector: education, health, women empowerment, or climate \\u2014 deep expertise commands top fees"]', 0),
('Instagram Reels & TikTok Video Editing Service', 'instagram-reels-editing', '🎬', 'digital', 'Edit short-form video content for content creators, businesses, and influencers who create raw footage but lack editing skills. One creator on retainer pays $300–$1,500/month for 10–30 edited videos.', 1500, 40000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Remote", "USD Income", "No Capital", "Recurring", "CapCut Pro", "Adobe Premiere Rush", "Canva (thumbnails)", "Fiverr", "Payoneer"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Master CapCut (free, mobile/desktop) or Adobe Premiere Rush \\u2014 both perfect for short-form video editing", "Build a before/after portfolio: take 5 raw clips from YouTube Creative Commons and edit them into polished Reels", "Post your edits on Instagram and TikTok with \\"Edited by [Your handle]\\" \\u2014 editors get hired from their own content", "Charge: \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k per video, or $300\\u2013$1,500/month retainer for content creators needing 10\\u201330 videos/month", "Specialize: \\"Afrobeats reel editing\\", \\"fitness transformation videos\\", or \\"restaurant food content\\" \\u2014 niches pay more"]', 0),
('Borehole Drilling & Water Solutions Service', 'water-borehole-drilling', '💧', 'trade', 'Provide borehole drilling, water pump installation, and estate water supply solutions. Nigeria\'s water crisis means every estate, school, and factory is a potential client. One borehole project earns ₦500k–₦5m.', 10000, 500000, 'month', 'advanced', 1, '["Technical", "B2B", "High Capital", "Community", "Drilling Rig", "COREN Registration", "AutoCAD (site planning)", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register with COREN as a drilling company and obtain DPR or state water board approval", "Invest in: drilling rig (\\u20a61m\\u2013\\u20a65m used), mud pump, drill pipes, casing materials", "Market to: estates and gated communities (guaranteed), schools, factories, hospitals, churches", "Charge: \\u20a6300k\\u2013\\u20a61m for residential borehole (50\\u2013100m depth); \\u20a61m\\u2013\\u20a65m for commercial (150m+)", "Add O&M: water treatment systems, pump maintenance contracts at \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6200k/year \\u2014 recurring on every borehole you install"]', 0),
('Nigerian Food Products Export (Diaspora Market)', 'nigerian-food-export', '🥘', 'trade', 'Export packaged Nigerian foods — ogbono, egusi, crayfish, locust beans, dried stockfish, and zobo — to diaspora buyers in the UK, USA, and Canada. One export shipment earns $2,000–$15,000 net.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 200000, '["Export", "Agriculture", "USD Income", "B2B", "NEPC Portal", "NAFDAC Export Cert", "DHL Business Account", "Alibaba (international store)", "Payoneer"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register with NEPC and get an export permit \\u2014 free for first-time exporters", "Get NAFDAC food export certification for each product you intend to ship", "Source quality-graded products: establish direct supply from producing states (Benue for egusi, Abia for crayfish)", "Sell channels: Nigerian online stores (Yaji Foods, My Sasun), Etsy, Amazon, direct to UK/USA diaspora grocery stores", "Ship via DHL, UPS, or use a freight forwarder for palletized shipments when volume exceeds 50kg regularly"]', 0),
('Social Media Account Growth Service', 'social-media-account-growth', '📱', 'digital', 'Grow Instagram, TikTok, and LinkedIn accounts for businesses, coaches, and influencers through organic content strategy, community management, and engagement optimization. Charge ₦30k–₦150k/month per account.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["B2B", "Remote", "No Capital", "Recurring", "Later / Buffer (scheduling)", "Canva", "Instagram Insights", "TikTok Analytics", "Paystack"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Grow your own account to 5,000+ followers first \\u2014 it is your proof of concept and your portfolio", "Offer a free 30-day growth trial to one business with under 500 followers \\u2014 document the results meticulously", "Charge: Instagram management \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k/month, TikTok growth \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6100k/month, LinkedIn B2B \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6200k/month", "Services: content calendar, caption writing, hashtag strategy, DM engagement, story scheduling, analytics reports", "Scale: manage 10 accounts with 2 assistants \\u2014 \\u20a6500k+ monthly running a lean 3-person team"]', 0),
('Self-Publishing & eBook Business', 'book-publishing-self', '📗', 'digital', 'Write and self-publish practical Nigerian guides, business books, or fiction on Amazon KDP, Selar.co, and Gumroad. A well-promoted eBook earns ₦50k–₦500k/month passively after the initial effort.', 1000, 30000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Passive", "USD Income", "No Capital", "Creative", "Google Docs", "Canva (book cover)", "Selar.co", "Amazon KDP", "Mailchimp (email list)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Pick a topic where you have genuine expertise or lived experience: Nigerian business, relationship advice, career guides", "Write first draft in 30 days (1,000\\u20132,000 words/day): aim for 15,000\\u201330,000 words for a useful practical guide", "Format in Canva or Reedsy, create a professional cover (Canva), and price at \\u20a63k\\u2013\\u20a615k on Selar.co", "List on Amazon KDP for the global market \\u2014 set in $5\\u2013$15 range, earn 35\\u201370% royalty per sale", "Build an email list or WhatsApp broadcast of 2,000+ readers \\u2014 your owned audience drives book sales better than any algorithm"]', 0),
('Phone Accessories & Screen Repair Kiosk', 'phone-accessories-retail', '📱', 'trade', 'Run a phone accessories kiosk selling cases, screen protectors, chargers, and earphones, plus offering screen crack repairs and battery replacements. A busy kiosk earns ₦10k–₦50k daily.', 2000, 60000, 'day', 'beginner', 30000, '["Daily Cash", "Low Capital", "Trade", "Retail", "Kiosk or Table", "Phone Repair Kit", "POS Machine", "Wholesaler Contacts (Computer Village)", "Inventory Notebook"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Source accessories wholesale: Computer Village Lagos, Wuse Market Abuja, or directly from Alibaba/1688.com", "Rent kiosk space near a university, market entrance, or bus stop \\u2014 footfall determines everything", "Stock: screen protectors (most requested), phone cases, fast-charging cables, earbuds, portable power banks", "Add repair: screen replacement (\\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a630k), battery swap (\\u20a63k\\u2013\\u20a68k), charging port fix (\\u20a63k\\u2013\\u20a610k) \\u2014 double your income", "Hire one assistant and stay open 7am\\u20138pm \\u2014 every hour closed is money left on the table"]', 0),
('AI Avatar Video Content Creator', 'ai-video-avatar', '🎭', 'ai', 'Create professional talking-head videos using AI avatar tools like HeyGen and Synthesia — no camera, no face needed. Nigerian businesses pay ₦30k–₦200k for product explainer videos using realistic AI presenters.', 2000, 80000, 'month', 'beginner', 10000, '["AI", "No Capital", "USD Income", "Trending", "HeyGen", "Synthesia", "CapCut (editing)", "ElevenLabs (voice)", "Canva"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Master HeyGen free tier \\u2014 create 3 demo videos showing a Nigerian business explaining their service via AI avatar", "Build a portfolio: \\"explainer video\\", \\"product demo\\", \\"onboarding training video\\" \\u2014 3 niches, 3 samples", "Pitch to: online businesses, e-learning providers, HR departments creating onboarding content", "Charge: \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k per 60-second video; monthly video package (4 videos) \\u20a6150k\\u2013\\u20a6300k", "Upsell: translate the same AI video into Yoruba, Hausa, or Igbo \\u2014 language localization doubles your value"]', 0),
('Done-For-You Digital Product Reselling', 'digital-product-reseller', '📦', 'digital', 'Buy Master Resell Rights (MRR) or Private Label Rights (PLR) products — courses, ebooks, templates — and resell them as your own, keeping 100% of revenue. One viral MRR course earns ₦500k–₦5m/month.', 2000, 100000, 'month', 'beginner', 30, '["Passive", "No Capital", "Reseller", "USD Income", "Stan Store / Linktree", "Paystack / Stripe", "Canva (marketing graphics)", "TikTok", "CapCut"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Research MRR products: \\"The Roadmap\\" and similar courses sell for $497\\u2013$997 with full resell rights", "Buy the product once \\u2014 you now own rights to resell it as many times as you want at any price", "Build a simple funnel: TikTok/Instagram content \\u2192 landing page \\u2192 checkout \\u2192 automated delivery", "Drive traffic: post 3 daily TikToks or Reels about the lifestyle and value of the product", "Scale: build an email list from buyers \\u2014 promote new MRR products to existing buyers monthly"]', 0),
('Airbnb Rental Arbitrage (Short-Let)', 'airbnb-arbitrage', '🏘️', 'trade', 'Rent apartments long-term from landlords, furnish them beautifully, and re-list on Airbnb at 2–4x the monthly rent. No property ownership needed — pure margin business. Lagos and Abuja boom with tourists and corporate visitors.', 8000, 200000, 'month', 'intermediate', 300000, '["Real Estate", "Recurring", "Asset-Light", "Premium", "Airbnb Host Platform", "Canva (listing photos)", "HostAway (PMS)", "Paystack", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Negotiate with landlords: explain the short-let model and offer 20\\u201330% above market rent for permission to sublet", "Furnish with quality pieces: good bed, smart TV, fast WiFi, well-stocked kitchen \\u2014 photos sell the listing", "List on Airbnb, Hotels.ng, and WhatsApp referral network simultaneously", "Price dynamically: \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k/night weekdays; \\u20a660k\\u2013\\u20a6150k weekends and holidays", "Scale: each profitable unit funds the next \\u2014 reach 5 units in 12 months earning \\u20a62.5m\\u2013\\u20a67.5m/month combined"]', 0),
('LinkedIn Lead Generation Service', 'linkedin-lead-gen', '🎯', 'digital', 'Generate qualified B2B leads for companies and coaches using LinkedIn outreach campaigns. A well-run LinkedIn lead gen campaign generates 10–50 qualified sales conversations per month — companies pay $500–$3,000/month.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["B2B", "Remote", "USD Income", "Recurring", "LinkedIn Sales Navigator", "Dripify", "Apollo.io", "Google Sheets (tracking)", "Payoneer"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Master LinkedIn Sales Navigator (7-day free trial) and learn advanced search filters", "Build a testing framework: write 5 different outreach message sequences and A/B test response rates", "Offer a 30-day paid trial at $200 \\u2014 deliver 10 qualified conversations to prove your value", "Scale: use Dripify or Expandi for automated, personalized outreach at volume (within LinkedIn limits)", "Charge monthly: $500\\u2013$1,500 for small business, $2,000\\u2013$5,000 for SaaS companies needing enterprise leads"]', 0),
('No-Code Micro-SaaS Builder', 'micro-saas-no-code', '⚙️', 'ai', 'Build tiny, focused software tools using no-code platforms like Bubble, Glide, or WeWeb for specific industries. A SaaS tool solving one pain point at $29/month with 200 users earns $5,800 MRR — built without writing code.', 5000, 500000, 'month', 'intermediate', 50, '["Passive Income", "USD", "Tech", "Scalable", "Bubble.io", "Glide", "WeWeb", "Stripe", "Lemon Squeezy"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Find a validated pain: talk to 20 people in one industry (real estate, logistics, schools) \\u2014 listen for what they do manually", "Validate before building: create a landing page and collect 10 pre-sign-ups before writing a single line of no-code", "Build MVP in Bubble or Glide: one core feature done excellently, not ten features done poorly", "Launch on Product Hunt, X, and relevant Facebook/LinkedIn groups \\u2014 first 20 users are the hardest to get", "Price low to start ($9\\u2013$29/month), interview every churning user, and iterate obsessively on the 1 thing they want"]', 0),
('Content Creator Coaching & Monetization', 'content-creator-coaching', '🎓', 'digital', 'Coach aspiring Nigerian content creators to build, grow, and monetize their social media channels. Creators pay ₦50k–₦300k for a coach who turns their hobby into income within 90 days.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Coaching", "Recurring", "USD Income", "Social Media", "Zoom", "Notion (curriculum)", "WhatsApp Community", "Selar (payment)", "Canva"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Build your own content to 10k+ followers first \\u2014 you need a portfolio of proof before charging", "Create a structured \\"Creator to Cash\\" 8-week coaching program with clear milestones per week", "Offer group coaching cohorts (10\\u201315 creators) at \\u20a650k each = \\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a6750k per cohort, monthly", "Market: TikTok lives, Instagram Stories, and Twitter threads showing creator transformations you have helped", "Build a community: a paid Discord or WhatsApp group at \\u20a610k/month for ongoing support and accountability"]', 0),
('Amazon FBA (Fulfilment by Amazon) from Nigeria', 'amazon-fba-export', '📦', 'digital', 'Source and private-label products in Nigeria or from China and sell them on Amazon USA via FBA. Amazon stores, packs, and ships everything — you earn while sleeping. A winning product earns $3,000–$30,000/month.', 5000, 300000, 'month', 'advanced', 500, '["Export", "USD Income", "Passive", "Scalable", "Helium 10", "Jungle Scout", "Amazon Seller Central", "Alibaba", "Payoneer"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Use Helium 10 or Jungle Scout to find products with high demand, low competition, and manageable size/weight", "Source: Alibaba for Chinese manufacturers, or Nigerian artisan products (leather goods, adire, natural skincare) for unique angle", "Order 300\\u2013500 units as first batch, ship to Amazon FBA warehouse in USA (use a freight forwarder)", "Optimize listing: keyword-rich title, 7 professional photos, A+ content, 20+ verified reviews within 60 days", "Run PPC (pay-per-click) ads on Amazon \\u2014 set $20\\u2013$50/day budget, optimize weekly based on ACoS data"]', 0),
('Premium Errand Running & Concierge Service', 'errand-runner-pro', '🏃', 'trade', 'Run errands for busy Lagos and Abuja professionals: bank queues, government office submissions, airport pick-ups, bill payments, and pharmacy runs. Charge ₦3k–₦20k per errand to people who value their time over money.', 1500, 40000, 'day', 'beginner', 0, '["Daily Cash", "No Capital", "Community", "Mobile", "WhatsApp Business", "Google Maps", "OkHi (address verification)", "Paystack", "Daily Planner"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Build a verified profile: government ID, BVN verification, guarantor letter \\u2014 trust is everything in this business", "Advertise on estate WhatsApp groups: \\"Professional Errand Runner \\u2014 Verified & Insured. Bank queues, Government offices, Airport runs\\"", "Charge by complexity: simple errand \\u20a63k\\u2013\\u20a65k, bank queue \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a610k, airport run \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a630k, all-day concierge \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k", "Serve corporate clients: law firms, hospitals, and small businesses needing regular office supply runs or bank deposits", "Build a team: hire 3\\u20135 verified runners and take 30\\u201340% of each errand they complete \\u2014 scale without your own labour"]', 0),
('Nollywood & Web Series Script Writing', 'nollywood-script-writing', '🎬', 'digital', 'Write scripts for Nollywood films, YouTube web series, and Netflix Africa content. Nigerian film is a $1.6bn industry — experienced script writers earn ₦200k–₦2m per script with major studios paying in advance.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Creative", "USD Income", "Remote", "Niche", "Final Draft (screenwriting)", "Fade In (free alternative)", "Google Docs", "LinkedIn", "AFRIFF Network"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Study: read 20 Nollywood and Netflix Africa scripts \\u2014 understand the 3-act structure adapted for Nigerian culture", "Write your first spec script in a popular genre: romantic comedy, thriller, or family drama \\u2014 90\\u2013120 pages", "Register with PMAN (Performing Musicians Association) and join NIFTV (Nollywood writers community)", "Pitch to: producers via LinkedIn and Nollywood Facebook groups, attend AFRIFF (Africa International Film Festival)", "Price: indie web series \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6150k per episode; cinema feature \\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a62m; OTT (Netflix, Showmax) \\u20a62m\\u2013\\u20a68m"]', 0),
('School & Hospital Canteen Supply Contract', 'supply-school-canteen', '🍱', 'trade', 'Supply daily meals, snacks, and beverages to school canteens and hospital cafeterias under a supply agreement. One school with 500 students buying snacks at ₦500/day generates ₦250k per school day.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 50000, '["B2B", "Food", "Recurring", "Daily Cash", "WhatsApp Business", "Excel Order Tracker", "NAFDAC Notification", "Delivery Motorcycle", "Invoice Template"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Identify schools and hospitals in your area without strong canteen supply relationships \\u2014 cold-call the admin office", "Offer a 1-week trial supply for free: quality + reliability closes the long-term deal", "NAFDAC notification is mandatory for any packaged food supplied to institutions", "Price per item with 30\\u201350% gross margin minimum: your cost is \\u20a6200, charge the canteen \\u20a6300\\u2013\\u20a6350", "Expand: serve 5 schools and 1\\u20132 hospitals for a fully diversified B2B food income portfolio"]', 0),
('Podcast Sponsorship Broker & Ad Network', 'podcast-sponsorship-broker', '🎙️', 'digital', 'Connect Nigerian podcast hosts with brand sponsors and take 15–25% commission on every deal. Nigeria\'s podcast market is booming but monetization infrastructure is lacking — you fill the gap.', 3000, 90000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Creative", "Commission", "Remote", "B2B", "Canva (media packs)", "HubSpot CRM", "LinkedIn", "PayStack", "Riverside.fm (recording)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Build a roster of 10\\u201320 Nigerian podcasts across diverse niches with verified listener stats", "Create a media pack for each podcast: download numbers, audience demographics, episode frequency, engagement rate", "Pitch brands and marketing agencies: \\"Reach 50,000 Nigerian professionals for \\u20a6200k per episode placement\\"", "Standard deal: brand pays \\u20a6150k\\u2013\\u20a6500k per episode; you retain 20% (\\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a6100k per deal per show)", "Build an exclusive podcast network: own the ad sales relationships and grow the overall audience of your stable"]', 0),
('Remote Customer Service Representative', 'remote-customer-service', '📞', 'digital', 'Work remotely as a customer service agent for Nigerian and international companies handling chats, emails, and calls. Entry-level remote CS roles pay $300–$800/month; specialized tech support earns $1,000–$3,000/month.', 1500, 40000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Remote", "USD Income", "No Capital", "Beginner-Friendly", "Zendesk / Freshdesk (learn free)", "HubSpot (free cert)", "Payoneer", "Noise-Cancelling Headset", "Google Workspace"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Set up: stable internet (Starlink ideal), noise-cancelling headset, professional workspace background for video calls", "Create accounts on Indeed, Workana, Remote.co, and We Work Remotely \\u2014 filter for \\"customer support\\" and \\"remote\\"", "Apply to 10\\u201315 positions daily with a tailored cover letter emphasizing communication skills and reliability", "Get certified: HubSpot Customer Service certification (free, 6 hours) significantly boosts application acceptance", "Level up: specialize in SaaS customer success or technical support within 6\\u201312 months to 2\\u20135x your pay"]', 0),
('Wig Making & Hair Unit Business', 'hair-wig-making', '💇', 'trade', 'Make and sell custom wigs and hair units — frontals, closures, and full lace wigs. Custom wig makers charge ₦30k–₦300k per unit while raw hair costs ₦15k–₦80k. Nigeria\'s wig market is worth hundreds of millions yearly.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'beginner', 30000, '["Fashion", "Creative", "Daily Cash", "High Demand", "Instagram Business", "CapCut (reel editing)", "WhatsApp Business", "Mannequin Head", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Source hair bundles wholesale: Alaba (Lagos), Otigba (Abuja), or Alibaba China for direct import", "Learn wig construction: frontal sewing, bleaching knots, plucking hairline, customizing lace \\u2014 YouTube has everything", "Create an Instagram portfolio photographing every wig you complete on a mannequin and on a live model", "Charge by complexity: basic wig \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a660k, full lace custom \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6200k, coloured/bleached unit \\u20a6150k\\u2013\\u20a6300k", "Build a celebrity client list \\u2014 one celebrity tag in a video on Instagram drives hundreds of orders overnight"]', 0),
('Property Management Tech Platform', 'property-management-tech', '🏠', 'digital', 'Build a property management software specifically for Nigerian landlords and property managers — rent collection, tenant screening, maintenance requests, and financial reporting. The market is massive and underserved.', 10000, 500000, 'month', 'advanced', 500000, '["Real Estate", "Tech", "SaaS", "Scalable", "Bubble.io / React", "Paystack API", "Firebase", "Sendgrid (notifications)", "Notion (roadmap)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Validate first: survey 50 Lagos landlords about their biggest property management pains \\u2014 manual rent collection, tenant disputes, maintenance tracking", "Build MVP with Bubble.io or custom code: core features only \\u2014 rent reminders, payment tracking, expense log", "Price: \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k/unit/month \\u2014 a landlord with 20 units pays \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6300k/month", "Partner with property management companies: onboard their entire portfolio in exchange for a discounted rate", "Scale: white-label to real estate agencies managing hundreds of units across Nigeria"]', 0),
('Custom Sticker & Label Printing Business', 'sticker-label-printing', '🏷️', 'trade', 'Print custom product labels, sticker packs, event stickers, and business branding for SMEs who need professional-looking packaging. Every food business needs NAFDAC labels — and that alone keeps a label printer busy.', 2000, 60000, 'day', 'beginner', 100000, '["B2B", "Low Capital", "Daily Cash", "Creative", "Primera LX500 Printer", "Adobe Illustrator / Canva", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack", "Label Stock Supplier"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy a high-quality label printer: Primera LX500 or equivalent (\\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6250k) for professional output", "Offer core products: product labels, waterproof stickers, branded packaging tape, event/wedding stickers", "Target: food entrepreneurs (NAFDAC labels), beauty brands (skincare labels), events industry (personalized stickers)", "Price: 100 labels \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k depending on size and finish; rush orders at 50% premium", "Build repeat B2B clients: cosmetic brand placing monthly label orders = predictable recurring income"]', 0),
('Social Commerce: Selling via TikTok Shop & Instagram', 'social-commerce-seller', '🛍️', 'digital', 'Sell physical products directly through TikTok Shop and Instagram Shop without needing a separate website. Live selling on TikTok during flash sales generates ₦50k–₦500k in single sessions for popular products.', 2000, 80000, 'day', 'beginner', 10000, '["Trending", "Daily Cash", "No Capital", "Social Media", "TikTok Seller Center", "Instagram Shopping", "Ring Light", "Paystack / Flutterwave", "CapCut"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Register: TikTok Seller Center (for TikTok Shop), Instagram Shopping (for Instagram Shop) \\u2014 both free", "Choose fast-moving categories: phone accessories, skincare, waist trainers, hair products, miniature gadgets", "Go live daily for minimum 1 hour \\u2014 TikTok live commerce converts at 5\\u201315% during active sessions", "Run flash sales: \\"50% off in the next 10 minutes!\\" drives urgency and rapid sales spikes", "Build affiliate army: offer 10\\u201320% commission to other TikTok creators who promote your products in their videos"]', 0),
('Podcast & Video Translation into Nigerian Languages', 'podcast-translation-localization', '🌍', 'digital', 'Translate and localize English podcasts, YouTube videos, and training content into Yoruba, Hausa, or Igbo for organizations serving rural and grassroots Nigerian communities. NGOs and government agencies desperately need this.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["AI", "Niche", "Remote", "USD Income", "Adobe Premiere (subtitles)", "Descript (transcription)", "Google Docs", "Payoneer", "LinkedIn (client search)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Create a niche service page: \\"Yoruba Video Localization for NGOs and Governments\\"", "Build a portfolio: translate 2\\u20133 short YouTube explainer videos into your language and post them as samples", "Find clients: UNICEF, WHO Nigeria, NOUN, LAGOSTATE, and international NGOs with rural programs", "Charge: \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a615k per minute of translated audio/video content \\u2014 a 30-min training video = \\u20a6150k\\u2013\\u20a6450k", "Add subtitling: SRT subtitle files for YouTube in Nigerian languages \\u2014 $0.20\\u2013$0.50 per word for bilingual subtitles"]', 0),
('Print-on-Demand Children\'s Book Publisher', 'print-on-demand-books', '📖', 'digital', 'Write and publish personalized children\'s books with Nigerian characters, Afrocentric stories, and local languages. Parents pay $15–$35 per personalized book — and diaspora Nigerians are your most eager customers.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'intermediate', 5000, '["Creative", "Passive", "USD Income", "Education", "Canva (layout)", "Lulu Press / IngramSpark", "Etsy", "Procreate (illustrations)", "Payoneer"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Write a simple 24\\u201332 page children\'s story featuring Nigerian characters in everyday African settings", "Commission illustrations: Fiverr has excellent West African illustrators at $100\\u2013$500 for a full book", "Use Lulu.com or IngramSpark for print-on-demand \\u2014 no inventory, no upfront printing costs", "Sell on Etsy, Amazon, and directly to diaspora Nigerian Facebook groups (\\"Nigerian children\'s book\\")", "Create a personalization feature: customer enters child\'s name and the book auto-generates with their name \\u2014 premium pricing"]', 0),
('Mystery Shopping & Consumer Research', 'mystery-shopping-research', '🕵️', 'trade', 'Get paid to visit stores, restaurants, banks, and service locations posing as a regular customer and report on service quality. Mystery shoppers earn ₦3k–₦15k per assignment plus free food, services, or products.', 1000, 30000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Flexible", "Daily Cash", "Research", "No Capital", "MSPA Africa App", "Ipsos iSay App", "Google Maps", "Smartphone Camera", "Excel (assignment tracker)"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Register with: Ipsos Mystery Shopping, BARE International, IntelliShop, and MSPA Africa", "Complete the onboarding assessments honestly \\u2014 quality of application determines assignment quality", "Take every available assignment at first to build your rating \\u2014 higher ratings unlock better-paying assignments", "Record precisely: use their app to log observations during the visit, submit within 24 hours with photos", "Specialize: restaurant and hotel mystery shopping pays 2\\u20133x higher than retail assignments in Nigeria"]', 0),
('Digital Portrait & Caricature Art Service', 'caricature-portrait-art', '🎨', 'digital', 'Draw digital portraits and caricatures from photos for birthday gifts, wedding favors, and corporate mementos. Highly shareable on social media — one viral portrait post floods your DMs with orders.', 2000, 80000, 'day', 'beginner', 0, '["Creative", "Remote", "USD Income", "Gifting", "Procreate (iPad)", "Canva", "Instagram Reels", "Etsy", "Payoneer (international payments)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Build a portfolio of 20 digital portraits in different styles: realistic, cartoon, Afrocentric, watercolour", "Market on Instagram Reels and TikTok \\u2014 show the time-lapse of creating a portrait from photo to finished art", "Offer gifting packages: single portrait \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a630k, couple \\u20a625k\\u2013\\u20a650k, family portrait \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6150k", "Sell internationally on Etsy and Fiverr \\u2014 global demand for custom portrait art is enormous", "Add merchandise: print portrait on mug, canvas, or pillow for extra \\u20a65k\\u2013\\u20a630k per item (sublimation add-on)"]', 0),
('Franchise Consulting & Business Matching', 'franchise-consulting', '🤝', 'digital', 'Help Nigerian investors identify, evaluate, and acquire the right franchise opportunity from the 200+ franchise brands operating in Nigeria. Consultants earn ₦200k–₦2m commission per successful franchise deal matched.', 5000, 200000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["B2B", "Commission", "Consulting", "High Ticket", "NFA Directory", "LinkedIn", "Excel (deal tracker)", "Canva (brochures)", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Study: the Nigerian Franchise Association (NFA) directory and know all major franchise brands and requirements", "Build a franchise database: investment range, territory availability, training details, estimated ROI per brand", "Register with NFA as an affiliate broker \\u2014 earn 3\\u20138% referral commission on every franchise sold via your referral", "Market to: high-income individuals via LinkedIn, Facebook groups for investors, and estate community networks", "Offer a \\"Franchise Readiness Assessment\\" at \\u20a650k \\u2014 pre-sells your deep expertise before the commission deal"]', 0),
('Medical Writing & Clinical Documentation', 'medical-writing', '📄', 'digital', 'Write clinical research reports, medical device manuals, regulatory submissions, and health education materials for pharmaceutical companies and medical device manufacturers. Medical writers earn $50–$200/hour globally.', 5000, 200000, 'month', 'advanced', 0, '["Remote", "USD Income", "Niche", "Premium", "Microsoft Word", "Grammarly Pro", "PubMed", "Upwork", "Payoneer"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Get certified: AMWA (American Medical Writers Association) has excellent online training for aspiring medical writers", "Build a portfolio: write 3 mock clinical summaries or patient education leaflets using public trial data from ClinicalTrials.gov", "Create LinkedIn profile emphasizing medical background + writing skills \\u2014 recruiters search LinkedIn daily for this combination", "Apply to CROs (Contract Research Organizations): PAREXEL, ICON Plc, Covance \\u2014 all hire Nigerian medical writers remotely", "Charge: $25\\u2013$50/hour entry level, $75\\u2013$200/hour for regulatory writing (IND, NDA, clinical study reports)"]', 0),
('AI-Generated YouTube Shorts Factory', 'youtube-shorts-automation', '▶️', 'ai', 'Use AI tools to automatically generate, voice, and upload YouTube Shorts on Nigerian finance, Afrobeats facts, and African history at scale. Run 5 channels simultaneously and earn from multiple AdSense accounts.', 1500, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 20000, '["AI", "Passive", "USD", "Scalable", "Claude AI", "ElevenLabs", "CapCut Auto", "Pexels", "YouTube Studio"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Define 3 content niches with high CPM and low competition: African business facts, Nigerian investment tips, Afrobeats artist history", "Build a content pipeline: Claude AI writes scripts \\u2192 ElevenLabs voices them \\u2192 CapCut assembles with Pexels footage \\u2192 scheduled upload", "Batch-produce 50 Shorts in one day of work \\u2014 schedule daily uploads for consistent channel growth", "Apply for YouTube Partner Program at 1,000 subs + 10M Shorts views (typically 3\\u20135 months on 3 uploads/day)", "Monetize beyond AdSense: affiliate links in descriptions (Binance, Selar, courses) \\u2014 adds 50\\u2013200% to channel revenue"]', 0),
('Live Band, DJ & Wedding Entertainment', 'wedding-band-dj', '🎸', 'trade', 'Provide DJ, live band, or MC entertainment at weddings, parties, and corporate events. A single Lagos society wedding pays ₦200k–₦1.5m for entertainment. Wedding season (October–December) books solid 3 months in advance.', 5000, 200000, 'month', 'intermediate', 100000, '["Events", "Creative", "Daily Cash", "Seasonal", "Pioneer DDJ Controller", "PA Speakers", "WhatsApp Business", "Instagram (showreel)", "Event Planner Network"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Build an equipment kit: PA speakers, DJ controller, wireless mic, LED lights (\\u20a6150k\\u2013\\u20a6400k for solid starter kit)", "Film a 5-minute showreel at a friend\'s event \\u2014 this video is your most important marketing asset", "Get on event planner referral lists: build relationships with 20 Lagos/Abuja event planners who book entertainment", "Charge: MC \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6200k, DJ \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6300k, live band \\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a61.5m depending on setup size and event prestige", "Build seasonal packages: October\\u2013December weddings are premium \\u2014 book at 2x rates due to peak demand"]', 0),
('Corporate Retreat & Team Building Events', 'corporate-retreats-planner', '🏝️', 'trade', 'Plan quarterly team building activities and annual corporate retreats for companies with 20–500 employees. A 2-day retreat for 50 staff members earns ₦500k–₦3m in planning fees plus accommodation commissions.', 5000, 200000, 'month', 'intermediate', 50000, '["B2B", "Events", "Premium", "Recurring", "Canva (event brochures)", "WhatsApp Business", "Excel (event management)", "LinkedIn (corporate outreach)", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Build a catalogue of team building activities: outdoor adventure, cooking competition, sports day, skills workshops", "Partner with resort hotels, farms, and activity venues across Lagos, Abuja, Ibadan, and Jos", "Create compelling corporate retreat packages: 2-day standard \\u20a650k/person, 3-day premium \\u20a680k/person", "Pitch to corporate HR and L&D departments: \\"Your team works hard \\u2014 we handle the rest\\"", "Earn multi-revenue streams: planning fee \\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6500k + 15\\u201320% commission on accommodation and activities booked"]', 0),
('African Webtoon & Digital Comics Creator', 'graphic-novels-webtoons', '📱', 'digital', 'Create a digital comic series or webtoon set in Nigerian mythology, Nollywood universe, or Afrofuturist settings. Webtoon platforms pay creators from ad revenue; top African creators earn $2,000–$20,000/month.', 1000, 50000, 'month', 'intermediate', 30000, '["Creative", "USD Income", "Passive", "Scalable", "Procreate / Clip Studio Paint", "Webtoon Canvas", "Instagram", "Patreon", "Canva"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Develop a compelling concept: Nigerian mythology reimagined, Afrofuturist sci-fi, or contemporary Lagos drama", "Create the first 5 episodes (10\\u201320 panels each) before launching \\u2014 readers expect consistent updates", "Publish on: Webtoon Canvas (free, global audience), Tapas.io, and Instagram as a webcomic page", "Monetize on Webtoon: ad revenue once you hit 1,000 subscribers; fast-pass coins from premium readers", "Build a Patreon for early access and behind-the-scenes content \\u2014 dedicated fans pay $3\\u2013$25/month"]', 0),
('School Management Software Sales & Support', 'school-management-software', '🏫', 'digital', 'Resell and implement school management platforms (SchoolSync, Schooltrac, Eduprime) for private schools across Nigeria. A school of 200 students paying ₦15k/term in software fees earns you ₦5k–₦8k/term commission.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Tech", "B2B", "SaaS Reseller", "Recurring", "SchoolSync / Fedena", "Zoom (training)", "WhatsApp Business", "Canva (demo presentations)", "Paystack"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Register as a reseller partner with SchoolSync NG, Fedena, or SIMS Nigeria \\u2014 all offer free partner programs", "Build your pitch: \\"One tool for fees, attendance, results, communication, and reports \\u2014 from \\u20a615k/term\\"", "Target: private nursery and primary schools with 50\\u2013500 students \\u2014 they need systems but lack IT staff to implement", "Earn: 30\\u201350% of first year subscription + 10\\u201320% renewal commission annually per school", "Offer implementation support: set up the software, train teachers, and migrate historical data \\u2014 charge \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6150k per school"]', 0),
('Smart Irrigation & Drip Farming System Installation', 'smart-irrigation-install', '🌊', 'trade', 'Install automated drip irrigation and smart watering systems for commercial farms, kitchen gardens, and greenhouses. Precision irrigation reduces water use by 60% and increases yield — farmers pay ₦200k–₦3m per installation.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'intermediate', 100000, '["Agriculture", "Tech", "Green", "B2B", "Drip Tape", "Solar Pump", "Solenoid Valve Controller", "IoT Moisture Sensor", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Learn drip irrigation design: pipe sizing, emitter spacing, pump selection, and controller programming \\u2014 YouTube + IITA resources", "Source materials locally: drip tape, PVC fittings, solenoid valves, solar pump controllers from Alaba International", "Install a free demo system on a 0.5-acre plot near you \\u2014 document water savings and yield increase over 3 months", "Target: commercial farms (cassava, tomato, vegetables), greenhouses, and affluent home kitchen gardens", "Add IoT smart control: Xiaomi or Tuya soil moisture sensors + phone app for remote irrigation monitoring \\u2014 premium add-on"]', 0),
('NFT Ticketing & Digital Collectibles for Events', 'nft-utility-platform', '🎟️', 'digital', 'Build and sell NFT-based tickets and collectibles for Nigerian concerts, sports events, and cultural festivals. NFT tickets prevent counterfeiting, enable royalties on resale, and create collector communities.', 10000, 300000, 'month', 'advanced', 200000, '["Crypto", "Events", "Tech", "Innovative", "Solana Blockchain", "Metaplex", "Phantom Wallet", "React / Next.js", "WhatsApp Community"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Build on Solana (cheapest gas fees) using Metaplex \\u2014 ideal for ticketing and collectibles at scale", "Partner with a mid-size concert promoter: offer to tokenize their next event\'s tickets free, earn 10% of resale royalties", "Design collector-tier tiers: General (no NFT), VIP (NFT collectible), Premium (NFT + backstage access)", "Market the NFT angle as innovation and anti-fraud \\u2014 Nigerian event fraud is a \\u20a6500m+/year problem you are solving", "Scale: become the go-to NFT ticketing platform for Nigerian music, comedy, and cultural festivals"]', 0),
('Courier Aggregator & Shipping Comparison Platform', 'courier-aggregator', '🚚', 'digital', 'Build a platform that compares prices across GIG, DHL, GIGL, Sendbox, and Kwik Delivery for e-commerce sellers and importers. Earn per shipment booked — even 5% of ₦1m/month in bookings = ₦50k monthly passive.', 5000, 300000, 'month', 'advanced', 300000, '["Logistics", "Tech", "B2B", "Scalable", "Shipbubble API", "Next.js / React", "Paystack API", "Firebase", "Notion (roadmap)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Partner with 5+ courier APIs: Shipbubble API, GIG API, Sendbox API \\u2014 most offer affiliate programs with 2\\u20135% per shipment", "Build a simple web/app interface: user enters package dimensions \\u2192 gets 5 price quotes \\u2192 books in 1 click", "Target e-commerce sellers on Jumia, Konga, and WhatsApp: they ship 5\\u201350 parcels/day and hate manual price checking", "Earn: 2\\u20135% commission per shipment booked via your platform \\u2014 volume is everything", "Build sticky features: shipment tracking dashboard, monthly spend reports, bulk booking discounts for high-volume sellers"]', 0),
('Natural Nigerian Hair Care Brand', 'hair-care-brand', '💆', 'trade', 'Formulate and sell natural shea butter, black castor oil, and ayurvedic hair growth products using locally-sourced Nigerian ingredients. Authentic African hair care products command premium prices globally.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 20000, '["FMCG", "Brand Building", "Export", "Health", "NAFDAC Portal", "Canva (product design)", "Instagram / TikTok", "Etsy (export)", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Source: raw shea butter from Kano (\\u20a6800\\u2013\\u20a61,500/kg), castor oil from Kwara, aloe vera gel from local farms", "Learn basic cosmetic formulation: hair butter, hair growth oil, edge control gel \\u2014 free recipes on YouTube", "Get NAFDAC cosmetic notification number \\u2014 mandatory before selling packaged cosmetics commercially", "Build brand identity: name, packaging, brand story highlighting Nigerian ingredients and heritage", "Export: UK and USA natural hair communities on Etsy and Amazon pay $15\\u2013$40 per product \\u2014 strong export market"]', 0),
('Tech Product Review & Comparison Channel', 'tech-product-review-channel', '📱', 'digital', 'Build a YouTube, TikTok, or Instagram channel reviewing Nigerian market electronics, smartphones, and gadgets. Tech channels with 100k subscribers earn $500–$5,000/month from AdSense, brand deals, and affiliate sales.', 2000, 80000, 'month', 'beginner', 30000, '["Passive", "Social Media", "Affiliate", "USD Income", "Smartphone (latest flagship)", "DJI Osmo (stabilizer)", "YouTube Studio", "TubeBuddy", "Amazon Associates"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Focus on Nigerian market: review devices available at Slot, Fouani, Computer Village \\u2014 your audience wants local context", "Create comparison videos: \\"iPhone 15 vs Samsung S24 in Nigeria \\u2014 which is worth it at \\u20a6800k?\\" \\u2192 very high search volume", "Apply for Konga, Jumia, and Amazon Associates affiliate programs \\u2014 earn 4\\u201310% on every product purchase you drive", "Get loaner devices from brands: Tecno, Infinix, and itel regularly give devices to reviewers with 10k+ followers", "Sponsor spot deals: \\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6800k per sponsored video when you hit 100k subscribers in tech niche"]', 0),
('Bulk SMS & WhatsApp Marketing Service', 'bulk-sms-whatsapp-marketing', '📲', 'digital', 'Help businesses reach their customers through bulk SMS campaigns and WhatsApp broadcast marketing. Every Nigerian business with a customer database needs this — and most have no idea how to do it properly.', 2000, 60000, 'month', 'beginner', 5000, '["B2B", "Recurring", "Tech", "Daily Cash", "Termii / Wigal SMS API", "WhatsApp Business API", "Canva (message graphics)", "Excel (campaign tracking)", "Paystack"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Register with SMS platforms: Termii, Wigal, or InfoBip \\u2014 all have Nigerian presence and competitive rates", "Learn WhatsApp Business API: offers broadcasts to unlimited numbers with detailed open and click tracking", "Build client packages: \\u20a620k\\u2013\\u20a650k/month including campaign strategy, message writing, and send management", "Target: banks, churches, hospitals, schools, fashion brands \\u2014 any business with a customer list of 500+ contacts", "Add reporting: show open rates, click rates, and revenue generated from campaigns \\u2014 data justifies premium pricing"]', 0),
('Visa Interview & Study Abroad Coaching', 'visa-interview-coaching', '🛫', 'digital', 'Coach Nigerians preparing for US, UK, Canada, and Schengen visa interviews. Visa rejection rate for Nigerians is 40–60% — a good coach improves success rates dramatically. Families pay ₦50k–₦200k for coaching.', 3000, 90000, 'month', 'beginner', 0, '["Education", "Coaching", "High Ticket", "Remote", "Zoom", "Notion (coaching materials)", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack", "Canva (workbooks)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Build expertise: study each visa type\'s interview format, common questions, and rejection reasons \\u2014 document your knowledge systematically", "Build credibility: post visa success stories (with permission) on Instagram and LinkedIn \\u2014 social proof is everything", "Offer a free \\"Visa Readiness Checklist\\" to build your email list and demonstrate your knowledge depth", "Charge: B1/B2 USA coaching \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6100k; UK Student visa package \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6150k; Canada PR coaching \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6200k", "Create a group coaching program: 10 students in a cohort at \\u20a650k each = \\u20a6500k per 4-week programme"]', 0),
