('After-School Enrichment Programme', 'afterschool-enrichment-program', '🏫', 'trade', 'Run supervised after-school programs for primary school children covering homework support, Maths enrichment, chess, robotics, or arts and crafts. Lagos and Abuja parents pay ₦15k–₦50k/month per child.', 3000, 100000, 'month', 'beginner', 20000, '["Education", "Recurring", "Community", "Daily Cash", "Whiteboard + Markers", "Scratch (coding for kids)", "Chess Sets", "WhatsApp Group", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Develop a structured programme: 3 hours after school (3pm\\u20136pm), Monday\\u2013Friday \\u2014 homework 1 hour, enrichment 2 hours", "Secure a space: church hall, community center, or your own home (max 20 children per room)", "Offer variety: Maths enrichment, coding (Scratch), chess, speech and debate, drama \\u2014 different parents want different things", "Charge: \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a640k/month per child; offer sibling discounts of 20\\u201330% to attract families with multiple children", "Market: school gate during pickup, WhatsApp parenting groups, and estate notice boards during September resumption rush"]', 0),
