('Business Plan & Pitch Deck Writing', 'business-plan-writing', '📑', 'digital', 'Write detailed business plans, feasibility studies, and investor pitch decks for Nigerian entrepreneurs seeking loans, grants, or investment. A comprehensive business plan earns ₦80k–₦500k; an investor deck earns more.', 3000, 90000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["B2B", "Remote", "High Ticket", "Finance", "Microsoft Word / Google Docs", "Excel (financial models)", "Canva (pitch decks)", "LinkedIn", "Paystack"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Build a template library: 10 industry-specific business plan frameworks (food, tech, health, agro, services) ready to customize", "Create a portfolio: write a detailed business plan for a fictional Nigerian business and publish excerpts on LinkedIn", "Charge: executive summary \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a650k, full business plan \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6200k, investor pitch deck \\u20a6100k\\u2013\\u20a6300k", "Target: BOI loan applicants, Tony Elumelu Foundation applicants, LAPO and CBN grant seekers \\u2014 all require business plans", "Add financials as a premium service: 3-year financial projections and break-even analysis at \\u20a650k\\u2013\\u20a6100k add-on"]', 0),
('Jumia & Konga Dropshipping Business', 'dropshipping-jumia-konga', '🛒', 'digital', 'List products on Jumia and Konga that you source from manufacturers and suppliers only when a customer orders — zero inventory, zero warehouse. A well-managed Jumia dropshipping store earns ₦50k–₦500k/month.', 2000, 60000, 'week', 'beginner', 10000, '["No Capital", "Daily Cash", "E-commerce", "Scalable", "Jumia Seller Center", "Konga Seller Hub", "WhatsApp (supplier coordination)", "Excel Inventory", "Google Sheets"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Open a Jumia Seller account (free) and a Konga Seller account \\u2014 both have easy onboarding", "Identify trending products on both platforms: electronics accessories, kitchen gadgets, beauty tools, fashion items", "Source local suppliers (Alaba, Trade Fair, Otigba) willing to drop-ship on demand \\u2014 negotiate pricing and turnaround", "List products at 30\\u201360% markup; when ordered, contact supplier who ships directly to the customer", "Optimize: products with 4+ star reviews and high order counts rank best \\u2014 use these insights to grow your catalog"]', 0),
('AI-Powered Tutoring Platform for Nigerian Students', 'ai-powered-tutor', '🤖', 'digital', 'Build a personalized AI tutoring platform for WAEC, JAMB, and university subjects using GPT-4 and past question databases. A platform with 5,000 subscribers at ₦2,000/month earns ₦10m/month in recurring revenue.', 10000, 500000, 'month', 'advanced', 300000, '["EdTech", "AI", "Scalable", "Recurring", "OpenAI API / Anthropic Claude API", "React / Flutter", "Firebase", "Paystack Subscription", "Notion (product roadmap)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Build a database of 10,000+ WAEC and JAMB past questions organized by subject and year", "Integrate GPT-4 API to generate explanations, hints, and step-by-step solutions for any question the student submits", "Build a simple web app: student selects subject \\u2192 takes a practice quiz \\u2192 AI explains every wrong answer", "Price: \\u20a61,500\\u2013\\u20a63,000/month subscription; offer family plans at \\u20a65,000/month (3 students)", "Partner with schools: school licensing deal at \\u20a6500k\\u2013\\u20a62m/year gives you 200\\u2013500 students immediately"]', 0),
('Digital Nomad Community & Remote Work Hub', 'digital-nomad-community', '🌍', 'digital', 'Build a paid community for Nigerians transitioning to remote work and digital nomadism. 500 members at ₦5,000/month = ₦2.5m/month for curating job boards, skill training, and networking.', 2000, 80000, 'month', 'intermediate', 0, '["Community", "Recurring", "Education", "Lifestyle", "WhatsApp Community / Circle.so", "Selar (membership)", "Canva", "TikTok", "Airtable (job board)"]', '["Online", "Lagos", "Abuja"]', '["Start a free WhatsApp/Telegram group: \\"Remote Jobs Nigeria\\" \\u2014 grow to 1,000+ members with daily job postings", "Launch paid tier: \\u20a63k\\u2013\\u20a65k/month for curated remote job listings, CV review, interview coaching, and Slack community access", "Drive growth: TikTok and YouTube content on \\"how I got my first remote job from Nigeria\\" \\u2014 massive organic reach", "Add courses: \\"Remote Work Starter Kit\\" at \\u20a615k\\u2013\\u20a630k \\u2014 sell to every new community member", "Build partner revenue: take 15\\u201320% commission from remote work placement agencies for every member they hire"]', 0),
('Executive Car Hire & Chauffeur Service', 'executive-transport', '🚘', 'trade', 'Provide professional chauffeur-driven car hire to executives, diplomats, NGO visitors, and corporate clients. Long-term executive transport contracts with corporations pay ₦200k–₦600k/month per vehicle.', 5000, 150000, 'month', 'intermediate', 2, '["Premium", "Transport", "Recurring", "B2B", "WhatsApp Business", "Google Maps", "Fuel Tracker App", "Invoice App (Wave)", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Acquire: clean Toyota Camry or Prado (2018+), serviced and immaculate \\u2014 presentation is everything at this level", "Build a professional presence: business cards, WhatsApp Business with professional profile, website (basic)", "Target: embassies and consulates, multinational company HR, hotel concierges (they refer corporate guests constantly)", "Charge: half-day (4 hours) \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a660k, full-day \\u20a660k\\u2013\\u20a6120k, monthly retainer \\u20a6200k\\u2013\\u20a6600k per corporate client", "Scale: add vehicles one by one \\u2014 each vehicle fully utilized on a corporate contract is self-funding the next purchase"]', 0),
('Rooftop & Container Urban Farming', 'rooftop-urban-garden', '🌱', 'trade', 'Grow vegetables, herbs, and microgreens in containers, grow bags, and raised beds on rooftops, balconies, and patios in Lagos and Abuja. Sell fresh produce to restaurants, juice bars, and health-conscious consumers.', 1000, 30000, 'week', 'beginner', 10000, '["Agriculture", "Urban", "Community", "Daily Cash", "Grow Bags", "Potting Mix + Compost", "Drip Irrigation Kit", "WhatsApp Business", "Paystack"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Start with fast-growing, high-value crops: spinach (3 weeks), ugwu (4 weeks), basil (3 weeks), cherry tomatoes (8 weeks)", "Use grow bags and containers \\u2014 no need to own land; rooftop of rented apartment works perfectly", "Build a WhatsApp subscriber list: restaurants, juice bars, and health-food stores that want fresh local produce weekly", "Price premium: \\"Rooftop Grown, Zero Pesticide\\" organic produce sells at 2\\u20133x market price to the right buyers", "Expand: offer urban farm setup consultations at \\u20a630k\\u2013\\u20a680k \\u2014 teach families to grow their own food for income"]', 0),
('Photo Booth & Event Photography Package', 'event-photo-booth', '📷', 'trade', 'Set up a branded photo booth at weddings, birthday parties, and corporate events. Guests pay ₦500–₦2,000 per print; event organizers pay ₦80k–₦300k for the full booth package. Events happen every weekend in Nigeria.', 5000, 150000, 'week', 'beginner', 150000, '["Events", "Creative", "Daily Cash", "B2B", "Mirrorless Camera", "Canon Selphy Printer", "LumaBooth App", "Branded Backdrop", "WhatsApp Business"]', '["Lagos", "Abuja", "Port Harcourt", "Nationwide"]', '["Buy: DSLR + mirrorless camera, portable dye-sublimation printer (Hiti S420/Canon Selphy), ring light, and backdrop stand", "Set up digital photo booth software: Darkroom Booth (Mac) or LumaBooth \\u2014 adds digital sharing, GIF, and boomerang features", "Build an event planner referral network \\u2014 photo booths are rarely the main vendor but get booked when planners mention them", "Charge event organizer: \\u20a680k\\u2013\\u20a6200k flat rate including unlimited prints for 4 hours; digital-only package at \\u20a650k", "Add revenue streams: digital GIF booth for corporate events \\u20a6150k\\u2013\\u20a6300k; green screen customization +\\u20a630k"]', 0);

